// 英语(自动生成): 31 章 / 184 知识点
window.WGZX_DATA.subjects.push({"slug":"english","name":"英语","icon":"Languages","color":"#ca8a04","description":"词汇语法、时态从句、教材课文与书面表达范文","order":3,"chapterCount":31,"kpCount":184,"coreCount":123,"extCount":61,"chapters":[{"uid":"english-1","name":"语音与词汇","grade":"七年级上册","order":0,"kps":[{"uid":"english-1-1","title":"48个国际音标与拼读规则","content":"英语共有48个国际音标,其中元音20个、辅音28个。元音分单元音12个与双元音8个;长元音 /iː/ /ɑː/ /ɔː/ /uː/ /ɜː/ 发音饱满,短元音 /ɪ/ /e/ /æ/ /ʌ/ /ɒ/ /ʊ/ /ə/ 短促干脆。辅音清浊成对,如 /p/与/b/、/t/与/d/、/k/与/g/,清辅音声带不振动,浊辅音振动。学习音标的目标是「见词能读、听音能写」: 掌握字母组合与读音的对应,如 ee 读 /iː/(see)、sh 读 /ʃ/(ship)、ch 读 /tʃ/(chair),就能自主拼读生词,这是记单词的地基。","keyPoints":["元音20个=单元音12(长元音5+短元音7)+双元音8","辅音28个, 清浊成对: /p/-/b/, /t/-/d/, /k/-/g/, /s/-/z/","双元音8个: /eɪ/ /aɪ/ /ɔɪ/ /aʊ/ /əʊ/ /ɪə/ /eə/ /ʊə/","字母组合记读音: ee/iː/, ea/iː/, sh/ʃ/, th/θ/或/ð/, ck/k/","口诀: 辅音轻元音亮, 先辅后元连成腔"],"example":"例: school 的音标是 /skuːl/。解析: /s/ 之后的清辅音 /k/ 要浊化,实际读起来近似 /sguːl/,同类还有 sky、star、sport 中的 /k/ /t/ /p/。掌握 /s/ 后清辅音浊化的规律,读音才地道,听力辨音题也常考这一点。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["基础必会","记忆口诀"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-1-2","title":"开音节与闭音节读音规律","content":"音节类型决定元音字母的读音。开音节有两种: 以发音的元音字母结尾的绝对开音节(he, go, hi);「辅音+元音+辅音+e(不发音)」结构的相对开音节(name, bike, home, cute)。开音节中元音字母读字母本音: a读/eɪ/,e读/iː/,i读/aɪ/,o读/əʊ/,u读/juː/。闭音节以「元音字母+辅音字母(r除外)」结尾,如 cat、desk、big、box、bus,元音字母读短音 /æ/ /e/ /ɪ/ /ɒ/ /ʌ/。一个不发音的e就能改变读音: hat→hate, bit→bite。掌握规律可批量记单词: make-take-lake 同规律。","keyPoints":["开音节读字母本音: a/eɪ/, e/iː/, i/aɪ/, o/əʊ/, u/juː/","绝对开音节: 元音字母结尾(he, go); 相对开音节: 辅+元+辅+e(name, cute)","闭音节读短音: a/æ/, e/e/, i/ɪ/, o/ɒ/, u/ʌ/","重读闭音节变形时双写尾字母: stop-stopped, run-running","对比记忆: hat/hæt/与hate/heɪt/只差一个不发音的e"],"example":"例: 选出划线部分读音不同的单词: A. face B. cake C. map D. name。解析: A、B、D 中的 a 处于开音节读 /eɪ/,C 项 map 中 a 处于闭音节读 /æ/,故选C。语音辨析题先判断音节类型,再定读音,思路清晰不出错。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["基础必会","记忆口诀"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-1-3","title":"构词法: 合成与派生","content":"构词法是词汇量翻倍的钥匙，三大类口诀： 「合成拼词，派生加缀，转化换性」。合成法： 两个词拼成新词： classroom, blackboard, afternoon, grandparents, basketball；合成形容词： a five-day trip, an eight-year-old boy(内部用单数并连字符)。派生法： 词根+前缀/后缀。前缀改意义： un-(不)： happy→unhappy, usual→unusual；dis-(否定)： agree→disagree, like→dislike；re-(再)： rewrite, return, reuse；mis-(误)： understand→misunderstand。后缀改词性： -er/-or表人(teacher, visitor, inventor)；-ist表主义者或从业者(scientist, artist)；-tion表名词(invent→invention, educate→education)；-ment表名词(develop→development)；-ness表名词(kind→kindness, ill→illness)；-ful表充满(use→useful)；-less表没有(use→useless, care→careless)；-ly形容词变副词(careful→carefully)；-y表有...特征(rain→rainy, cloud→cloudy)；-able表能够(accept→acceptable)。例句： ①With the development of science, our life is becoming more and more colorful.(development名词化) ②It is necessary for us to practice speaking English every day.(necessary形容词) ③Unluckily, he failed the exam again.(unluckily否定副词)。解题先认词根再辨前后缀。","keyPoints":["合成词: 名+名(classroom)；形+名(blackboard)；合成形容词内部用单数: a five-day trip","否定前缀: un-/dis-；再: re-；误: mis-","名词后缀: -er/-or/-ist(人)， -tion/-ment/-ness(抽象名词)","形容词后缀: -ful(充满)/-less(没有)/-y(多...的)/-able(能够)","-ly形容词变副词；副词提前可修饰整句: Luckily, ..."],"example":"例: To my surprise, the ___ (visit) can speak Chinese so well. 解析: 空前有 the、空后 can speak,缺「游客」这一名词,visit 加后缀 -or 变 visitor。先判断词性(名词),再选后缀(-er/-or/-tion/-ness),是构词法填空的通用解法。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： 合成形容词内部用复数： a five-days trip应为five-day。错误二： visitor拼成 visiter(直接加or)。错误三： un-与dis-乱配： unlike应为dislike(不喜欢)，unusual不能说disusual。错误四： 派生词词性判断错导致填空错位： 需要名词却写了形容词。","examFocus":"语篇填空最高频考法： 给提示词按句子成分定词性再加后缀。单选考词义辨析。得分关键： 空格缺什么词性，就派生什么词性。","tags":["基础必会","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-1-4","title":"词义猜测方法","content":"中考阅读明确考查根据上下文猜测词义的能力，五大方法口诀： 「拆词看缀，定义释义，同义反义，因果推理，语境常识」。①构词法猜词： unluckily由lucky加否定前缀与副词后缀推出「不幸地」。②定义解释法： 生词后常有that is, in other words, or(即)， 同位语与破折号提供释义。③同义反义法： and, or, but, however连接的已知词是线索： He is so diligent, and he never wastes a minute.(diligent与never wastes同向)。④因果推测法： because, so, as a result前后的逻辑推出词义。⑤语境常识法： 依据话题与生活经验判断。答题三步： 定位生词→找上下文线索→把猜测代回原文验证通顺。例句示范： ①The river is polluted, so many fish died.(由so后结果推polluted为「被污染」) ②He is a workaholic; he works twelve hours a day without rest.(后文释义： 工作狂) ③The old man is poor but he is always cheerful, smiling at everyone.(but反义线索推cheerful为「开朗的」)。记住： 猜词靠证据，证据全在原文里。","keyPoints":["第一反应用构词法: 前缀+词根+后缀","释义信号词: that is, in other words, such as, or(即)","逻辑信号词: but(反义线索)， and(同义线索)， because/so(因果线索)","猜出词义必须代回原文验证","指代题也用就近原则: 找最近的名词或从句"],"example":"例: The Smiths are vegetarians. In other words, they never eat meat. 猜测 vegetarian 的含义。解析: In other words 之后的 they never eat meat 正是对生词的解释,由此推出 vegetarian 意为「素食者」。「生词+解释信号词」是词义猜测题最经典的模式。","extension":"构词法是猜词第一利器: 平时按词缀整理词汇(如 -tion 家族: action, invention, pollution), 猜词命中率与词汇量会同步上升。","traps":"错误一： 只凭单词长相乱猜，不回原文找证据。错误二： 把熟词生义当生词： last(v.持续)在文中不是「最后的」。错误三： 忽略指代： it/they指代对象跨句，就近寻找。错误四： 猜完不代回验证，导致句意矛盾。","examFocus":"阅读词义猜测题每年必考1至2道；完形也依赖猜词能力。得分关键： 先拆词缀，再找上下文逻辑信号词。","tags":["拓展提升","答题模板"],"difficulty":2,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-1-5","title":"熟词生义: 中考阅读中的一词多义","content":"中考阅读的最大隐形杀手是「认得的词不认识它的义」，口诀「熟词别脸熟，语境定身份」。高频熟词生义清单： book(n.书/v.预订)： I booked two tickets online. last(adj.最后的/v.持续)： The rain lasted for three days. sound(n.声音/v.听起来)： That sounds like a good idea. well(n.井/adv.好/adj.健康的)。 light(n.光/adj.轻的/v.点亮)。 train(n.火车/v.训练)： The company will train the new workers. park(n.公园/v.停车)： You can not park your car here. bear(n.熊/v.忍受)： I can not bear the noise. capital(n.首都/n.资本/adj.大写的)。 fan(n.迷/风扇)： He is a big fan of Jay Chou. match(n.比赛/火柴/v.与...相配)： The tie matches your suit. firm(n.公司/adj.坚定的)。 still(adj.静止的/adv.仍然)。例句： ①The sound of the music sounds sweet.(两义对照) ②We waited till the light turned green.(交通灯) ③Can you bear the pain？(忍受)。做题步骤： 把常见义代入若句意不通，立即检索该词的动词/名词第二身份。","keyPoints":["book预订；last持续；sound听起来","light光/轻的/点亮；train训练；park停车","bear忍受；capital首都/资本","fan迷/风扇；match比赛/火柴/相配","still静止的/仍然；well井/好/健康的"],"example":"例题： The word \"firm\" in the passage probably means ______. A.a strong man B.a company C.a building D.an idea 解析： 原文语境 He works in a firm that makes shoes.——in提示firm是工作单位，选B公司。语境(in/works)是判定义的唯一证据。","extension":"进阶： 阅读推断词义时把「词性」也纳入判断： 若名词义不通，试动词义；一词多义题本质是「词性+语境」双定位。","traps":"错误一： 死记第一义硬套导致句意矛盾。错误二： 把v.形式的熟词(如match相配)当名词理解。错误三： 忽略语境暗示(in/on/works类线索词)。错误四： 猜完不代回验证。","examFocus":"阅读词义题与完形语境题的深层能力；任务型阅读词形转换也依赖。得分关键： 记熟15个高频多义词的第二身份。","tags":["词汇拓展","阅读能力"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"}]},{"uid":"english-2","name":"名词与冠词","grade":"七年级上册","order":1,"kps":[{"uid":"english-2-1","title":"名词分类与规则复数","content":"名词分可数与不可数。不可数名词如 water、bread、rice、news、advice、information 没有复数,计量用「数词+量词+of」: a piece of advice, two glasses of milk。可数名词复数规则: 一般加-s(books);以 s、x、ch、sh 结尾加-es(boxes, watches);辅音字母+y 结尾变 y 为 i 加-es(baby→babies);以 f/fe 结尾多变-ves(knife→knives, leaf→leaves);以 o 结尾多数加-s(photo, piano, radio),少数加-es,口诀「黑人英雄吃土豆西红柿」(negroes, heroes, potatoes, tomatoes)。做题先判断可数与否,再套变化规则。","keyPoints":["口诀: s/x/ch/sh结尾加es","辅音+y: y变i加es(baby→babies); 元音+y直接加s(boy→boys)","f/fe变ves: knife→knives, wife→wives, leaf→leaves","o结尾: 加es的黑人英雄土豆西红柿; 其余加s(photo, radio, zoo)","不可数名词计量: a piece of paper, three bowls of rice"],"example":"例: There are some ___ (tomato) and ___ (photo) on the table. 解析: tomato 属「黑人英雄土豆西红柿」,加-es 填 tomatoes;photo 直接加-s 填 photos。同以 o 结尾变化不同,是命题人最爱的对比设计。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["基础必会","记忆口诀","易错点"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-2-2","title":"不规则复数与名词所有格","content":"不规则名词复数分类口诀： 「男女脚牙鼠变oo， child加ren， sheep鹿中式不变身」。man→men, woman→women, foot→feet, tooth→teeth, mouse→mice；child→children；单复同形： sheep, deer, Chinese, Japanese, fish(指条数)；只以复数出现： people, police, clothes, glasses, trousers；复合名词「男女在前要双变」： a man teacher→two men teachers。名词所有格规则： 有生命名词在词尾加撇号s，书写示范： Tom's room(汤姆的房间)；以s结尾的复数名词只加撇号，如the teachers' office(老师们的办公室)；不规则复数仍加撇号s，如children's books(儿童读物)；无生命名词多用of短语，如the legs of the table(桌腿)。双重所有格： a friend of my mother's(我妈妈朋友中的一位)。例句： ①There are two women doctors in the hospital.(woman doctors→women doctors) ②This is Tom's desk; that one is Lily's.(名词所有格) ③This is a picture of my family's.(双重所有格)。","keyPoints":["不规则复数: man→men, foot→feet, child→children, mouse→mice","单复同形: sheep/deer/fish(条数)/Chinese；people与police本身表复数","复合名词男女双变: two men teachers","有生命名词用撇号s所有格；无生命用of短语","以s结尾的复数名词只加撇号；不规则复数加撇号s"],"example":"例: — Whose room is this? — It's ___ (Lucy and Lily). They live together. 解析: 由 They live together 可知姐妹共用一间房,只在最后一个名字后加 's,填 Lucy and Lily's。若填 Lucy's and Lily's 则表示「各自的房间」,与单数 room 矛盾。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： two womans teachers应为two women teachers。错误二： The Chinese is hard-working应为are(Chinese表中国人复数)。错误三： 所有格撇号误加在复数上： the teachers's office应为teachers'。错误四： of所有格与撇号s混用造成双重标记。","examFocus":"单选考不规则复数与所有格形式；语篇填空考名词单复数判断。得分关键： 记住「男女脚牙鼠、child加ren」两组清单。","tags":["基础必会","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-2-3","title":"冠词a/an/the用法对比","content":"冠词三兄弟分工口诀： 「a/an泛指初见面，the特指老朋友」。a/an用于泛指单数可数名词第一次出现： There is a book on the desk. a与an的分工看「读音」不看字母： a+辅音音素，an+元音音素： an hour(h不发音)， a university(ju辅音)， an honest boy， a one-eyed pirate(wan辅音)。the用于： ①第二次提到： The book is mine. ②双方共知： Open the door, please. ③独一无二： the sun, the moon, the sky ④序数词与最高级前： the first, the best ⑤乐器前： play the piano ⑥姓氏复数表一家人： the Greens。例句： ①I have a pen. The pen was given by my uncle.(首提a，再提the) ②The moon goes around the earth.(独一无二) ③He plays the piano every day.(乐器)。做题三步： 判断泛指特指→判断读音定a/an→检查the专属场景。","keyPoints":["a/an泛指首次出现；the特指双方共知","a/an看读音: an hour, a university, an honest boy","the用于独一无二/序数词/最高级/乐器前","姓氏复数加the表一家人: the Greens","第二次提到用the"],"example":"例: This is ___ interesting book, and ___ book is about Chinese history. 解析: 第一空首次提到且 interesting 以元音音素开头,填 an;第二空第二次提到用 the。填 an, the。「首提与再提」是冠词题的第一套路。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： an university(读juː是辅音音素，应为a university)。错误二： 特指场景漏the: Sun rises in the east应为The sun。错误三： 球类前加the(play the basketball错误，应为play basketball)。错误四： 三餐与球类、学科混入the。","examFocus":"单选与语篇填空双高频： 语篇填空无提示词空格首先考虑冠词。得分关键： 泛指看读音，特指出场景。","tags":["基础必会","易错点","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-2-4","title":"零冠词与冠词易错点","content":"零冠词清单口诀： 「球类三餐学科语言，节假日交通by专有」。球类运动： play football/basketball；三餐： have breakfast/lunch/dinner；学科语言： Math is interesting. / He can speak English.；节假日： National Day is coming.；交通方式： by bus/by bike；专有名词： China, Beijing；称呼与头衔： Mr. Green, President Lincoln；季节与泛指复数： Winter is cold. / Dogs are loyal. 高频易混搭配对照： in hospital(住院)/in the hospital(在医院这个地点)；at table(在吃饭)/at the table(在桌边)；go to school(上学)/go to the school(去学校办事)；a most interesting与the most interesting(前者=非常)。例句： ①We have lunch at school. ②My father was in hospital for two weeks.(住院) ③They often play football after class.。三餐前有形容词时加a: We had a big dinner.","keyPoints":["球类、三餐、学科、语言前不加冠词","交通方式by bus/by train不加冠词","in hospital住院；in the hospital在医院(地点)","go to school上学；go to the school去学校","三餐前有形容词加a: a nice lunch"],"example":"例: My grandma was ill in ___ hospital last month, and my mother went to ___ hospital to look after her every day. 解析: 第一空「生病住院」in hospital 不加冠词;第二空「去医院(那个地方)」用 the。一题双空自相对比,正是命题人的惯用手法。","extension":"冠词三步解题法: 一看特指与否(特指用the), 二看是否泛指单数可数(听读音定a/an), 三看是否零冠词场景(三餐、球类、交通方式、学科、季节)。","traps":"错误一： play the football(球类无the)。错误二： have the breakfast(三餐无冠词)。错误三： He is ill in the hospital想说「住院」应为in hospital。错误四： 泛指复数误加the: The dogs are loyal animals(泛指时不用the)。","examFocus":"单选考惯用搭配差异(hospital/school/table系列)；语篇填空考零冠词判断。得分关键： 记住「一对一对」对照搭配，逐个场景化记忆。","tags":["拓展提升","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-2-5","title":"物质名词与抽象名词的可数化","content":"「不可数名词」并非永远不可数，口诀： 「一份一种便落地，加a表具体」。①物质名词转「份/杯/份量」时变可数： two coffees(两杯咖啡)， two teas, a beer；hair指整体不可数，a hair指一根： There is a hair in my soup.；glass玻璃(不可数)/a glass玻璃杯；paper纸(不可数)/a paper一份报纸/论文；food不可数/a food一种食品。②抽象名词转「具体的事例」： success成功(不可数)/a success一件成功的事： The party was a great success.；pleasure愉快/a pleasure一件乐事；failure失败/a failure失败者或失败事例；light光/a light一盏灯。③雨雪烟雾类： a heavy rain一场大雨(有形容词时加a)；a strong wind。判断方法： 看前面有没有「一份/一场/一种」的具体量词或形容词；翻译时中文「一杯/一场」落到英文a上。例句： ①Would you like two coffees or two teas？(两杯) ②Reading is a pleasure for me.(一件乐事) ③We had a good time in the park.(一段时光)。这类转化在完形与单选中常以「不可数名词前出现a」的破绽设题。","keyPoints":["物质名词表「份/杯」时可数: two coffees","hair整体不可数，a hair一根","glass/paper/light具体化: a glass/a paper/a light","抽象名词具体化: a success/a pleasure/a failure","有形容词修饰的天气类加a: a heavy rain"],"example":"例题： —What can I do for you? —I want ______. A.two cup of tea B.two cups of teas C.two cups of tea D.two cup of teas 解析： cup可数先复数cups；tea物质名词不可数不加s，选C。若语境是「两杯咖啡」点单口语可说two coffees，但考试以规范式two cups of tea为主。","extension":"进阶： fruit统称不可数，fruits指多种水果；fish指条数单复同形，fishes指多种鱼；这两组「整体与种类」的转换同属本家族。","traps":"错误一： 见success就拒绝a(a success表一件成功的事)。错误二： a hair与hair混淆导致谓语错。错误三： two cups of teas(tea不可数)。错误四： a heavy rain误当语法错误。","examFocus":"单选考不可数名词的具体化；完形靠语境判断「一份还是整体」。得分关键： 看量词与形容词「落地」再定a。","tags":["名词系统","高难拓展"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"}]},{"uid":"english-3","name":"代词与数词","grade":"七年级上册","order":2,"kps":[{"uid":"english-3-1","title":"人称代词与物主代词","content":"代词四形态一张表口诀： 「主格作主语，宾格作宾语，形物带名词，名物独立站」。主格： I, we, you, he, she, it, they；宾格： me, us, you, him, her, it, them；形容词性物主代词： my, our, your, his, her, its, their(后必须接名词)；名词性物主代词： mine, ours, yours, his, hers, its, theirs(独立使用，=形容词性物主+名词)。转换公式： This is my ruler. = This ruler is mine. 使用要点： ①并列主语排序「二三一」： You, he and I are good friends.(单数并列把I放最后) ②it is me作表语用宾格 ③its(它的)与it is缩写形式区别——写作规范用完整拼写it is。例句： ①Help them with their English, please.(宾格+形物) ②This is our classroom, and that one is theirs.(名物独立) ③The cat is washing its face.(its它的)。语篇填空中给空后无名词，填名词性物主代词。","keyPoints":["主格作主语；宾格作宾语/表语(It is me)","形容词性物主+名词；名词性物主独立使用","my ruler = mine；their books = theirs","并列主语顺序: you and I；he and I","its(它的)是形容词性物主代词，不与it is混"],"example":"例: — Is this your dictionary? — No, ___ (I) is in my schoolbag. 解析: 空处独立作主语,意为「我的(词典)」,用名词性物主代词 mine。名词性物主代词自带名词,后面绝不再接名词,这是七年级上册代词的核心考点。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： This book is mine book.(mine后不能再接名词) 错误二： 形物与名物混搭： a friend of me应为of mine或my friend。错误三： 并列代词漏格： I and you are...应为You and I。错误四： 反身代词场景误用人称代词： enjoy yourself不用you。","examFocus":"单选考四形态转换；语篇填空给提示词代词考词形变化(my→mine)。得分关键： 看空后有没有名词定「形物/名物」。","tags":["基础必会","易错点"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-3-2","title":"反身代词与it的用法","content":"反身代词清单： myself, ourselves, yourself, yourselves, himself, herself, itself, themselves，记忆口诀「单数self复数selves」。高频短语： enjoy oneself(玩得开心)， by oneself(独自、独立)， teach oneself(自学)， hurt oneself(伤到自己)， come to oneself(苏醒)， help oneself to(随便吃)， lose oneself in(沉浸于)。it用法清单： ①指代事物/动物/上文内容： Where is my key? I can not find it. ②指天气/时间/距离/环境： It is sunny today. / It is eight now. / It is about ten minutes on foot from my home to school.(it指距离) ③形式主语/形式宾语(拓展)： It is important to learn English well. / I find it hard to get up early. ④打电话确认身份： —Who is it? —It is Mary. 例句： ①The children enjoyed themselves in the park.(玩得开心) ②Little Tom taught himself to swim.(自学) ③It is about ten minutes on foot from my home to school.(it指距离)。","keyPoints":["反身代词口诀: 单数self，复数selves","enjoy oneself/by oneself/teach oneself高频短语","it指代天气/时间/距离/环境","it作形式主语: It is important to do...","打电话问身份用Who is it"],"example":"例: The children enjoyed ___ (they) in the amusement park yesterday. 解析: enjoy 后必须接反身代词,主语 children 是复数,填 themselves。同义转换: The children had a good time / had fun yesterday. enjoy oneself 与 have a good time 互为同义句,是句型转换常客。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： The kids enjoyed them in the park应为themselves。错误二： by oneself误用by one: She lives by herself。错误三： help yourself to some fish误说help you。错误四： it与one混用(it特指同一物，one泛指同类之一)。","examFocus":"单选考反身代词短语与it用法；口语交际(help yourself)高频。得分关键： 记住八大反身代词+it四大身份。","tags":["基础必会","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-3-3","title":"不定代词易混辨析","content":"不定代词辨析四组口诀： 「both两者都，either两者任一，neither两者都不；all三者全，none三者无」。both...and连接；either...or；neither...nor。some与any： some用于肯定句与期待肯定回答的请求(Would you like some tea?)，any用于否定与疑问。few/a few与little/a little： a few/a little(有一点，肯定)；few/little(几乎没有，否定)，few配可数，little配不可数。复合不定代词(something, anything, someone, anybody等)两大规则： ①修饰语后置： something important, nothing interesting ②谓语用单数： Everybody is here. everybody/nobody/someone作主语按单数处理。例句： ①Both of the answers are right.(both谓语复数) ②Neither of the two answers is right.(neither谓语单数) ③There is nothing interesting in the paper.(修饰后置)。somebody重要拓展： hear from somebody(收到某人来信)。","keyPoints":["both谓复数；neither/none/each谓单数","some肯定句；any否定疑问(请求中some表期待)","a few/a little肯定；few/little否定(几乎无)","复合不定代词修饰语后置+谓语单数","something important; nothing wrong"],"example":"例: — How many eggs are there in the fridge? — ___. We need to buy some. 解析: 问「多少」且下文说「需要买」,回答「一个也没有」用 None(指数量)。若问 Who is in the classroom? 则答 No one/Nobody。None 管「多少」,no one 管「谁」,分工明确。","extension":"either与neither还可用于倒装答语: — I don't like rainy days. — Neither do I. 与九年级 so/neither 倒装呼应,提前混个脸熟。","traps":"错误一： Neither of them are...应为is。错误二： 修饰语前置： important something应为something important。错误三： few与a few混用导致语义相反。错误四： both...and与neither...nor后面的谓语数错乱。","examFocus":"单选高频「四组对比」与复合不定代词单数谓语；完形靠语义褒贬选a few/few。得分关键： 数量范围(两者/三者)+肯否语义双定位。","tags":["易错点","中考高频","拓展提升"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-3-4","title":"基数词与序数词","content":"基数词变序数词口诀： 「基变序，加th；一二三特殊记，八去t九去e，f来把ve替，ty变tie加th」。one→first, two→second, three→third；four→fourth；five→fifth(five的ve变f)；eight→eighth(去t)；nine→ninth(去e)；twenty→twentieth(y变ie)；forty→fortieth。hundred/thousand/million规则： 具体数字后不加s不加of： three hundred students；约数加s接of： hundreds of students。分数表达： 分子基数词，分母序数词；分子大于1，分母加s： one third；two thirds。分数/百分数+of+名词作主语，谓语与of后名词一致： Two thirds of the apples are bad. / Two thirds of the water is polluted. 编号两种写法： Class 3, Grade 9(名+基) 或 the third class(序+名)。例句： ①December is the twelfth month of the year.(twelfth) ②About two thousand students took part in the sports meeting.(two thousand不加s) ③Two thirds of the students in our class ride to school.(of后复数，谓语复数)。","keyPoints":["序数词口诀: 一二三特殊；八去t九去e；f替ve；ty变tie","具体数字+hundred/thousand不加s；hundreds of表约数","分数: 分子基、分母序；分子大于1分母加s","分数/百分数+of短语，谓语随of后名词","编号: Class 3或the third class"],"example":"例: December is the ___ (twelve) month of the year. 解析: 表示「第十二个月」用序数词,twelve 变 twelfth(ve 变 f 再加 th),且序数词前已有 the。再如: Today is her ___ (nine) birthday. 填 ninth。序数词拼写与「the+序数词」是语法填空的送分兼易错点。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： two thousands students(具体数字不加s)。错误二： 分母忘加s: two third应为two thirds。错误三： 序数词前漏the: He won the first prize中first prize前the可省于固定搭配，一般序数词前要the。错误四： 四十几与十几拼写: forty与fourteen分辨。","examFocus":"单选考序数词拼写与分数表达；语篇填空考数字规则；阅读数字题直接取数。得分关键： 背熟基变序口诀与hundred规则。","tags":["基础必会","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-3-5","title":"hundred规则与分数百分数表达","content":"数词三大规则集中扫荡。①hundred/thousand/million规则口诀： 「具体数字不穿鞋(不加s)，约数穿鞋又戴帽(加s接of)」： three hundred students(具体数字)；hundreds of students(约数)；The hall can hold two thousand people. / Thousands of birds fly to the lake every winter. ②分数表达口诀： 「分子基，分母序；分子大于一，分母加s」： one third；two thirds；three fifths；特殊： half a kilo/a half；one and a half hours。分数/百分数+of+名词作主语，谓语随of后名词： Two thirds of the apples are bad. / Two thirds of the water is polluted. / Sixty percent of the students in our class ride to school. ③百分比与倍数联动： percent无复数；The output this year is 120 percent of that last year.。例句： ①About two thousand students took part in the sports meeting.(具体数字) ②Two thirds of the surface of the earth is covered with water.(of后不可数) ③Hundreds of people came to the square.(约数)。做阅读数字题时直接圈数字比对，勿算错倍数。","keyPoints":["具体数字+hundred/thousand不加s；hundreds of表约数","分数: 分子基数词，分母序数词；分子大于一分母加s","分数/百分数+of短语，谓语随of后名词单复数","percent无复数形式","half a kilo与one and a half hours特殊记"],"example":"例题： ______ of the students in our class ______ girls. 解析： 分子Two大于1，分母third要加s，排除A；students是复数，谓语用are，排除C。完整句子： Two thirds of the students in our class are girls.(三分之二的同学是女生)。本题主考分数表达，副考主谓一致。","extension":"进阶： the 1980s表二十世纪八十年代；in his fifties表五十多岁： In his fifties, he began to learn painting.；编号与年份读法也属本家族。","traps":"错误一： two thousands students(具体数字不加s)。错误二： 分母忘加s: two third。错误三： of后不可数却用are。错误四： hundred与of同时出现于具体数字后。","examFocus":"单选考hundred规则与分数谓语一致；语篇填空在数字语境考单复数。得分关键： 「具体不穿鞋，约数穿鞋」口诀先背。","tags":["数词系统","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"}]},{"uid":"english-4","name":"介词与连词","grade":"七年级下册","order":3,"kps":[{"uid":"english-4-1","title":"时间介词in/on/at","content":"时间介词三件套口诀： 「in大段，on具体某天，at点时刻」。in用于： 年/月/季节/早中晚/世纪： in 2024, in May, in spring, in the morning, in the twenty-first century。on用于： 具体某一天、某天的早中晚、节日日期： on Monday, on May 1st, on Sunday morning, on a cold winter morning(具体某天的早晨)。at用于： 时刻/中午/夜里： at six, at noon, at night, at midnight。易混三组： ①in the morning与on Sunday morning(有具体某天用on) ②at Christmas(节期)与on Christmas Day(节日当天) ③in time(及时)与on time(准时)。例句： ①We usually have a sports meeting in October.(月份in) ②They arrived on the evening of July 1.(具体某天晚上on) ③The class begins at eight every morning.(时刻at)。判断公式： 大时间段in→具体日期on→点时刻at，逐层缩小。","keyPoints":["in+年/月/季节/早中晚/世纪","on+具体某天/某天早中晚/日期","at+时刻/noon/night/midnight","具体某天的早上用on: on Sunday morning","in time及时；on time准时"],"example":"例: We usually plant trees ___ spring, but this year we planted them ___ the morning of March 12th. 解析: 第一空泛指季节用 in;第二空虽是 morning,但「3月12日的早上」具体到某一天,必须用 on。填 in, on。抓住「具体某天的早中晚用on」即可破题。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： on May(月份用in)。错误二： in Sunday morning(某天的早上用on)。错误三： at the morning中the多余且at错。错误四： 混淆in time与on time的中文「及时/准时」。","examFocus":"单选与语篇填空高频；写作日记日期落款用on。得分关键： 按「大段in→某天on→点at」三阶梯判断。","tags":["基础必会","记忆口诀","易错点"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-4-2","title":"地点方位介词","content":"方位介词口诀： 「in里on面above悬，under下面front前面」。in表示在内部范围内： in the classroom, in China；on表示表面接触： on the desk, on the wall。上下组： above/over(上方，over有「正上方/覆盖」义)， below/under(下方)： There is a bridge over the river. 前后组： in front of(外部前面)与in the front of(内部前部)： The teacher stands in the front of the classroom. 左右之间： between(两者之间；多者两两之间也用between)与among(三者及以上之中)： She is popular among her classmates. 穿过组： across(表面穿过： walk across the street)与through(内部穿过： walk through the forest)。例句： ①The bird is flying above the field.(上方盘旋) ②There is a big desk in the front of our classroom.(内部前部) ③Walk across the street and you will find the bank on your right.(表面横穿)。做题时画平面图定位最直观。","keyPoints":["in内部；on表面；above/over上方；below/under下方","in front of外部前；in the front of内部前部","between两者之间；among三者以上之中","across表面横穿；through内部穿过","on the tree长在树上；in the tree外物落在树上"],"example":"例: Look! A bird is singing ___ the tree and there are lots of apples ___ the tree. 解析: 鸟是「落在树上的外物」用 in the tree;苹果是「树本身结的」用 on the tree。填 in, on。两组「树」的介词同题对比,出镜率极高。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： The desk is in front of the classroom想说「教室前部」应为in the front of。错误二： 走隧道用across(应through)。错误三： 鸟停在树上： The bird is on the tree(外来物in the tree)。错误四： 两者以上中之一误用between造成歧义。","examFocus":"单选考方位介词辨析；书面表达地点描写、问路指路高频。得分关键： 「里/面/上/中/穿」五方位图示化记忆。","tags":["基础必会","易错点"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-4-3","title":"其他常考介词with/about/of/for","content":"四大高频介词分工。with： ①伴随： The girl with long hair is my sister. ②带有： a house with a garden ③使用工具： Cut it with the knife. ④agree with同意某人。about： 关于： a book about history; think about考虑；What about...?(征求意见)。of： 所属与计量： the door of the room; a cup of tea; one of my friends。for： ①为了： This gift is for you. ②持续： for two hours ③支持： Are you for the plan? ④固定： thank you for; be famous for; look for。高频介词短语清单： be full of, be proud of, be afraid of, be interested in, be good at, hear of, think of, do with, help with, be strict with, be angry with。例句： ①Thank you for telling me the news.(for接动名词) ②We are proud of our motherland.(proud of) ③He cut the apple into two halves with a small knife.(工具)。介词后动词一律用doing形式。","keyPoints":["with表伴随/带有/工具；agree with同意某人","about表关于；What about...?提建议","of表所属与计量；one of+复数","for表为了/持续/支持；thank you for doing","介词后接动词用doing形式"],"example":"例: — Do you know the boy ___ glasses? — Yes, he is a top student. 解析: 「戴眼镜的男孩」用 with 表特征,with glasses 作后置定语修饰 boy,填 with。类似: the woman with a baby in her arms。with 表「带有、戴着」是完形与单选常客。","extension":"一句话记介词辨析: write with a pen, write in ink, write in English; travel by bus。工具用with, 语言材料用in, 交通方式用by。","traps":"错误一： agree to sb(同意某人应为agree with sb；agree to接计划提议)。错误二： be famous of应为famous for。错误三： Thank you for help me应为helping。错误四： with与in表穿戴： The woman in red(穿着)不能用with。","examFocus":"单选考介词短语搭配；语篇填空无提示词空格常考介词；写作中with短语作后置定语提分。得分关键： 按动词归组背短语(be+介词系列)。","tags":["拓展提升","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-4-4","title":"并列连词and/but/or/so","content":"四大并列连词口诀： 「and顺承，but转折，or否则选择，so因果」。and： 顺接与并列： I like singing and dancing. but： 转折： He is poor, but he is happy. or： ①否则(祈使句+or+将来句)： Hurry up, or we will be late for school. ②选择： Would you like tea or coffee? so： 结果： It was late, so we went home. 三组关联词： both...and(两者都，谓语复数)；either...or(任一，就近)；neither...nor(都不，就近)。句式「祈使句+and/or+陈述句」： Study hard, and you will make progress. / Get up early, or you will miss the early bus. 例句： ①Work hard, and your dream will come true.(顺承结果) ②He wanted to help, but he did not know what to do.(转折) ③It was getting dark, so the children went home.(因果)。and与but不能同时出现在同一句表并列关系。","keyPoints":["and顺承并列；but转折；or否则/选择；so因果","祈使句+and/or+将来句是高频句式","both...and谓语复数；either...or/neither...nor就近","because与so不能共存；though与but不能共存","or表否则时后接将来含义句"],"example":"例: Hurry up, ___ we'll be late for the first class. 解析: 「快点」与「上第一节课迟到」是「否则」关系,填 or。若句子是 Hurry up, ___ we'll arrive on time.,则填 and 表「那么」。or「否则」与 and「那么」之辨是经典考点。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： Because...so...连用(留一个)。错误二： Though...but...连用。错误三： 祈使句+or后用动词原形(应为将来句或情态)。错误四： neither...nor后谓语与远端主语一致(应就近)。","examFocus":"单选考并列连词逻辑关系与关联词组；完形靠上下文逻辑选连词，是完形的核心线索之一。得分关键： 前后句义「同向还是反向」定and/but。","tags":["基础必会","易错点","中考高频"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-4-5","title":"易混介词辨析: besides与except等","content":"六组高频易混介词逐对扫清。①besides(除...之外还有，包括)与except(除...之外，不包括)： We all went to the park except Tom.(Tom没去) / Besides English, he can also speak French.(除英语外还会法语，英语包括在内) ②between(两者之间；多者两两之间)与among(三者以上之中)： The village lies between two mountains. / She is popular among her classmates. ③in与after表时间： in+时间段(从现在起)： He will be back in two days.；after+时间点(多用于过去)： He came back after nine that evening.；in与after的分工看「将来时间段用in，过去时间点用after」。④by(不迟于；被；由)与until(直到)： You must finish it by Friday.(不迟于周五) / The shop is open until ten pm.(持续到) ⑤with与in表方式： write with a pen(工具)；in ink/in English(材料/语言)。⑥for与of： It is kind of you to help.(人品质用of)；This ticket is for you.(对象)。例句： ①Nobody was late except him.(只有他迟到) ②The train leaves in twenty minutes.(二十分钟后) ③I will wait here until six.(等到六点)。辨析题先分「包括与否」「点还是段」两个维度。","keyPoints":["besides=除...还有(包括)；except=除...之外(不包括)","between两者/两两之间；among三者以上之中","in+时间段(将来)；after+时间点/过去时间段","by=不迟于；until=持续到","with表工具；in表材料/语言"],"example":"例题： ______ Lucy, all the students went to the movie. She had to look after her sick mother. A.Besides B.Except C.Beside D.Without 解析： 后句说她没去，排除包括式的besides；except表「除她之外都去了」，选B。beside(在旁边)是形近干扰项。","extension":"进阶： except for引出整体中的小缺陷： The composition is good except for a few spelling mistakes.；except that后接从句： The two are the same except that one is bigger.","traps":"错误一： besides与except中文都译「除了」不分包括与否。错误二： in two days误当「两天内」表过去。错误三： by与until互换。错误四： among用于两者。","examFocus":"单选高频besides/except与in/after；完形靠「包括与否」辨析。得分关键： 先问「被排除者在不在内」。","tags":["介词辨析","中考高频"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"}]},{"uid":"english-5","name":"形容词与副词","grade":"七年级下册","order":4,"kps":[{"uid":"english-5-1","title":"形容词与副词的区别与位置","content":"形容词与副词分工口诀： 「形修名，副修动；形作表，副修全句」。形容词修饰名词或作表语： She is a careful girl. / The soup tastes good. 副词修饰动词/形容词/副词/整句： She always does her homework carefully. / Lucy writes as carefully as Lily. / Luckily, the rain stopped before we set out.(修饰整句)。构词： 形容词+ly→副词，注意三特殊： true→truly, terrible→terribly, possible→possibly；以le结尾去e加y： possible→possibly, gentle→gently。位置规则： ①形容词放名词前，复合不定代词后置： something important ②频度副词「实前be后」 ③方式副词放动词后或句尾 ④enough放形容词后。good与well分工： good形容词；well副词，也作形容词「气色好/身体好」： He looks well. 例句： ①Lucy is a careful girl; she always does her homework carefully.(形+副对照) ②The soup tastes good.(taste系动词接形) ③Luckily, nobody was hurt in the accident.(评注性副词)。","keyPoints":["形容词修饰名词作定语、作表语","副词修饰动词/形容词/副词/整句","ly构词三特殊: truly/terribly/possibly","复合不定代词的修饰语后置: something important","good形容词；well副词；well作形容词表身体好"],"example":"例: The cake smells ___ (good/well) and it sells ___ (good/well). 解析: smell 是系动词,后接形容词填 good;第二空修饰动词 sells,用副词 well(畅销)。一句之中,形容词配系动词、副词配实义动词,对比鲜明。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： The soup tastes well(taste系动词接形应为good)。错误二： He is a carefully boy(carefully应为careful)。错误三： He speaks English good(应为well)。错误四： This is important something(应为something important)。","examFocus":"单选考形副混用与-ly构词；语篇填空给形容词提示改副词是最高频题型之一。得分关键： 看被修饰词词性定形副。","tags":["基础必会","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-5-2","title":"系动词后接形容词","content":"系动词后必须接形容词作表语，口诀： 「系动词后用形，不用副词」。四大类系动词： ①be动词： am/is/are/was/were ②感官系动词： look(看起来)， sound(听起来)， feel(摸起来/感觉)， taste(尝起来)， smell(闻起来) ③变化系动词： become, get, turn, go, grow, come, fall ④保持系动词： keep, stay, remain。公式： 系动词+形容词： The music sounds sweet. / The sky turned dark before the storm. / You must keep quiet in the reading room. get类「双系动词」短语： get dressed, get married, get lost, get used to。注意well作形容词的特例： He looks well.(气色好) / I am not feeling well.(身体不舒服)。例句： ①The flowers smell sweet.(smell接形) ②The story sounds moving.(moving形容词化) ③In autumn the leaves turn yellow.(turn接形)。变否定时be动词直接加not，其他系动词借用do/does/did： It does not look like rain.","keyPoints":["系动词+形容词作表语，不接副词","感官系动词: look/sound/feel/taste/smell","变化系动词: become/get/turn/go/grow","get短语: get dressed/get married/get lost","well作形容词表「气色好/身体好」"],"example":"例: The story is ___ (interest) and all of us are ___ in it. 解析: 第一空描述事物 the story,填 interesting;第二空主语是人且与 be interested in 搭配,填 interested。「物用-ing,人用-ed」是七下到中考的一线考点。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： The song sounds beautifully(接形应为beautiful)。错误二： The milk tastes sweetly(应为sweet)。错误三： He looks good in that suit与looks well混淆(身体好才用well)。错误四： 系动词误加进行时： It is sounding nice(应为sounds)。","examFocus":"单选考系动词接形；语篇填空给sound/look类动词提示填形容词。得分关键： 记住「五感四变一保持」系动词清单。","tags":["易错点","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-5-3","title":"比较级与最高级构成与句型","content":"三级变化构成口诀： 「单音节加er/est；多音节more/most；重读闭音节双写；辅音y变ier/iest」。good/well→better→best；bad/ill→worse→worst；many/much→more→most；little→less→least；far→farther/further。四大句型公式： ①比较级+than： This T-shirt is much cheaper than that one.(much/even/a little可修饰比较级) ②as+原级+as： Lucy writes as carefully as Lily.(as...as中间用原级) ③not so...as： He is not so tall as his brother. ④比较级+and+比较级(越来越)： The city is becoming more and more beautiful. 「比任何其他」句式： Tom is taller than any other student in his class.(比较级表最高级含义，other不可丢)。例句： ①This T-shirt is much cheaper than that one.(much修饰比较级) ②Lucy writes as carefully as Lily.(原级比较) ③Spring is the best season of the year.(最高级+of/in范围)。of与in范围分工： of+复数名词(个体)， in+地点/团体。","keyPoints":["构成: 单音节er/est；多音节more/most；双写与变y规则","不规则: better/worse/more/less/farther","比较级+than；as+原级+as；not so...as","much/even/a little修饰比较级，不修饰原级","比较级表最高级: than any other+单数"],"example":"例: Shanghai is one of ___ (big) cities in the world. 解析: 「one of the+最高级+复数名词」表「最……之一」,big 双写 g 加 est,填 the biggest。同类必背: one of the most famous writers。此句型是中考语法填空与写作的高频句式。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： as carefully than(结构混搭)。错误二： very修饰比较级(very只修饰原级与最高级，比较级用much)。错误三： than any student丢other(把自己也比进去了)。错误四： 最高级前漏the: the tallest boy。","examFocus":"单选考三级句型互换；语篇填空给形容词提示按than/as...as定级；写作用比较级展开对比论证。得分关键： 先看句中有没有than/as...as信号。","tags":["中考高频","记忆口诀"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-5-4","title":"enough与too...to句型","content":"两大句型公式。enough句型： ①形容词+enough+to do： The boy is old enough to dress himself. ②enough+名词(可放动词后)： There is enough food for the whole family. / We have money enough——语序上enough放名词前后均可，中考以enough+名词为主。enough for sb对某人足够： The room is big enough for the four of us. too...to句型： 太...而不能，肯定形式否定意义： The box is too heavy for the little girl to carry.(小女孩提不动) 与so...that(否定句)互转公式： He is too young to go to school. = He is so young that he can not go to school. = He is not old enough to go to school.(三种句式一句三变)。例句： ①The boy is old enough to dress himself.(enough to do) ②The box is too heavy for the little girl to carry.(too...to) ③He ran too fast for me to follow.(我跟不上他)。too...to的主语与不定式逻辑主语一致时省逻辑主语。","keyPoints":["形容词+enough+to do；名词+enough","too+形容词+to do=太...而不能","一句三变: too...to = so...that否定句 = not...enough to","enough for sb表对人足够","too...to中不定式的逻辑主语常省"],"example":"例: 同义句转换: The question is so difficult that nobody can answer it. → The question is ___ ___ ___ ___. 解析: 转为 too...to 结构: too difficult to answer。注意 that 从句的主语 nobody 在不定式中隐去,answer 的宾语 it 也要省略,这是转换题最易失分的一步。","extension":"so...that与such...that还能升级写作: The film is so moving that I want to see it again. 比I like the film very much. 更有表现力, 高分作文常用。","traps":"错误一： enough放形容词前： enough old应为old enough。错误二： too...to误当肯定句翻译(「太...而不能」)。错误三： so...that转换时漏情态动词否定： that he can not go。错误四： The question is too difficult to answer it(to后不再接宾语it)。","examFocus":"单选考句式三变互转；写作用enough to与too...to提升句式多样性。得分关键： 记住「一句三变」公式，转换题直接套。","tags":["拓展提升","答题模板","易错点"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-5-5","title":"the加比较级句型与倍数表达","content":"两大高阶句式。①the+比较级， the+比较级(越...越...)： 公式「The+比较级+主谓， the+比较级+主谓」，前半句是条件后半句是结果，两个the都不能丢： The more you read, the more you will learn. / The busier he is, the happier he feels. / The more carefully you listen, the better you understand。比较级部分可以省略主谓(口语)： The sooner, the better. ②倍数表达三公式： A是B的两倍长—— twice as long as B； three times the length of B； 倍数+比较级+than： The room is twice bigger than that one.(不规范少用) 中考规范以前两式为主： This bridge is three times as wide as that one. / The population of China is about four times that of Japan.(that代指population)。相关句式： 比较级表最高级： He is taller than any other student in his class. 例句： ①The more we get together, the happier we will be.(谚语) ②This room is twice as large as that one.(倍数) ③The higher you stand, the farther you will see.。写作中用the...the...句式显逻辑层次。","keyPoints":["公式: The+比较级+主谓, the+比较级+主谓","两个the缺一不可；比较级部分可换副词","The sooner, the better(省略式)","倍数: twice as+原级+as；three times the+名词+of","that/those代指比较对象避免重复"],"example":"例题： 同义句转换： This bridge is twice as long as that one. 解析： 可改为 This bridge is twice the length of that one.。倍数词(twice/three times)放句首级别，as...as中间用原级long。","extension":"进阶： the more...the more...中可用「the+比较级+名词」： The more help you give, the more friends you will make.；谚语与格言高频使用本句式，阅读理解可顺带考谚语句义。","traps":"错误一： 丢the: More you read, more you learn错。错误二： the...the...中间用最高级(应用比较级)。错误三： twice bigger than当规范表达。错误四： 倍数句中as...as里用比较级。","examFocus":"单选考the...the...与倍数句式；书面表达用the...the...提升档次。得分关键： 「两个the+比较级」双锁死。","tags":["比较等级","高阶句式"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"}]},{"uid":"english-6","name":"时态一: 一般现在时与现在进行时","grade":"七年级上册","order":5,"kps":[{"uid":"english-6-1","title":"一般现在时: 三单变化与频率副词","content":"一般现在时表示经常性、习惯性的动作或客观事实与状态，是初中英语使用频率最高的时态。基本公式： 主语+动词原形；主语为第三人称单数时动词加-s/-es，即「三单变化」。三单口诀： 一般加-s；以s、x、ch、sh结尾加-es(watch→watches, fix→fixes)；辅音字母+y结尾，变y为i再加-es(study→studies)；特殊记have→has。否定与疑问借助do/does，公式： 三单主+does not+原形；Does+三单主+原形？ 口诀「does一出现，动词就还原」。频率副词按频度排序： always→usually→often→sometimes→seldom→never，位置口诀「实前be后」： 置于实义动词之前、be动词与情态动词之后。高频时间标志： every day, on Sundays, once a week, in the morning。例句： ①She watches TV for an hour every evening.(三单watch加es) ②My parents usually go jogging on Sundays.(usually放实义动词前) ③Light travels faster than sound.(客观真理恒用一般现在时)。做题口诀： 先看主语定三单，再看时间定时态。","keyPoints":["三单主语(he/she/it/单数名词/不可数名词)后的动词加-s/es","三单口诀: 一般加s；s/x/ch/sh结尾加es；辅音+y变y为i加es；have→has","does not/Does后的动词一律还原为原形","频率副词always/usually/often/sometimes/never放实义动词前、be动词后","every day, on Sundays, once a week是一般现在时的信号词","客观真理与格言永远用一般现在时： The earth goes around the sun."],"example":"例: Lucy usually ___ (go) to school by bike, but sometimes she ___ (walk). 解析: usually 与 sometimes 都是一般现在时标志,主语 Lucy 是三单,分别填 goes、walks。第二空别顺手填 goes,读懂「有时步行」再落笔。","extension":null,"traps":"典型错误一： 主语三单却忘变形，He like music应为likes。错误二： 借does后仍用三单，He does not likes...应为like(does出现动词还原)。错误三： 频率副词位置，He likes always...应为always likes。错误四： everyone/nobody等复合不定代词作主语按三单处理： Everybody is here，不能误当复数。","examFocus":"中考单选与语篇填空高频。命题角度： ①三单判断(everybody, each of them) ②if/when从句中用一般现在表将来 ③语篇填空给动词要求按主语变形。得分关键： 先圈主语再定动词形式；看到every/usually/on Sundays立即锁定本时态。","tags":["基础必会","记忆口诀"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-6-2","title":"现在进行时: 构成与时间标志","content":"现在进行时表示说话时刻或现阶段正在进行的动作。公式： be(am/is/are)+动词-ing。主语决定be: I用am，单数用is，复数与you用are。ing构成口诀： 一般直接加；不发音e结尾去e加(make→making)；重读闭音节「辅元辅」双写末字母加(stop→stopping, run→running)；ie结尾变y加(lie→lying, die→dying)。标志词口诀： 「now此刻Look Listen，these days近期景」： now, right now, Look!, Listen!, at the moment, this week, these days。句式： 否定be后加not；疑问be提前，回答用be: Yes, I am. / No, I am not. 例句： ①Look! The boys are playing basketball on the playground.(Look提示此刻) ②I am reading an interesting book these days.(现阶段) ③Listen! Someone is singing in the next room.(Listen提示正在)。中考常把本时态与一般现在时对比考查： 表习惯用一般现在，表此刻用进行。","keyPoints":["公式: be(am/is/are)+现在分词，be随主语变化","ing构成: 一般加ing；去e加ing；重读闭音节双写加ing；ie变y加ing","信号词: now, right now, Look! Listen! at the moment, this week, these days","否定直接在be后加not；疑问把be提句首","表习惯性动作用一般现在时，表此刻/现阶段才用进行时"],"example":"例: Listen! Someone ___ (sing) in the music room. 解析: Listen! 是进行时的信号弹,someone 作主语谓语用单数,填 is singing。看到句首 Look!/Listen! 基本锁定进行时,再配好 be 动词即可。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： 漏be或漏ing，He watching TV应为is watching。错误二： 双写规则不熟，swiming应为swimming(run→running, sit→sitting)。错误三： 状态动词误用进行时： I am knowing...应为I know(want/love/like等不用进行)。错误四： 见到Look与Listen提示词仍用一般现在时。","examFocus":"单选高频： 给Look/Listen提示直接锁定进行时。语篇填空： 给动词+now/at the moment，填be加ving。写作中用进行时描绘画面更生动： People are dancing in the square。得分关键： be与ving缺一不可，主语与be保持一致。","tags":["基础必会","记忆口诀","中考高频"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-6-3","title":"两种时态的区别与状态动词","content":"一般现在时与现在进行时的分工口诀： 「经常一般现，此刻进行见」。前者表经常、习惯，后者表此刻、现阶段。判断公式： 时间标志+动词性质双线索。always/usually/every day配一般现在；now/Look/Listen配进行时。第二层是「状态动词」： 表心理、情感、感觉、拥有、归属的动词一般不用进行时，清单口诀「知道爱好想拥有，明白听见属谁有」： know, love, like, hate, want, need, hope, wish, believe, remember, understand, see, hear, own, belong, seem。这些词要么不能用进行时，要么进行时后词义改变： think表「认为」不可进行，think about表「考虑」可以。例句： ①I think the plan works well.(认为，不用进行) ②The soup tastes delicious.(taste表尝起来，状态) ③He is seeing the dentist this afternoon.(see在此表「约见」，动作义可用进行)。做题步骤： 先判断动词是状态还是动作，再配合时间词定时态。","keyPoints":["习惯性动作用一般现在时；此刻/现阶段动作用现在进行时","状态动词(know/love/want/own/belong等)不用进行时","think表「考虑」、see表「约见」时是动作动词，可用进行时","always/usually/every day是一般现在信号；now/Look/Listen是进行信号","状态动词作谓语时，即使句中有now也用一般现在时"],"example":"例: Look! The children ___ (swim) in the river. They often ___ (swim) there in summer. 解析: 前句 Look! 表此刻正在进行,填 are swimming;后句 often 与 in summer 表经常习惯,填 swim。一句双空对比考查,是期末考试高频题型。","extension":"状态动词不用进行时,与九年级「瞬间动词不能与for/since时间段连用」一脉相承: 本质都是动词的「时间属性」, 串联理解事半功倍。","traps":"错误一： I am wanting a pen应为want。错误二： The flower is smelling sweet应为smells(闻起来是状态)。错误三： Look! The girl dances应为is dancing。错误四： 把I am thinking about you(考虑，动作)与I think you are right(认为，状态)混为一谈。","examFocus":"单选对比题高频： 两个选项分属两种时态，看空后时间词定答案。状态动词辨析在完形与语篇填空也会出现。得分关键： 圈出时间标志词，检查动词是否状态动词，双保险后作答。","tags":["易错点","中考高频","拓展提升"],"difficulty":2,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-6-4","title":"时间状语与八大时态对应速查表","content":"把「时间标志词」当作时态的身份证，一查便知。速查口诀： 「every与usually配一般现，now与Look配进行；yesterday与last配过去；tomorrow与next配将来；already与yet配完成；at加过去时刻配过去进行；by then配过去完成」。八大时态信号词总表： 一般现在时——every day/week, on Sundays, usually, always, once a week, in the morning；现在进行时——now, Look!, Listen!, at the moment, these days；一般过去时——yesterday, last week/night, ...ago, in 2020, just now；一般将来时——tomorrow, next week, in two days, soon, in the future；现在完成时——already, yet, just, ever, never, so far, for/since；过去进行时——at eight last night, this time yesterday, when/while；过去完成时——by the time, by the end of+过去时间, before+过去时间；情态推测——must/may/can not。例句： ①Look! The children are flying kites.(进行) ②He has already finished breakfast.(完成) ③By the time we arrived, the film had begun.(过去完成)。做语篇填空时先圈时间状语，再定动词形式，两步锁死答案。","keyPoints":["every/usually→一般现在；now/Look→现在进行","yesterday/last/ago/just now→一般过去","tomorrow/next/in+时间段→一般将来","already/yet/so far/for/since→现在完成","at+过去时刻/this time yesterday→过去进行","by the time/by the end of过去时间→过去完成"],"example":"例题： (1)Listen! Someone ______ (sing) in the music room. 解析： Listen提示现在进行，someone作主语，填is singing。(2)My father ______ (go) to Beijing last week, and he ______ (be) there twice this year. 解析： last week配一般过去，填went；this year配现在完成，填has been。时间状语是时态的第一线索，圈词即得分。","extension":"进阶： 一个句子出现两个时间参照时，以靠近动词的时间状语为准；when/if/as soon as从句中用一般现在时表将来，是「时间词规则」的最大例外，也是最常考的例外。","traps":"错误一： just now(刚才)误配现在完成时。错误二： in the past few years误判为过去时间(配完成时)。错误三： this time yesterday误用现在进行(应过去进行)。错误四： 见ago就填过去分词(ago配过去式，不是过去分词)。","examFocus":"语篇填空命题第一依据就是时间状语；单选也常直接考信号词辨析。得分关键： 先圈时间词定框架，再看主语定单复数。","tags":["时态总览","中考高频"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-6-5","title":"一般现在时的三种特殊用法","content":"一般现在时除了表习惯，还有三种「越界」用法，口诀： 「时刻表现在，从句现表将，解说用现在」。①时刻表与日程表用一般现在时表将来： 时刻表是「客观安排」，不因人的意愿改变： The train leaves at 9:00 every morning. / The class begins at eight. / The film starts at seven tonight. ②时间与条件状语从句中用一般现在时表将来(「主将从现」)： I will call you as soon as I arrive in Guangzhou. / If it is fine tomorrow, we will go climbing. ③图片说明、新闻标题、体育解说与操作指引用一般现在时： The picture shows a family dinner. / First, you press the button. Then, the light turns green. 例句： ①The plane takes off at six.(时刻表) ②When he comes back, I will tell him the news.(从句现表将) ③The story happens in a small town.(情节介绍)。判断步骤： 先问「这是时刻表/从句/说明文吗」，是则跳出「习惯动作」的默认理解。","keyPoints":["时刻表/日程表用一般现在表将来: The bus leaves at five","when/if/as soon as从句用一般现在表将来(主将从现)","图片说明/标题/操作指引用一般现在时","The story happens in...(故事背景介绍)","状态动词永远一般现在: This book belongs to me"],"example":"例题： —When will you tell him about the meeting? —As soon as he ______ (come) back. 解析： as soon as时间从句遵循主将从现，从句用一般现在时；he为三单，填comes。本题同时考「从句现表将」与「三单变化」两个规则。","extension":"进阶： 新闻标题为省空间常用一般现在时表刚发生的事(Earthquake hits the city)；剧本与说明文字通篇一般现在时，读长难句时不要误判为「能力不足的错句」。","traps":"错误一： 时刻表说The train will leave at 9:00(地道形式为leaves)。错误二： as soon as从句加will。错误三： 把happens(故事背景)改成is happening。错误四： here/there开头的倒装句误判为将来： Here comes the bus(不是will come)。","examFocus":"单选高频「从句现表将」；语篇填空在时刻表语境考第三人称单数。得分关键： 认出三大场景(时刻表/从句/解说)即锁定一般现在时。","tags":["时态拓展","易错点"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"}]},{"uid":"english-7","name":"时态二: 一般过去时","grade":"七年级下册","order":6,"kps":[{"uid":"english-7-1","title":"规则动词过去式与时间标志","content":"一般过去时表过去发生的动作或状态，常伴明确的过去时间。规则动词过去式构成口诀： 「一般加ed，有e加d，辅y变i再加ed，重读闭音节双写加ed」： work→worked, live→lived, study→studied, stop→stopped, plan→planned。ed读音三式： 清辅音后读/t/(worked, helped)；元音及浊辅音后读/d/(played, lived)；t、d结尾读/id/(wanted, needed)。高频时间标志： yesterday, last week/night/year, ...ago, in 2020, just now, at that time, one day。句式公式： 否定did not+原形；疑问Did+主语+原形？ 口诀「did一出现，动词就还原」。例句： ①We visited the museum last Sunday.(visited规则变化) ②He moved to Beijing three years ago.(ago配过去时) ③They planted trees on the hill yesterday morning.(yesterday morning配过去)。完形中看到last/in+过去年份/ago，即可锁定过去时态。","keyPoints":["规则过去式: 一般+ed；e结尾+d；辅音+y变i+ed；重读闭音节双写+ed","ed读音: 清辅音后/t/，元音浊辅音后/d/，t和d后/id/","信号词: yesterday, last..., ...ago, in+过去年份, just now, at that time","did not/Did后动词还原为原形","规则-ed形容词修饰人(interested)，-ing形容词修饰物(interesting)"],"example":"例: Mary ___ (visit) her grandparents last Sunday. 解析: last Sunday 是过去时标志,visit 直接加 ed,填 visited。警惕 every Sunday(三单)与 last Sunday(过去式)的切换,时间状语一换,动词形式必须跟着换。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： 双写遗漏： stoped应为stopped，planed应为planned。错误二： did后仍用过去式： Did you went...应为go。错误三： just now(刚才)配过去时，而just(刚刚)配现在完成时，二者不可混。错误四： study变studyed应为studied(y变i加ed)。","examFocus":"单选与语篇填空都高频。语篇填空给动词+last week填过去式，规则动词注意双写与y变i。听力辨音考ed读音。得分关键： 先找时间标志，再按规则变形，最后检查did后还原。","tags":["基础必会","记忆口诀"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-7-2","title":"不规则动词过去式","content":"不规则动词过去式必须分类记忆，乱背效率极低。分类口诀： 「一类原形不动，二类元音换装，三类结尾变样」。原形不变组： cut, put, let, hit, cost, read(过去式拼写不变、读音变为/id/)。元音变化组： get→got, come→came, give→gave, take→took, go→went, see→saw, eat→ate, drink→drank, run→ran, sing→sang, swim→swam, write→wrote, ride→rode, fall→fell, feel→felt。结尾变形组： buy→bought, bring→brought, think→thought, teach→taught, catch→caught, tell→told, sell→sold, find→found, build→built, lend→lent, keep→kept, sleep→slept, stand→stood, understand→understood。例句： ①I went to the cinema with my cousin last weekend.(go→went) ②She bought a present for her mother on her birthday.(buy→bought) ③We took the subway and got there in twenty minutes.(take→took)。建议按「三态表」滚动复习： 原形-过去式-过去分词成对记，为现在完成时与被动语态打地基。","keyPoints":["原形不变组: cut/put/let/hit/cost/read(读音变)","元音变化组: go→went, take→took, see→saw, come→came, give→gave","ought/aught组: buy→bought, teach→taught, catch→caught, think→thought","变t/d组: tell→told, sell→sold, build→built, find→found","不规则过去式须与过去分词成对记: go→went→gone, see→saw→seen","read三态拼写相同，过去式/过去分词读音为/red/"],"example":"例: Last weekend, we ___ (go) camping and ___ (have) great fun there. 解析: Last weekend 定过去时,go 与 have 都是不规则动词,分别填 went、had。并列谓语时态必须一致,「只变最后一个动词」是常见失分点。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： 把不规则当规则： He teached us应为taught。错误二： went与gone混用： She has went...应为has gone(完成时用过去分词)。错误三： read过去式拼写不变读音变： He read it yesterday不可写成readed。错误四： 完形中因背不出过去式而误选近义词。","examFocus":"完形填空与语篇填空直接考不规则过去式；单选常给last year类时间词。叙述类写作全靠过去式撑时态。得分关键： 建立三态表默写习惯，每天五词滚动过关。","tags":["基础必会","记忆口诀","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-7-3","title":"一般过去时句型与易错点","content":"一般过去时的四种句式公式： 肯定S+V-ed；否定S+did not+V原形；一般疑问Did+S+V原形？ 回答Yes, ...did. / No, ...did not.；特殊疑问： 疑问词+did+S+V原形？ 核心口诀： 「did一出手，动词就还原」。be动词的过去式was/were自成体系： 否定was not/were not，疑问Was/Were提前，不用did。there be过去时用There was/were，就近原则不变。例句： ①Did you enjoy the school trip last Friday？(enjoy还原) ②I did not sleep well last night, so I feel tired now.(did not接原形) ③When did they arrive in Shanghai？(疑问词+did+原形) ④There were two apple trees in the yard when I was young.(were接复数)。叙述文写作(难忘的一天、日记)通篇以过去时为骨架，首句定基调，全篇保持一致。","keyPoints":["四种句式: 肯定V-ed；否定did not+原形；疑问Did+原形；特殊疑问词+did+原形","did出现，动词一律还原为原形","was/were用于be动词句，不借助did","There was/were+名词，遵循就近原则","过去时间词可跨句出现，前句的时间标志同样约束后句","叙述文首句定时态基调，全篇统一"],"example":"例: — ___ you ___ (see) the film last night? — Yes, I did. It was wonderful. 解析: 答语 Yes, I did 说明问句借 did 提问,动词用原形,填 Did, see。问句形式与答语必须「配套」,答语是判断问句的第一线索。","extension":"口诀: 「was were管状态, did管动作; 借did必还原, 双重过去是大忌」。把口诀贴进错题本, 每周回看, 时态题正确率可稳定在九成以上。","traps":"错误一： 双重过去： Did you saw...应为see。错误二： 否定漏did: He not come...应为did not come。错误三： was/were与did混用： Were you go...应为Did you go。错误四： 集合概念主语： Everyone was...用单数was，不因「大家」而用were。","examFocus":"单选直接考句式转换；完形靠上下文时间线定过去时；叙述类作文通篇过去时是得分底线。语篇填空给动词+昨天类词先判断是否需要did结构。得分关键： 时间标志+句式公式两步走。","tags":["易错点","答题模板"],"difficulty":2,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-7-4","title":"不规则动词三态分类记忆法","content":"不规则动词按「原形-过去式-过去分词」的形态关系分四类，口诀： 「ABA原样，ABB挨着，ABC换新，AAB变尾」。①ABA类(过去式=原形)： cut-cut-cut, put-put-put, let-let-let, hit-hit-hit, cost-cost-cost, read-read-read(拼写同、过去式读音为/red/)。②ABB类(过去式=过去分词，占绝大多数)： buy-bought-bought, teach-taught-taught, catch-caught-caught, think-thought-thought, tell-told-told, sell-sold-sold, find-found-found, keep-kept-kept, sleep-slept-slept, get-got-got(美式gotten拓展), leave-left-left, meet-met-met, lose-lost-lost。③ABC类(三者各不同)： go-went-gone, see-saw-seen, do-did-done, take-took-taken, give-gave-given, eat-ate-eaten, break-broke-broken, speak-spoke-spoken, write-wrote-written, fly-flew-flown, show-showed-shown, forget-forgot-forgotten。④AAB类(过去式=原形，分词不同)： beat-beat-beaten。例句： ①The glass fell off the table and broke.(fall-broke同现) ②He has written three letters since Monday.(written过去分词) ③The kite flew higher and higher.(fly过去式flew)。每天按类别默写五个，一周扫清三态表。","keyPoints":["ABA类: cut/put/let/hit/cost/read(读音变)","ABB类最多: bought/taught/told/found/kept","ABC类: went-gone, saw-seen, took-taken, broke-broken","beat是唯一AAB: beat-beat-beaten","read过去式与分词读音为/red/，拼写不变"],"example":"例题： 用所给词的适当形式填空： Last Sunday we ______ (fly) kites in the park. It was so fun that we ______ (forget) the time. 解析： last Sunday定过去时： fly的过去式flew；forget过去式forgot(ABB类)。解析关键： 判断时态后按三态表取「过去式」一列。","extension":"进阶： 完成时与被动语态取的是「过去分词」列(gone/seen/broken)，与过去式列(went/saw/broke)分开记，做题先问句子要哪一列。","traps":"错误一： 三态串列： has went应为has gone(完成时用分词列)。错误二： He teached us应为taught(不规则不套ed)。错误三： The window was broke应为broken(被动用分词列)。错误四： read加ed变readed(三态拼写相同)。","examFocus":"语篇填空与完形直接考过去式拼写；完成时与被动语态考过去分词。得分关键： 三态表按四类分组滚动默写。","tags":["词汇语法","记忆方法"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"}]},{"uid":"english-8","name":"时态三: 一般将来时","grade":"八年级上册","order":7,"kps":[{"uid":"english-8-1","title":"will与be going to的区别","content":"两者都表将来，分工口诀： 「计划迹象going to，临场拍板will出手」。be going to用于： ①事先计划好的打算： We are going to visit my grandparents this weekend. ②有迹象表明要发生： Look at the black clouds! It is going to rain. will用于： ①说话时的临时决定： —The phone is ringing. —I will answer it. ②预测与承诺： I am sure our team will win. / I will help you with your English. ③自然规律或必然结果： If you water the flowers, they will grow better. 句式： be going to的疑问把be提前(Are you going to...)；will的疑问把will直接提前(Will you...)。否定分别为will not与be not going to。例句对照： ①I think it will rain tomorrow.(主观预测用will) ②They are going to build a new school here.(既定计划) ③Do not worry. I will not be late again.(承诺)。计划类作文(假期安排)用going to更地道。","keyPoints":["事先计划/当前迹象→be going to","临时决定/预测/承诺→will","be going to疑问把be提前；will疑问把will提前","will not与be not going to分别作否定","there be句型将来式: There will be / There is going to be"],"example":"例: Look at those dark clouds! It ___ (rain) soon. 解析: 「乌云密布」是看得见的迹象,推测即将下雨用 be going to,填 is going to rain。若只是天气预报式陈述,则用 will rain。找「证据/迹象」是解此类题的钥匙。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： 早已定好的计划用will显得突兀，应为are going to。错误二： 满天乌云的迹象推测说It will rain，更准确为is going to rain。错误三： will后误加to: will to go应为will go。错误四： going to后再接going叠用，或后接三单形式。","examFocus":"单选对比题常将will与be going to同时设项，按「计划迹象vs临场」分类即可秒选。听力对话亦高频。得分关键： 抓迹象词(Look! 黑云)与计划词(this weekend)分类作答。","tags":["基础必会","易错点","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-8-2","title":"一般将来时时间标志与句型","content":"一般将来时的骨架是will+动词原形，时间标志词是做题的「雷达」： tomorrow, the day after tomorrow, next week/month/year, in+时间段(in two days表两天后)， soon, from now on, in the future, tonight, before long。句式公式： 肯定will+V；否定will not+V；疑问Will+S+V？ 回答Yes, ...will. / No, ...will not.。三个特殊句型： ①there be的将来式： There will be a class meeting next Monday.(不说There will have) ②祈使句+and/or+将来句： Hurry up, or you will be late. / Work hard, and you will succeed. ③时间状语从句「主将从现」： I will send you a message as soon as I get home.(从句用一般现在表将来)。例句： ①Robots will do more housework for people in the future.(将来预测) ②We will have an English test in two days.(in+时间段) ③If it is fine tomorrow, we will go climbing.(if从句现表将来)。将来时写作(人生规划、未来生活)是中考高频话题，务必整篇时态统一。","keyPoints":["公式: will+动词原形；否定will not+原形","信号词: tomorrow, next..., in+时间段, soon, in the future","there be将来式用There will be，不用There will have","祈使句+and/or+will句: Hurry up, or you will be late","时间/条件状语从句用一般现在时表将来(主将从现)"],"example":"例: There ___ (be) an English party in our school tomorrow evening. 解析: tomorrow evening 表将来,There be 句型的将来时用 will be 或 is going to be。受汉语「将有」影响误写 There will have 是高频错误,必须根除。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： There will have应为There will be。错误二： in two days意为「两天后」，不可按过去时理解。错误三： as soon as从句误用will: as soon as I will get home应为get。错误四： tonight既可配将来也可配现在进行，不能死记一词套时态。","examFocus":"单选常考时间从句中的主将从现；完形靠next/in the future定将来基调；「未来生活」话题作文通篇将来时。得分关键： 圈出将来信号词，检查从句是否误加will。","tags":["基础必会","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-8-3","title":"表将来的其他方式","content":"will与be going to之外，初中还有四种「隐性将来」，口诀： 「位移进行表将来，about to马上来，时刻日程表现在，be to按安排」。①现在进行时表将来： 位移动词come, go, leave, arrive, start, fly的进行时表已安排的近期活动： The train is leaving at six this evening. / We are flying to Chengdu tomorrow. ②be about to+原形： 即将、正要，不与具体时间状语连用： The film is about to begin. ③一般现在时表将来： 时刻表、日程表等客观安排： The plane takes off at 9:00. / The class begins at eight tomorrow morning. ④be to+原形： 按计划或要求的正式安排： The headmaster is to give a speech at the meeting. 例句对照： ①I am going to the dentist this afternoon.(安排好的近期) ②The summer vacation is about to end.(即将) ③The concert starts at seven.(时刻表)。做单选时先看动词是否位移动词，再看是否有时刻表场景。","keyPoints":["位移动词进行时表近期安排: come/go/leave/arrive/start/fly","be about to+原形表即将，不加具体时间状语","时刻表用一般现在时表将来: The bus leaves at five","be to+原形表正式安排或命令","四种将来表达可共存，语感有别: 计划进行>正式be to"],"example":"例: — When ___ your father ___ (leave) for Chengdu? — Tomorrow morning. 解析: leave 是位移动词,「已定安排」可用现在进行时表将来,填 is, leaving。填 will, leave 也正确,前者更强调计划已定。","extension":"阅读遇到 I'll be waiting for you at the gate. 要能理解为「到时候我在门口等你」(将来进行时, 高中内容)。初中只需「认读」, 不必仿写。","traps":"错误一： 把is leaving理解为「正在离开」而误判时态，在明确未来时间词下它表安排。错误二： be about to后误加to叠用。错误三： 时刻表场景说The train will leave at 6 pm不如leaves地道。错误四： 非位移动词乱用进行时表将来： I am eating lunch tomorrow属中式表达。","examFocus":"单选以「动词类型+时间词」双线索设项，考查进行时表将来的识别；阅读长难句中about to提示情节即将转折。得分关键： 记住位移动词清单与时刻表场景。","tags":["拓展提升","易错点"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-8-4","title":"四种将来表达法的选用决策","content":"将来不止will一种，四种表达各有分工，决策口诀： 「临时will，计划going，安排进行，时刻表现在」。①will： 临时决定、预测、承诺、自然结果： I will help you with it. / I think our team will win. ②be going to： 事先计划或迹象推测： We are going to plant trees this weekend. / Look at the clouds! It is going to rain. ③现在进行时(位移动词)： 已安排的近期活动： come, go, leave, arrive, start, fly——We are leaving for Nanjing tomorrow. ④一般现在时： 时刻表与日程： The plane takes off at 9:00. 决策三问： 一问「是否早已计划」(是→going to)；二问「是否有明确时间表」(是→一般现在)；三问「是否临时起意或预测」(是→will)。例句： ①The concert starts at seven tonight.(时刻表) ②I am going to visit the museum this Saturday.(计划) ③—The box is heavy. —I will carry it for you.(临时决定)。同一语境换表达，语气随之变化，写作中可交替使用避免重复。","keyPoints":["临时决定/预测/承诺→will","事先计划/迹象推测→be going to","位移动词进行时表近期安排: are leaving tomorrow","时刻表/日程→一般现在时: takes off at nine","决策三问: 计划否/时刻表否/临时否"],"example":"例题： —Do you have any plans for Sunday? —Yes, I ______ (visit) my grandparents. 解析： 问句问「计划」，答句表既定安排，用am going to visit或am visiting均可；若选will visit则变成「临时决定」，与问句语境不符。语用语境决定语法形式。","extension":"进阶： be about to表「即将」，be to表「正式安排」： The line is to open next month.；四种将来形式在一篇作文里交替出现，是最地道的表达组合。","traps":"错误一： 计划类语境一律will(显生硬)。错误二： 迹象推测用will(黑云密布应用is going to)。错误三： 非位移动词乱用进行时表将来。错误四： 时刻表场景用will leave而非leaves。","examFocus":"单选以「语境分类」设四个选项；听力对话考语用差异。得分关键： 抓住问句中的plan/sign/时刻信号分类作答。","tags":["时态拓展","语用辨析"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"}]},{"uid":"english-9","name":"情态动词","grade":"八年级上册","order":8,"kps":[{"uid":"english-9-1","title":"can/may/must基本用法","content":"三大情态动词分工口诀： 「can能力许可否推测，may许可与可能，must必须与肯定推测」。can： ①能力： She can speak three languages. ②许可(口语)： Can I use your phone? ③否定推测can not(不可能)： It can not be Tom; he is in Beijing now. may： ①许可(正式)： May I come in? ②可能(推测)： It may rain this afternoon, so take an umbrella with you. must： ①必须(主观)： You must finish it before Friday. ②肯定推测： The lights are on; someone must be at home. must提问的否定回答： —Must I hand it in today? —No, you need not.(不必，不用must not) 例句： ①You must not smoke here.(must not表禁止) ②May I take the seat? —Sure, go ahead.(许可) ③He can not be at home now; I saw him leave just now.(否定推测)。","keyPoints":["can表能力/许可；can not表不可能的推测","may表许可与可能；may not表不可以","must表必须；must not表禁止(不许)","must提问的否定回答用need not(不必)","肯定推测must，否定推测can not"],"example":"例: — Must I hand in the report today? — No, you ___. You can hand it in tomorrow. 解析: must 提问的否定回答用 needn't 或 don't have to,表示「不必」。若答 mustn't(禁止)则与后句「可以明天交」矛盾。此对话是八年级上册必考场景。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： must提问用must not回答(中文「不行」直译)，应用need not或do not have to。错误二： may not误当「不可能」(may not是不可以/可能不)。错误三： 混淆must not(禁止)与need not(不必)。错误四： can表许可时在正式场合改用may更礼貌。","examFocus":"单选考「must提问否定回答」与推测等级；口语交际考礼貌许可。得分关键： 区分「不必」与「不许」。","tags":["中考高频","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-9-2","title":"have to/should/need用法","content":"三组半情态动词分工。have to： 客观环境「不得不」，有人称与时态变化： I have to look after my sick mother at home.(现在) / He had to walk to school yesterday because his bike was broken.(过去) / We will have to get up earlier next term.(将来) 与must分工口诀： 「must主观内驱，have to客观外压」。should： 义务与建议「应该」： You should brush your teeth twice a day. / You should not eat too much sweet food. need： ①实义动词： need to do(需要做)： You need to take more exercise. ②情态动词： need not(不必)： You need not tell him the news. 例句： ①I have to wear glasses because of my poor eyesight.(客观) ②Students should listen carefully in class.(建议) ③—Need I finish it today? —No, you need not.(情态用法)。回答need提问： 肯定用must(需要)，否定用need not。","keyPoints":["have to表客观不得不，可变时态(had to/will have to)","must主观必须，have to客观被迫","should表义务建议，should not表不建议","need实义用法need to do；情态用法need not","need提问: 肯定回答must，否定回答need not"],"example":"例: It was dark and rainy, so we ___ (have to) walk home last night. 解析: 「天又黑又下雨」是客观情况,「不得不走回家」,时间为昨晚,have to 用过去式填 had to。have to 能变时态是它与 must 的重要区别,也是考点所在。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： must与have to的时态： 昨天被迫应用had to而非must(must无过去式)。错误二： need not误当「不许」(是「不必」)。错误三： need to与need not混搭： He need not to go应为need not go或does not need to go。错误四： should后误加to。","examFocus":"单选考must/have to辨析与need句式；完形考情态语义逻辑；写作建议句should高频。得分关键： 分清主观客观、不必不许。","tags":["易错点","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-9-3","title":"情态动词表推测","content":"推测等级口诀： 「must一定，may可能，might也许，can not不可能」。对现在的推测： 情态+be/动词原形： The lights are on; someone must be at home.(一定在家) / It may rain this afternoon.(可能) / He can not be at home now; I saw him leave just now.(不可能)。对正在进行的推测： 情态+be doing： She must be cooking in the kitchen; I can smell the food. 对过去的推测(拓展)： 情态+have done: The ground is wet; it must have rained last night. 注意： 肯定推测用must，否定推测用can not，may not是「可能不」而非「不可能」。例句： ①That must be Mary; she always wears a red coat.(一定) ②He might know the answer; you can ask him.(或许) ③This answer can not be right; look at the sign again.(不可能)。推测题的信号： 题干出现判断依据(clues)却无直接陈述。","keyPoints":["肯定推测用must(把握最大)","can not表「不可能」，语气最强","may/might表「或许」，might更不确定","推测正在进行: 情态+be doing","推测过去(拓展): 情态+have done"],"example":"例: The light in Mr. Li's office is still on. He ___ (must/can't) be working now. 解析: 「办公室灯还亮着」是证据,推测「一定还在工作」,肯定推测用 must,填 must。若灯已熄灭,则说 He can't be working. 找证据、定方向,推测题一招制胜。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： 否定推测写成must not(应can not)。错误二： 把may not(可能不/不可以)当「不可能」。错误三： 推测句误加实义动词的过去式： must was应为must be。错误四： 依据不足时用must过度断言。","examFocus":"单选高频「推测等级排序」；完形靠证据强弱选情态词；九年级教材Unit 8推测主题课文是直接语料。得分关键： 先看证据强度再选情态词。","tags":["中考高频","易错点"],"difficulty":3,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-9-4","title":"情态动词易混辨析","content":"高频易混点集中扫荡。①would like=want的礼貌版： I would like a cup of tea. / Would you like to join us? 肯定回答Yes, I would love to. ②shall用于第一人称疑问表建议： Shall we go skating this afternoon? / Shall I open the window for you? ③will表意愿与请求： Will you please pass me the salt? ④used to与be used to： used to do(过去常常，现在不了)： He used to play computer games, but now he is used to studying hard.(be used to doing习惯于) ⑤can not help doing与can not wait to do(迫不及待)： The children can not wait to open the presents. 例句： ①Would you like something to drink？(礼貌提供) ②Shall we meet at the school gate at eight？(建议) ③My grandfather used to tell me stories before I fell asleep.(过去习惯)。辨析主线： 「意愿用will，建议用shall，礼貌用would」。","keyPoints":["would like表想要，礼貌于want","shall第一人称疑问表建议: Shall we...?","Will you please...?表请求","used to do过去常常；be used to doing习惯于","can not wait to do迫不及待做"],"example":"例: My grandpa ___ live in the countryside, but now he lives with us in the city. 解析: 「过去住乡下,现在住城里」是今昔对比,用 used to live,表示过去的习惯且现已结束。若填 was used to living 则意为「习惯于住在乡下」,与语境不符。","extension":"must have done(一定做过)、can't have done(不可能做过)、should have done(本该做而没做)是对过去的推测与责备, 高中核心考点, 初中先混个脸熟, 为衔接铺路。","traps":"错误一： used to后误接doing(应接原形)。错误二： be used to do(被用来做)与be used to doing(习惯于)混淆。错误三： Shall we...?回答用Yes, let us.误成Yes, we shall.。错误四： would like后误接原形之外的doing。","examFocus":"单选考used to/be used to辨析与shall建议句；口语交际考Would you like应答。得分关键： 记住三组同形异义短语。","tags":["拓展提升","易错点"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-9-5","title":"情态动词加have done: 对过去的推测与责备","content":"「情态动词+have+过去分词」专门评论过去，口诀： 「must have一定做，can not have不可能，may have或许做，should have本该做」。①must have done： 对过去的肯定推测： The ground is wet; it must have rained last night.(昨晚一定下过雨) ②can not have done： 对过去的否定推测： He can not have gone to the library; I saw him just now.(刚才还看见他) ③may/might have done： 对过去的可能推测： She might have forgotten the meeting.(可能忘了) ④should have done： 本应该做而没做(责备)： You should have finished it yesterday.(昨天就该完成) ⑤need not have done： 本不必做却做了： You need not have waited so long.(不必等那么久)。时间标记： 句中出现last night/yesterday等过去时间+推测语气，即启用本结构。例句： ①You should have told me earlier.(该早点告诉我) ②He must have left his phone at home; nobody answers it. ③She can not have said that; she is always polite.。判断步骤： 先看「评论的是过去」再看「语气强度」选情态词。","keyPoints":["must have done=过去一定做了(推测)","can not have done=过去不可能做了","may/might have done=过去或许做了","should have done=本该做而没做(责备)","need not have done=本不必做却做了"],"example":"例题： The lights in his room were off at eleven. He ______ at that time. A.must sleep B.must have slept C.should sleep D.can not have slept 解析： off at eleven是过去证据，推测「那时一定睡了」，对过去推测用must have done，选B。A缺have，C语气不对，D方向相反。","extension":"进阶： could have done本可以做而没做(惋惜)： You could have passed the exam.；would rather have done宁愿做过；这些与should have done同属「评论过去」家族。","traps":"错误一： must have done误当「必须已经做」。错误二： 否定推测写成must not have(应can not have)。错误三： should have done误当「将来应该做」。错误四： 对现在推测用have done(对现在推测用must be)。","examFocus":"单选拓展题高频区分项；完形靠证据强度选情态词。得分关键： 认准「过去证据+评论语气」双信号。","tags":["情态动词","高难拓展"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"}]},{"uid":"english-10","name":"时态四: 过去进行时","grade":"八年级下册","order":9,"kps":[{"uid":"english-10-1","title":"过去进行时构成与时间标志","content":"过去进行时表示「过去某一时刻或某一时段正在进行的动作」，公式： was/were+现在分词。was配I/他/她/它及单数名词，were配you/we/they及复数。标志词口诀： 「at加过去时刻，this time yesterday，when从句来配，while来相伴」： at eight last night, at that time, this time yesterday, the whole morning, when/while从句。句式： 否定was/were not doing；疑问Was/Were+S+doing？ 例句： ①I was doing my homework at nine last night.(at nine锁定过去时刻) ②What were you doing this time yesterday？(this time yesterday) ③They were having a meeting when the bell rang.(when从句作背景)。过去进行时常作「背景」，一般过去时作「插入事件」，构成叙事的「背景—打断」结构，是完形与故事写作的黄金句型。","keyPoints":["公式: was/were+现在分词，分词构成与现在进行时相同","信号词: at+过去时刻, this time yesterday, at that time, when/while","否定was/were not doing；疑问Was/Were提前","「背景+打断」句式: was doing...when...did","故事写作中用过去进行时铺背景，用一般过去时推进情节"],"example":"例: What ___ you ___ (do) at this time yesterday? I called you but nobody answered. 解析: at this time yesterday「昨天的这个时候」是过去某一时刻,该时刻正在进行的动作用过去进行时,填 were, doing。「没人接电话」正是「当时正忙着」的语境呼应。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： was/were与主语不配： You was...应为were。错误二： 漏ing: I was watch...应为watching。错误三： at that time既可指过去也可指此刻，须看语境定was/were或is/are。错误四： when从句里误用进行时表瞬间动作： when the bell was ringing应为rang。","examFocus":"单选高频「was doing...when...did」结构；完形靠时间线判断过去进行；「难忘的一天」类作文用过去进行时描绘场景。得分关键： 过去时刻词+进行式，双标记齐抓。","tags":["基础必会","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-10-2","title":"when与while的区别","content":"when与while都能引导时间状语从句，分工口诀： 「when宽来while窄，while必接长动作」。when从句既可用瞬间动词也可用延续动词： I was reading when someone knocked at the door.(knock是瞬间动作) while从句只接延续性动词，且常用进行时： While mother was cooking, I was doing my homework.(两个长动作同时进行)。两大黄金句型： ①「正在...突然...」： be doing...when...did: We were having dinner when the lights went out. ②「一边...一边/同时」： ...was doing...while...was doing: The singer was singing while the audience were cheering.。时态搭配规律： while从句进行时+主句进行时(同时背景)；while从句进行时+主句一般过去时(背景中被插入)。例句： ①When I got home, my mother was cooking dinner.(get瞬间，when引导) ②While we were waiting, the rain became heavier.(wait延续) ③He fell asleep while he was reading in bed.(read延续)。做题步骤： 看从句动词性质→定when/while→配时态。","keyPoints":["when从句可接瞬间动词与延续动词；while只接延续动词","瞬间动词作从句谓语时必用when: when the bell rang","while从句常用进行时，与主句进行时构成「同时背景」","黄金句型一: be doing...when...did(正在做突然发生)","黄金句型二: was doing...while...was doing(两个动作并行)"],"example":"例: I ___ (read) a magazine when someone knocked at the door. 解析: knocked 是瞬间动作,「看杂志」是当时正在进行的背景动作,主句用过去进行时,填 was reading。译文: 我正看杂志,忽然有人敲门。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： while后接瞬间动词： While he arrived应为When he arrived。错误二： while从句用一般过去表瞬间： while the phone rang应为when。错误三： when与while都能用时忽略语义： 强调「期间」用while更贴切。错误四： 主从句时态乱配： while I was cooking, the doorbell was ringing表意混乱，插入事件应用rang。","examFocus":"单选高频： 空前后分别为进行时与一般过去时，考when/while选用。完形靠两动作的先后与长短定连词。得分关键： 圈出从句动词，瞬间用when，延续用while。","tags":["基础必会","易错点","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-10-3","title":"过去进行时与一般过去时的区别","content":"两时态都在讲过去，区别口诀： 「进行没做完，一般做完了」。过去进行时强调「当时正在进行、未必完成」： I was writing a letter last night.(可能没写完) 一般过去时强调「已发生、已完成」： I wrote a letter last night.(写完了)。叙事公式「背景+事件」： 长动作用进行时作背景，短动作用一般过去时作情节推进： The children were flying kites when it started to rain.(放风筝是背景，开始下雨是事件)。对比组例句： ①When the teacher came in, we were talking loudly.(我们正吵着，被进门打断) ②I met an old friend while I was waiting at the bus stop.(等待是背景，遇见是事件) ③Yesterday I cleaned the classroom after school.(一次性完成动作用一般过去时)。判断三步： 找时间点→判断动作是否持续在当时→选择进行或一般。写作中「背景+事件」结构能让画面感倍增。","keyPoints":["进行=当时未必完成；一般过去=已完成有结果","背景动作用过去进行时；情节推进用一般过去时","黄金结构: was doing...when...did(背景被插入)","at eight last night配进行时；yesterday/last week配一般过去","叙述已完成的一系列动作用一般过去时串联"],"example":"例: When the teacher came in, the students ___ (talk) about the movie. 解析: 「老师进来」是瞬间插曲,「谈论电影」是当时正在进行的背景动作,填 were talking。若理解成「讨论过(已结束)」用 talked,但语境更支持「正在」。","extension":"过去进行时是「讲故事」的黄金时态: 英语故事常以 It was raining... A man was walking... 开篇铺陈场景。作文开头试着用它, 画面感立现。","traps":"错误一： 表已完成的动作用进行时： I was finishing it yesterday应为finished。错误二： 背景动作用一般过去，画面感缺失且逻辑别扭。错误三： when从句与while主句时态错配。错误四： ago类词误配进行时： Three days ago I was visiting...应为visited。","examFocus":"单选常给两个过去动作比先后；完形按情节线定两种时态；日记作文用「背景+事件」句式提分。得分关键： 先分清哪个动作长哪个动作短。","tags":["拓展提升","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"extension"}]},{"uid":"english-11","name":"时态五: 现在完成时","grade":"八年级下册","order":10,"kps":[{"uid":"english-11-1","title":"现在完成时构成与时间标志","content":"现在完成时公式： have/has+过去分词，has配三单主语。两大用法口诀： 「影响到现在，持续到如今」。①结果影响： 动作已结束但结果影响现在： I have lost my key.(现在没有钥匙，进不了门) ②延续至今： 动作从过去持续到现在： He has taught in this school for ten years.(现在还在教)。标志词阵营： already(肯定句，句中)， yet(否定疑问句尾)， just(刚刚)， ever(曾经)， never(从未)， recently, so far, in the past few years, these days, for/since+时间。already与yet分工口诀： 「already肯定句中站，yet句尾疑否见」。句式： 否定have/has not done；疑问Have/Has+S+done？ 回答Yes, ...have. / No, ...have not. 例句： ①I have already finished my homework.(already句中) ②Have you ever been to Hong Kong？(ever疑问) ③He has just cleaned the classroom, so it looks tidy now.(结果影响现在的证据)。完成时与just now不同： just now配一般过去时。","keyPoints":["公式: have/has+过去分词，has配三单","用法一: 过去动作对现在的影响(结果)","用法二: 从过去持续到现在(常配for/since/how long)","already用于肯定句中；yet用于否定疑问句尾","信号词: just, ever, never, recently, so far, in the past few years","just now(刚才)配一般过去时，just(刚刚)配现在完成时"],"example":"例: — Have you finished your report ___? — Not ___. Give me another hour, please. 解析: 第一空在疑问句末用 yet;第二空是否定回答「还没有」,用 yet(=Not yet)。yet 在疑问句与否定句中的双面角色是现在完成时第一考点。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： already误放句尾或用于疑问。错误二： have/has后误接过去式而非过去分词： has went应为has gone。错误三： 与just now混淆： I have seen him just now应为I saw him just now。错误四： 三单主语误用have: She have finished应为has finished。","examFocus":"单选与语篇填空双高频。语篇填空给动词+already/just/ever立即填have/has+过去分词；单选常考already与yet的位置。得分关键： 主语定have/has，标志词定完成时，过去分词写对。","tags":["中考高频","基础必会"],"difficulty":3,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-11-2","title":"have been to与have gone to","content":"三兄弟口诀： 「been to去过回，gone to人未归，been in蹲一段」。have been to+地点： 曾经去过，人已回来： I have been to Beijing twice.(去过两次，现在在家) have gone to+地点： 去了，人在路上或在那里，不在此地： Mr. Wang has gone to Shanghai on business.(王先生不在本地) have been in+地点+for/since: 一直待在某地多久： She has been in London for two years.(延续状态)。场景判断： 问「人在哪」用gone to回答；表「经历」用been to；表「住了多久」用been in。例句： ①My father has been to Chengdu on business twice.(去过已回) ②They have gone to the playground to play football.(人不在这) ③—How long have you been in this city？ —Since 2019.(提问延续)。注意gone to的主语不能是第一二人称(I have gone to...自相矛盾，除非表「去了某地」的特殊语境)。","keyPoints":["been to=去过(人已回)；gone to=去了(人未归)；been in=一直待","been to可带次数: twice；gone to常带目的短语","been in配for/since/how long表延续","对话中回答他人去向用has gone to","第一二人称一般不用have gone to(逻辑矛盾)"],"example":"例: — Where is Mr. Wang? — He ___ (go) to Shanghai. He'll be back next Monday. 解析: 问句表明王老师现在不在场,「去了上海还没回来」用 has gone to,填 has gone。若填 has been 则表示「去过(已回来)」,与 He'll be back next Monday 矛盾。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： 表经历说He has gone to Beijing twice，应为has been to twice。错误二： 人明显在场却说He has gone to...。错误三： 表居住延续误用been to: He has been to Beijing for ten years应为has been in。错误四： gone to后接副词时不带to: has gone there/home，不是has gone to there。","examFocus":"单选经典对比项： been to/gone to/been in三选一。听力对话考「人在不在」。得分关键： 抓主语是否还在说话现场，看句中是次数还是时间段。","tags":["易错点","中考高频"],"difficulty":3,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-11-3","title":"延续性动词与时间段连用","content":"核心规则口诀： 「瞬间动词不续航，转换延续才能长」。非延续性动词(瞬间动词)不能与for/since/how long等时间段连用，清单： buy, borrow, arrive, come, leave, die, get up, join, begin, start, lose, marry, finish, fall asleep。转换表(瞬间→延续)： buy→have had；borrow→have kept；die→have been dead；arrive/come→have been in/at；join→have been in或have been a member of；begin/start→have been on；get up→have been up；finish→have been over；lose→have not had。例句： ①His grandfather has been dead for two years.(不说has died for two years) ②I have kept the library book for two weeks.(不说have borrowed for two weeks) ③The meeting has been on for half an hour.(不说has begun for half an hour)。判断步骤： 看动词是否瞬间→看后面是否有for/since/how long→瞬间则找延续替身。这一规则是完成时板块最容易失分的一环。","keyPoints":["瞬间动词不能与for/since/how long连用","buy→have had；borrow→have kept；die→have been dead","join→have been in；begin→have been on；finish→have been over","get up→have been up；lose→have not had","瞬间动词的完成时可以单独出现，只是不能带时间段"],"example":"例: His grandfather ___ (die) for five years. 解析: die 是瞬间动词,不能与 for five years 连用,须改为延续性表达 has been dead。直接填 has died 就中了「瞬间动词+时间段」的经典陷阱。译文: 他爷爷去世五年了。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： He has died for three years应为has been dead。错误二： I have borrowed the book for a week应为have kept。错误三： The film has begun for an hour应为has been on。错误四： 把keep等延续动词误改成瞬间义： have kept写成have borrowed。","examFocus":"单选与语篇填空双考： 出现for two years/how long即启动「瞬间转延续」检查。写作中介绍经历时长时同样适用。得分关键： 背熟转换表，见时间段先查动词属性。","tags":["易错点","中考高频"],"difficulty":3,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-11-4","title":"现在完成时与一般过去时辨析","content":"两时态都谈过去，分水岭口诀： 「过去时间是过去时，影响现在用完成」。判断公式： 看时间状语+看与现在的关联。明确过去时间(yesterday, last week, in 2020, ...ago, just now, when I was young)→一般过去时： I saw the film last week. 无明确过去时间且强调对现在的影响或持续→现在完成时： I have seen the film, so I do not want to see it again.(影响： 看过不必再看) 时间轴理解： 现在完成时=过去发生+现在有果。so far, recently, already, ever, never, for/since属完成时阵营。例句： ①He has lived here since 2018.(至今还住) ②He lived here in 2018.(当年住过，现在未必) ③—Where have you been？ —I went to the park.(问完成答具体，混搭常见且正确)。完形中按情节与现在的关系选时态；经历类作文常用完成时开篇： I have learned English for six years.","keyPoints":["明确过去时间词→一般过去时","so far/already/ever/for/since→现在完成时","强调对现在的影响或延续至今→完成时","对话混搭: 问句用完成时，答句可带具体过去时间","just now配过去时；just配完成时"],"example":"例: — Have you ever visited the Great Wall? — Yes, I ___ (visit) it three years ago. 解析: 答语含 three years ago 明确过去时间,必须用一般过去时,填 visited。「前句问完成时,答句有时间就变过去时」是补全对话的固定套路。","extension":"终极口诀: 「有具体过去时间, 用过去时; 没有具体时间, 说影响, 用完成时」。做题先扫时间状语, 再自问: 这件事和现在有关系吗?","traps":"错误一： I have seen him yesterday应为I saw him yesterday(yesterday不允许完成时)。错误二： 叙述完整过去事件用完成时串场。错误三： in the past few years误判为过去时间，其实配完成时。错误四： how long提问时用一般过去时回答。","examFocus":"单选最经典的「双时态对比」题型；完形靠叙事时间线切换两时态；书面表达经历类首句定完成时。得分关键： 见过去时间词杀完成时，见影响信号选完成时。","tags":["拓展提升","易错点","中考高频"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-11-5","title":"现在完成时信号词全家桶","content":"把完成时标志词按句式功能分四组，口诀： 「肯定already句中藏，疑否yet句尾装，just刚ever曾，never不曾so far远」。第一组(位置)： already(肯定句中)， yet(否定疑问句尾)， just(句中，紧跟have/has)。第二组(经历)： ever(曾经)， never(从未)——Have you ever been to Beijing? / I have never seen the sea. 第三组(延续)： for+时间段(for three years)， since+过去时间点(since 2018/since he left)， how long， so far， up to now， in the past few years。第四组(结果影响)： 副词recently, lately；名词短语this week/month(未结束时)。例句： ①I have just finished my homework.(just句中) ②He has not replied yet.(yet句尾) ③We have learned 2,000 words so far.(so far)。注意信号词与句式的配套： already问句表惊讶时也可用(惊讶语气)，但中考以标准用法为主。见到信号词先写have/has，再挑过去分词。","keyPoints":["already肯定句中；yet否定疑问句尾；just句中","ever/never表经历: Have you ever...?","for+时间段/since+过去点表延续","so far/up to now/in the past few years配完成时","recently/lately常配完成时"],"example":"例题： 选词填空(already/yet/just)： (1)I have ______ seen the film twice. (2)Has the train arrived ______? 解析： (1)肯定句、句中位置，填already；(2)疑问句、句尾位置，填yet。本题考位置与句式双配套，是完成时板块送分题。","extension":"进阶： this morning类时间词看「说话时刻」——上午说this morning配完成时(早晨还没结束)，下午说则配过去时；同一短语两种时态，全看说话人站在哪个时间点。","traps":"错误一： already用于否定句(应yet)。错误二： yet放句中。错误三： since后接现在时间(since two years错，应for two years或since two years ago)。错误四： never句误用一般现在时。","examFocus":"语篇填空出现already/just/so far即锁定have/has+过去分词；单选考already与yet位置互换。得分关键： 信号词与句式配套记忆。","tags":["时态专项","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-11-6","title":"It is与has been加since句型","content":"since句型两大公式： ①It is/has been+时间段+since+一般过去时从句： It is three years since we met last time.(自上次见面已三年) ②时间段+has passed since...： Three years has passed since we met. since从句固定用一般过去时，主句用is或has been均可，口语中It is更常见。主句的时间段还可以是动作： It has been two weeks since he left Beijing.(他离开北京两周了)。同义转换链： He has been in the army for two years. = He joined the army two years ago. = It is two years since he joined the army. = Two years has passed since he joined the army. 例句： ①It is five years since I came to this school.(来校五年) ②How long is it since they got married？(结婚多久了) ③It has been a long time since I heard from you.(好久没收到你的信了)。这一句型把「完成时+for/since」与「一般过去」串成转换题的常客。","keyPoints":["公式: It is/has been+时间段+since+过去时从句","since从句永远一般过去时","同义转换: has been...for...=...ago=It is...since...","Two years has passed since...(时间段作主语单数)","hear from sb收到某人来信"],"example":"例题： 同义句转换： He left his hometown ten years ago.(用It改写) 解析： It is ten years since he left his hometown. / It has been ten years since he left his hometown.。要点： ago句变since句时时间状语照搬，从句动词保持过去式left。","extension":"进阶： since从句若是持续性动词，句意反转： It is three years since he lived here.(他不住这儿已三年)——live延续动词表「自那以后没再」，这是since句型的最深水区，中考拓展题偶见。","traps":"错误一： since从句用现在完成时(应一般过去时)。错误二： It is...since he has left错配。错误三： Two years have passed(时间段作主语视为整体，用has)。错误四： 与for连用说since two years(应for two years)。","examFocus":"句型转换题高频；单选考since从句时态。得分关键： 记住「is/has been可互换，从句永远过去时」。","tags":["句型转换","完成时专项"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"}]},{"uid":"english-12","name":"状语从句","grade":"八年级下册","order":11,"kps":[{"uid":"english-12-1","title":"时间状语从句","content":"时间状语从句由when, while, as, before, after, as soon as, until, since, once引导。时态总口诀： 「主将从现」——主句用将来时，从句用一般现在时表将来： I will call you as soon as I arrive in Guangzhou. until两副面孔： 肯定句「到...为止」(延续动词)： He waited until the rain stopped. 否定句not...until「直到...才」(瞬间动词)： He did not go to bed until he finished his homework. before/after自带先后： After he finished his homework, he went out for a walk. since从句配完成时主句： It has been three years since we met last time. 例句： ①As soon as I get home, I will send you a photo.(as soon as表「一...就」) ②While mother was cooking, I set the table.(while表同时) ③Before you leave the room, please turn off the lights.(before表先后)。做题三步： 认引导词→定主从句先后→按「主将从现」配时态。","keyPoints":["when/while/as表同时；before/after表先后；as soon as表「一...就」","主将从现: 主句将来，从句一般现在表将来","not...until=直到...才，配瞬间动词；until肯定句配延续动词","since从句(一般过去时)+主句现在完成时","when可作「就在那时」: I was about to leave when it began to rain"],"example":"例: I'll tell him the news as soon as he ___ (come) back tomorrow. 解析: as soon as 引导时间状语从句,主句 I'll tell 是将来时,从句按「主将从现」用一般现在时,填 comes。句中即使出现 tomorrow,从句也不用 will。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： as soon as从句误用will: as soon as I will arrive应为arrive。错误二： not...until配延续动词表意混乱： He did not stand there until...结构别扭。错误三： since从句用现在完成时，主句反而用过去时。错误四： when并列连词用法(正在这时)与疑问词when混淆。","examFocus":"单选高频「主将从现」与not...until；完形靠从句判断情节先后；书面表达用as soon as提升句式。得分关键： 圈出从句引导词，从句永远不加will。","tags":["中考高频","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-12-2","title":"条件状语从句: 主将从现","content":"条件状语从句由if, unless, as long as(只要)引导。核心公式： 「if条件现表将，主句将来从句现」： If it rains tomorrow, we will stay at home. unless=if not: Unless you work hard, you will not pass the exam. = If you do not work hard, you will not pass the exam. as long as表唯一条件： As long as you keep trying, you will make progress. 两类结果句式： ①祈使句+and/or+陈述句： Hurry up, or you will miss the train. / Work hard, and you will succeed. ②主句也可用情态动词： If you feel tired, you can take a rest. 例句： ①If it is fine tomorrow, we will go climbing.(从句用is) ②We will have the sports meeting unless it rains.(unless自带否定) ③If you ask him, he will help you.(条件真实)。判断要点： 从句中的will只出现在「愿意」义中(If you will help me...)，表将来一律不用will。","keyPoints":["if/unless/as long as引导条件从句，从句用一般现在表将来","unless=if not，主句不再双重否定","祈使句+and/or+将来句: Hurry up, or you will be late","主句可用will/情态动词/祈使句，从句不用will","if从句will仅表「愿意」，不表将来"],"example":"例: We will have a picnic unless it ___ (rain) this Saturday. 解析: unless 引导条件从句,主句 will have 表将来,从句用一般现在时,主语 it 三单,填 rains。句意: 除非周六下雨,否则我们就去野餐。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： If it will rain tomorrow...应为rains(从句不加will)。错误二： unless与not连用造成双重否定： Unless you do not...意为「除非你不」。错误三： or与and用反： 表反面结果用or。错误四： 混淆if条件从句与if宾语从句： I do not know if he will come(宾从可用will)。","examFocus":"单选每年必考「主将从现」，常与unless设双选项；完形首段常给条件关系；写作中if条件句表建议高频。得分关键： 见if/unless先检查从句时态。","tags":["中考高频","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-12-3","title":"原因、结果与目的状语从句","content":"三类从句各司其职。原因从句： because(直接原因，回答why，语气最强)， since/now that(既然，双方已知)， as(附带原因)。用法公式： 问why答because；已知理由用since。结果从句： so...that与such...that，公式： so+形容词/副词+that；such+a/an+形容词+单数名词+that；such+形容词+复数/不可数+that。 He was so tired that he fell asleep at once. / It was such a moving film that many people cried. 目的从句： so that/in order that+can/could/may/might: Speak louder so that everyone can hear you. 例句： ①Because he was ill, he did not come to school.(直接原因) ②Since everyone is here, let us begin.(既然) ③He got up early so that he could catch the first bus.(目的)。so...that与such...that互转口诀： 「so后接形副，such后接名」。","keyPoints":["because回答why；since/now that表已知理由；as附带原因","so+adj/adv+that；such+名词短语+that","such a moving film = so moving a film(名词前such)","so that/in order that+情态动词(could/may/might)","so many/much/few/little+名词用so不用such"],"example":"例: The math problem was ___ difficult ___ nobody in our class could work it out. 解析: difficult 是形容词,「如此难以至于没人解出」用 so...that,填 so, that。若用 such 须接名词: It was such a difficult problem that nobody could work it out.","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： such后接形容词裸用： such beautiful应为so beautiful(无名词时用so)。错误二： so much people应为so many people(可数用many)。错误三： because与so连用： Because...so...只能留一个。错误四： so that从句漏情态动词： ...so that everyone hears you应为can hear you。","examFocus":"单选考so/such辨析与so that目的从句；完形靠因果逻辑选连词；写作用so...that提升描写。得分关键： 看that后是形容词还是名词定so/such。","tags":["中考高频","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-12-4","title":"让步状语从句与连词易混辨析","content":"让步从句表「虽然、尽管、即使」。引导词清单： though/although(虽然)， even if/even though(即使)， wh-ever=no matter wh-(无论)： whatever=no matter what, wherever=no matter where, whoever=no matter who。核心规则口诀： 「though不能配but，yet与still可以」： Though it was raining hard, the players kept training. = It was raining hard, but the players kept training. though可作副词置于句尾： It is hard work. I enjoy it, though. even if表假设的让步： Even if I fail, I will not give up trying. wh-ever引导让步从句： No matter what happens, I will stay with you. / Whatever you say, I will not change my mind. 例句： ①Although he is over seventy, he still works on the farm.(yet/still可共存) ②Even though it was late, the lights in the office were still on. ③Wherever you go, I will follow you.(无论你去哪)。though与although基本通用，although更正式，不能放句尾。","keyPoints":["though/although不能与but连用，可与yet/still连用","even if/even though表「即使」的假设让步","wh-ever=no matter wh-表「无论」","though可作副词放句尾，although不能","though/although从句可与倒装as结构互换(拓展)"],"example":"例: ___ it was raining heavily, ___ the farmers went on working in the fields. 解析: 前后是让步转折关系,第一空填 Though/Although「虽然」;第二空不能填 but(英语中 though 与 but 不互相搭配),可填 yet/still 或什么都不填。「双连词并用」是母语迁移造成的经典错误。","extension":"because语气最强(回答why), since表「既然」, as表「由于」。写作中轮换使用三种原因表达, 避免通篇because, 语言层次立现。","traps":"错误一： Although...but...连用(中文「虽然但是」直译)。错误二： though与but、so同时出现在一句。错误三： no matter what与whatever引导名词性从句时的差异： 宾从只能用whatever(I will eat whatever you cook中不能换no matter what)。错误四： even if与even so混用。","examFocus":"单选考「though不连but」与wh-ever选用；完形考让步逻辑(前让步后转折)；写作中让步句可显辩证思维。得分关键： 让步连词出现即检查句中多余but。","tags":["拓展提升","易错点"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-12-5","title":"not...until与as soon as深水区","content":"时间从句两大深水区集中突破。not...until口诀： 「until肯定到...为止(配延续动词)，not...until直到...才(配瞬间动词)」。肯定句： He waited until the rain stopped.(wait延续) 否定句： He did not go to bed until he finished his homework.(go瞬间) 强调句升级： It was not until midnight that he came back.(not until的强调句型，拓展)。as soon as「一...就」： 时态公式「主将从现」与「主过从过」： I will call you as soon as I arrive. / As soon as he came home, he turned on the TV. 相关拓展： hardly...when与no sooner...than(刚...就)： The bus had hardly left when the rain poured down. 例句： ①The children did not stop playing until it was dark.(直到天黑才停) ②As soon as the bell rang, the students rushed out of the classroom. ③We will set off as soon as the rain stops.(从句现表将)。两结构都属「时间先后」逻辑，完形中考查情节衔接。","keyPoints":["until肯定句配延续动词；not...until配瞬间动词","not...until=直到...才","强调句型: It was not until...that...(拓展)","as soon as: 主将从现/主过从过","hardly...when刚...就(拓展)"],"example":"例题： (1)He ______ (not go) to sleep until his mother came back. 解析： not...until配过去时，填did not go。(2)I will tell him the news as soon as he ______ (return). 解析： as soon as从句主将从现，填returns(三单)。一题考语序结构，一题考从句时态。","extension":"进阶： not until置于句首引发部分倒装(Not until his mother came back did he go to sleep.)属高阶句式，读长难句时能识别即可，写作慎用。","traps":"错误一： not...until配延续动词表意混乱。错误二： as soon as从句加will。错误三： until从句用将来时。错误四： hardly...when前句用一般过去(应过去完成had hardly left)。","examFocus":"单选高频not...until与as soon as时态；完形考时间先后衔接。得分关键： 认准「才」与「一...就」两个语义标记。","tags":["状语从句","中考高频"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"}]},{"uid":"english-13","name":"被动语态","grade":"九年级上册","order":12,"kps":[{"uid":"english-13-1","title":"被动语态构成与各时态形式","content":"被动语态公式： be+过去分词，口诀「「be随时态变，过分不动摇」」。各时态被动形式速查： 一般现在时am/is/are done；一般过去时was/were done；一般将来时will be done；现在完成时have/has been done；情态动词can/must/should be done；现在进行时am/is/are being done(拓展)；过去完成时had been done(拓展)。例句： ①English is spoken all over the world.(一般现在被动) ②The bridge was built in 1998.(一般过去被动) ③A new hospital will be built in our town.(将来被动) ④The classroom has already been cleaned.(完成被动)。使用场景： 不知道或不必说出执行者、强调动作承受者、科技说明文。by短语引出执行者，无必要则省： The window was broken by the boy. 无施动者的客观叙述更常见： Rice is grown in the south.","keyPoints":["公式: be+过去分词，be随时态与主语变化","一般现在: am/is/are done；一般过去: was/were done","将来: will be done；完成: have/has been done；情态: can be done","by+执行者，代词用宾格，常可省略","强调动作承受者或不知道执行者时用被动"],"example":"例: Trees ___ (plant) in our city every spring, and last year over 10,000 trees ___ (plant). 解析: 两空 trees 与 plant 都是被动关系「树被种植」;every spring 用一般现在时被动 are planted,last year 用一般过去时被动 were planted。一题双空考 be 的时态变化,过去分词不变。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： 漏be只留过去分词： The problem solved应为was solved。错误二： be与过去分词间误加to。错误三： 完成时被动写成have been done时漏been: have been built别丢been。错误四： 不及物动词(happen, take place)误加被动。","examFocus":"单选考各时态被动形式；语篇填空给动词+主语为受事者即填被动；书面表达用被动显客观(英文报纸常谈)。得分关键： 先定be的时态，再接过去分词。","tags":["中考高频","记忆口诀"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-13-2","title":"主动变被动三步骤","content":"主动变被动公式口诀： 「宾变主，主变by，be加过分时态随」。三步骤： ①原宾语变主语(代词从宾格变主格) ②be+过去分词，be的时态与原句一致，人称数随新主语 ③原主语变by短语(代词用宾格)，可省略。示范： Farmers grow rice in the south. → Rice is grown in the south (by farmers). / People speak English in many countries. → English is spoken in many countries. / The students clean the classroom every day. → The classroom is cleaned (by the students) every day. 疑问句被动： Did people plant these trees? → Were these trees planted (by people)? 例句： ①We will hold a sports meeting next week. → A sports meeting will be held next week. ②You must finish the work today. → The work must be finished today. ③They have sold out the tickets. → The tickets have been sold out. 变换后务必检查： be的单复数与新主语一致、原时态保留。","keyPoints":["步骤一: 宾语变主语，代词主格化","步骤二: be+过去分词，时态照搬原句","步骤三: 主语变by短语，代词宾格化，常省略","疑问句被动把be提前: Were these trees planted?","新主语的单复数决定be的形式"],"example":"例: People produce silk in Suzhou. (改为被动句) 解析: 宾语 silk 升为主语,produce 变 is produced,执行者 people 放 by 后可省: Silk is produced (by people) in Suzhou. 地点状语 in Suzhou 原位保留在句尾。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： 忘记调整be的单复数： The books is written应为are written。错误二： 时态照搬失败： 主动was doing变被动丢进行。错误三： by后用主格代词： by he应为by him。错误四： 短语动词丢介词： look after变被动必须完整be looked after。","examFocus":"句型转换题直接考三步法；单选给主动句选被动句。得分关键： 抄下原句时态→套be→核对单复数。","tags":["答题模板","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-13-3","title":"不用被动语态的情形","content":"四类情况不用被动，口诀： 「不及物与系动词，状态动词少被动」。①不及物动词无宾语可变： happen, take place, come true, break out, appear, disappear, rise： The accident happened last night.(不说was happened) ②系动词+形容词作表语： look, sound, feel, taste, smell, seem, become, turn, get： The song sounds beautiful.(不说is sounded beautiful) ③表示状态的关系动词： have(拥有)， own, belong to, cost, fit, suit, hold(容纳)， contain： This coat fits me well. / The house belongs to my uncle. ④宾语为反身代词或同源宾语： enjoy oneself, teach oneself。例句： ①Great changes have taken place in my hometown.(take place无被动) ②The milk tastes a little sour.(taste系动词) ③The dictionary cost me fifty yuan.(cost表花费无被动)。判断方法： 主语是「事件/性状/拥有关系」时，多数不走被动。","keyPoints":["不及物动词: happen/take place/come true/break out无被动","系动词+形容词: sound/look/taste/feel/smell无被动","状态动词: have(拥有)/own/belong to/cost/fit无被动","反身代词作宾语的短语无被动: enjoy oneself","take place可换happen，二者都无被动"],"example":"例: — Why is this kind of cloth so popular? — Because it ___ (wash) easily. 解析: 「这种布料好洗」用主动形式表被动意义,wash 用一般现在时,填 washes。切记不填 is washed。同类: sell well 畅销, write smoothly 好写。","extension":"初中「主动表被动」记住三句: The book sells well. The cloth washes easily. The pen writes smoothly. 主语是物, 谓语主动, 却表被动含义, 与「不及物动词无被动」一起记。","traps":"错误一： The sports meeting was taken place应为took place。错误二： The music is sounded beautiful应为sounds beautiful。错误三： This pen was belonged to me应为belongs to。错误四： 主语是物就套被动，忽视动词类型。","examFocus":"单选以「无被动动词」设错误选项；语篇填空若动词是happen类，直接用主动。得分关键： 记住四类免被动清单，见清单词跳过被动。","tags":["拓展提升","易错点"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-13-4","title":"双宾语与复合宾语的被动变换","content":"两类特殊句型的被动变换。①双宾语句(动词带直接宾语与间接宾语)： give, show, teach, send, offer, pass, lend, bring, buy——主动： The teacher gave us some advice. 变被动有两条路： 路一「人间接宾语升主语」： We were given some advice (by the teacher). 路二「物直接宾语升主语」： Some advice was given to us (by the teacher). 保留词规则： 人升主语不用保留词；物升主语要加to(give/show/teach/send类)或for(buy/make/find类)： A kite was bought for the little boy. ②复合宾语句(宾语+宾补)： make/see/watch/hear/let+sb+do——主动省to，被动还原to： The boss made the workers work day and night. → The workers were made to work day and night. / We saw him enter the room. → He was seen to enter the room. 例句： ①She was shown a new way of working.(双宾被动) ②A birthday card was made for me by my daughter.(for保留词) ③He was seen to cross the street.(被动还原to)。变换后逐一检查： be时态、单复数、保留词、to还原四件套。","keyPoints":["双宾动词: give/show/teach/send/offer/pass/lend/buy","人间接宾语升主语： 不加保留词","物升主语加to或for: advice was given to us","buy/make/find类用for保留词","宾补句被动还原to: be made to do"],"example":"例题： 变被动语态： My uncle bought me a new bike. 解析： 路一： I was bought a new bike. ——生硬少用；路二(规范)： A new bike was bought for me (by my uncle).。buy属for类动词，物升主语必须带for。","extension":"进阶： ask/answer类动词带双宾时被动常用「人间接宾语」路： I was asked a lot of questions at the meeting.；阅读中出现was given a chance类句式即双宾被动。","traps":"错误一： 物升主语漏保留词： A book was given me应为was given to me。错误二： buy类误用to保留词。错误三： 复合宾语被动忘还原to: was seen enter。错误四： 双宾被动后介词宾格混乱。","examFocus":"句型转换题与单选双考；完形偶尔出现双宾被动句式。得分关键： 记住「to类与for类」保留词分组。","tags":["被动语态","句型转换"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-13-5","title":"短语动词的被动与get加过去分词","content":"短语动词变被动，口诀： 「介副不丢，整体上锁」。短语动词当作一个及物动词整体处理，被动形式完整保留介词/副词： look after→be looked after；take care of→be taken care of；laugh at→be laughed at；turn on→be turned on；pay attention to→be paid attention to；speak highly of→be spoken highly of。例句： ①The babies are looked after by the nurses in the kindergarten. ②The lights should be turned off before you leave the classroom. ③The old man was often laughed at in the past.(被嘲笑)。get+过去分词是口语化的被动： get dressed(穿衣服)， get married(结婚)， get lost(迷路)， get hurt(受伤)， get washed(洗漱)——例句： He got hurt in the basketball game yesterday. / Be careful, or you will get lost in the mountains.。get被动不与by短语连用，表「状态变化」；考试书面语以be被动为主，get形式在阅读与听力中识别即可。","keyPoints":["短语动词被动保留介词副词: be looked after","take care of→be taken care of；laugh at→be laughed at","pay attention to→be paid attention to","get+过去分词表口语被动: get dressed/get lost/get hurt","get被动不带by短语"],"example":"例题： 变被动： People often laugh at the boy for his strange clothes. 解析： laugh at是短语动词，被动整体保留at： The boy is often laughed at for his strange clothes (by people).。often位置不变，介词at不可丢。","extension":"进阶： 「动词+副词」型短语(pass on, put off)被动时副词可在过去分词前或后： The meeting was put off.；阅读科技文里be based on, be made of/from高频出现，属短语被动大家族。","traps":"错误一： 被动丢介词： The boy is often laughed错，应laughed at。错误二： take care of被动写成be taken care。错误三： get hurt误加by短语。错误四： 短语动词拆散改被动(look after不能拆成after was looked)。","examFocus":"单选与句型转换考短语被动完整性；语篇填空在被动语境考整体形式。得分关键： 把短语动词当「一个词」背。","tags":["被动语态","短语动词"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"}]},{"uid":"english-14","name":"宾语从句","grade":"九年级上册","order":13,"kps":[{"uid":"english-14-1","title":"宾语从句引导词三选一","content":"宾语从句三类引导词，选用公式： 原句是陈述句→that(无义，可省)；原句是一般疑问句→if/whether(有义「是否」)；原句是特殊疑问句→保留疑问词(what/when/where/why/who/whose/how)。if与whether分工口诀： 「介后不定or not，whether来把if替」： ①介词后只用whether： I am thinking about whether I should go. ②不定式前只用whether： We discussed whether to have the meeting. ③与or not直接连用只用whether： I do not care whether or not he will come. ④主语/表语从句用whether。例句： ①I hear (that) the movie is worth watching.(that引导陈述) ②Do you know if the shop is open on Sundays？(if引导一般疑问) ③Could you tell me where the nearest bank is？(疑问词引导)。选词三步： 看原句类型→定引导词→注意if/whether限制。","keyPoints":["陈述句宾从用that，that常可省略","一般疑问句宾从用if/whether，译为「是否」","特殊疑问句宾从保留疑问词","介词后/不定式前/or not前只用whether","I wonder if/whether...表委婉询问"],"example":"例: I don't know ___ he will come tomorrow. ___ he comes, I'll call you at once. 解析: 第一空引导 know 的宾语「他明天是否来」,用 if/whether;第二空是条件「如果他来」,用 If。同一个 if,一为「是否」一为「如果」,看从句功能即可区分。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： 特殊疑问句宾从误用if: I do not know if is the library open语序混乱。错误二： discuss等词后用if应为whether(介词类动词后)。错误三： that在宾从中误译出「那个」义。错误四： whether or not拆开写成if or not。","examFocus":"单选高频「引导词三选一」；语篇填空无提示词空格常考if/that/疑问词；口语交际问路场景高频。得分关键： 先判断从句原句类型再选词。","tags":["中考高频","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-14-2","title":"宾语从句语序: 陈述语序","content":"宾语从句必须用陈述语序，公式： 引导词+主语+谓语+其余部分，口诀「「从句永远不倒装，助动词要下场」」。疑问句变宾从三步： ①选引导词 ②把疑问句的倒装还原成陈述： 助动词do/does/did删除 ③动词时态与主句呼应。示范： Where does he live？ → I do not know where he lives.(does删除，live加s) / What is she doing？ → Tell me what she is doing.(is doing本就是陈述序，保留) / Who broke the window？ → She asked who broke the window.(主语疑问词本身作主语，语序不变) 例句： ①Can you tell me how I can get to the zoo？(how I can) ②I wonder why the train was late.(why the train was) ③He asked when they would start.(when they would)。主句疑问+从句陈述的复合句是中考句法骨架。","keyPoints":["宾从公式: 引导词+主语+谓语(陈述语序)","一般疑问句变宾从删除助动词do/does/did","does删除后动词按主语与主句时态变形","疑问词作从句主语时语序不变: who broke the window","主句可以是疑问句，从句永远是陈述序"],"example":"例: Could you tell me ___? A. how can I get to the station B. how I can get to the station 解析: 宾语从句用陈述语序,主语 I 在前,情态动词 can 在后,选B。应试技巧: 先排除「疑问语序」选项,再比时态与引导词,命中率极高。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： 直接搬疑问句语序： I do not know where does he live。错误二： 忘记删除did后给动词变形： ...when did they start→when they started。错误三： what is she doing误改成what she is doing时把is也删了。错误四： 特殊疑问词作主语时画蛇添足加did。","examFocus":"单选与句型转换高频；语篇填空考察从句内动词形式。得分关键： 还原陈述语序后再检查时态呼应。","tags":["中考高频","答题模板","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-14-3","title":"宾语从句时态呼应","content":"宾语从句时态呼应三规则口诀： 「主现从任意，主过从过，真理永远现在」。①主句是一般现在时，从句按实际需要用任何时态： I hear that he has finished the work. / I hear that they will leave soon. ②主句是一般过去时，从句用过去的某种时态(一般过去/过去进行/过去完成)： He said that he was watching TV then. / She told me she had seen the film. ③从句内容是客观真理、自然规律，永远用一般现在时： The teacher told us that the earth goes around the sun. 例句： ①He asked if I had finished my homework.(主过从过) ②I think (that) it will rain tomorrow.(主现从将) ③The scientist said that light travels faster than sound.(真理例外)。呼应出错的信号： 主句said/told/was told等过去动词后从句出现is/does/will，立刻警惕。","keyPoints":["主句现在时→从句按实际任意时态","主句过去时→从句用过去范畴时态","客观真理永远一般现在时，不受主句影响","主过从过: said that he was / had done","呼应检查信号: 主句过去动词后从句出现现在时形式"],"example":"例: Our teacher told us that light ___ (travel) much faster than sound. 解析: 「光比声音传播快」是客观真理,不受主句 told 约束,从句仍用一般现在时,填 travels。真理特例是命题人检测「真懂」的反套路题。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： He said he is busy应为was。错误二： 真理句跟随主句变成过去： said that the earth went around the sun错误。错误三： 主句过去时从句用将来will，应为would。错误四： 混淆「时间状语」： the next day与tomorrow在不同主句时态下的选用。","examFocus":"单选每年必考「呼应+真理例外」；完形长叙事中宾从时态层层递进；语篇填空给said类主句提示从句用过去式。得分关键： 主句时态一锤定音，真理句除外。","tags":["中考高频","易错点"],"difficulty":3,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-14-4","title":"否定前移与疑问词+to do互换","content":"两大进阶规则。①否定前移： 当主句是I/we think, believe, suppose, expect且要否定从句时，否定词not提到主句，口诀「「我思我想否定移」」： I do not think he is right.(不说I think he is not right) 其反意疑问句跟从句： I do not think he is right, is he？ ②疑问词+to do与宾从互换： I do not know what to do next. = I do not know what I should do next. 常见搭配动词： know, ask, tell, teach, learn, show, forget, wonder, decide。例句： ①I do not think it will rain tomorrow.(否定前移) ②Could you tell me which bus to take？(=which bus I should take) ③We have not decided where to spend the holiday.(=where we will spend)。注意： 主句主语是第三人称时不可前移： He thinks you are not right(不能前移)。","keyPoints":["think/believe/suppose/expect主语为I/we时否定前移","否定前移后反意疑问句与从句一致","疑问词+to do=疑问词+主语+should+do","可接「疑问词+to do」的动词: know/ask/tell/teach/show/decide","第三人称主语的think不可否定前移"],"example":"例: I don't think the little girl can swim across the river, ___? 解析: 主句是否定的 don't think,反意疑问句须跟从句 the little girl can swim,且用肯定形式,填 can she。「否定记在主句,尾巴看向从句」,是细节拉分点。","extension":"「疑问词+to do」也是写作提分利器: I don't know what to say. 比 I don't know what I should say. 更简洁地道, 宾从简化是书面语「高级感」的来源之一。","traps":"错误一： I think he is not right中式语序(可以理解但不地道，中考判错)。错误二： 前移后反意疑问句仍跟主句： ..., do not I错误，应为is he。错误三： what to do误写成how to do(做什么用what)。错误四： show/tell后漏宾语： show me how to do it。","examFocus":"单选考否定前移与反意疑问句搭配；句型转换考「疑问词+to do」与宾从互转。得分关键： 见I do not think结构立刻检查后续问句。","tags":["拓展提升","易错点","中考高频"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-14-5","title":"宾语从句语序陷阱与时态呼应","content":"宾从两大规则的「综合训练营」，口诀： 「语序先还原，时态再呼应」。语序还原三步： ①判断原句类型(陈述/一般疑问/特殊疑问) ②选引导词(that/if-whether/疑问词) ③把倒装还原成「引导词+主语+谓语」，删除助动词do/does/did并给动词「变形补偿」： Where does he live？ → I do not know where he lives.(does删除，live加s) 时态呼应三规则： 主句现在时，从句任意；主句过去时，从句用过去范畴(一般过去/过去进行/过去完成/表过去将来would)；客观真理永远一般现在时： The teacher told us that light travels faster than sound. 综合陷阱题的特征： 主句said类过去动词+特殊疑问句，两规则叠加： She asked when the train would arrive.(would arrive过去将来+陈述语序) 例句： ①He asked if I had finished the report.(主过从过+if引导) ②Do you know what time the plane takes off？(主现从现+陈述语序) ③Nobody knows why he was late this morning.(疑问词作状语)。做题顺序： 先语序后时态，最后查三单。","keyPoints":["语序公式: 引导词+主语+谓语(陈述序)","删do/does/did后给动词变形补偿(加s/变过去)","主句过去时从句用过去范畴时态","客观真理永远一般现在时","said类主句+疑问句=语序与时态双陷阱"],"example":"例题： Could you tell me ______? A.when the meeting will begin B.when will the meeting begin C.when the meeting began D.when does the meeting begin 解析： 先杀语序： B、D倒装排除；再按时态： 主句could是过去形式但此处是礼貌用法(=can)，从句按实际时间用将来，选A。could you tell me属「礼貌非过去」，是从呼应规则的著名例外。","extension":"进阶： 主句could/would作礼貌用法时不影响从句时态；would like to know同理。这条例外是拉开差距的拓展点。","traps":"错误一： 只顾时态忘语序。错误二： 礼貌could误判为过去时逼从句用过去。错误三： 真理句跟随主句变过去。错误四： does删除后忘给动词加s。","examFocus":"单选每年必考宾从综合题；语篇填空考从句内动词形式。得分关键： 语序→时态→礼貌例外三查。","tags":["宾语从句","综合训练"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"}]},{"uid":"english-15","name":"定语从句","grade":"九年级上册","order":14,"kps":[{"uid":"english-15-1","title":"关系代词who/which/that的选用","content":"定语从句中关系代词分工口诀： 「人who物which，that两者皆可」。who指人(作主语或宾语，宾格whom指人作宾语)；which指物；that人物均可。选用规则： 先行词是人→who/that；先行词是物→which/that。关系代词作主语时不可省略，作宾语时可省。who/which/that在从句中充当成分，先行词是「人」时用who更明确： The girl who is standing under the tree is my cousin. 先行词是物时用which更正式： I like the photos which were taken in Yunnan. 例句： ①The woman who is talking to the headmaster is my aunt.(who作主语) ②This is the house which we visited last year.(which作宾语可省) ③He is the man that helped me when I was in trouble.(that指人)。做题三步： 找先行词→判断人物→看从句缺什么成分。","keyPoints":["先行词是人→who/that；是物→which/that","who/which/that作从句主语不可省略","作宾语时关系代词可省略","whom是who的宾格，指人作宾语","先行词与关系代词之间不可再加代词: the girl who she is...错误"],"example":"例: The woman ___ is talking with our headmaster is Lucy's mother. 解析: 先行词 woman 是人,关系词在从句中作主语(is talking 前缺主语),填 who 或 that。先定位先行词,再判断「人/物」,最后看从句缺什么成分。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： 关系代词后重复主语： The girl who she is standing...应为who is standing。错误二： 人先行词误用which: the teacher which应为who/that。错误三： 关系代词作主语时被省略： The book was written by him that...结构断裂。错误四： that与which混用于非限制性从句(逗号后只用which，拓展)。","examFocus":"单选高频「who/which/that」三选一；完形考查从句完整性；写作中定语从句是高分句式标配。得分关键： 先判断先行词人物，再看从句缺不缺宾语。","tags":["中考高频","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-15-2","title":"只能用that的情形","content":"关系代词宜用that的五种情形口诀： 「不定代词最高序，人物双疑问that替」。①先行词是all, everything, anything, nothing, little, few等不定代词： All that can be done has been done. / I have nothing that is worth reading. ②先行词被序数词或形容词最高级修饰： This is the best film that I have ever seen. / The first thing that we should do is to calm down. ③先行词被the only, the very, the last修饰： He is the very person that we are looking for. ④先行词既有人又有物： He talked about the people and the things that he remembered. ⑤主句以which/who开头的疑问句： Which is the bag that you bought yesterday? 例句对照： ①This is the most interesting story that I have told.(最高级) ②The school and its teachers that we visited impressed us.(人与物)。考场上出现「不定代词+最高级+the only」信号词，直接锁定that。","keyPoints":["先行词为不定代词(all/everything/nothing/few)时用that","先行词被序数词/最高级修饰时用that","the only/the very/the last+先行词用that","先行词人与物并列时用that","疑问词who/which开头的句子中用that"],"example":"例: This is the most moving film ___ I have ever watched. 解析: 先行词 film 被最高级 the most moving 修饰,关系词只能用 that,不能用 which。「最高级+that」是单选题的固定配方,要形成条件反射。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： All which can be done应为All that。错误二： the best book which...应为that(最高级)。错误三： 人和物并列时仍用who/which各管一摊。错误四： 把「宜用that」当「只能that」，忽视which在普通句中的合法性——考题出现上述五信号才必选that。","examFocus":"单选以「五信号」设that与which对立项；语篇填空考查关系词选择。得分关键： 圈出先行词上的修饰信号(最高级/序数词/the only)。","tags":["中考高频","记忆口诀","易错点"],"difficulty":3,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-15-3","title":"关系代词作主语与宾语","content":"关系代词在从句中充当的成分决定其去留，口诀： 「作主必留，作宾可省」。作主语： 关系代词后直接跟谓语动词，且从句谓语与先行词保持数的一致： The students who are in Grade Nine are busy preparing for the exam.(students复数→are) / Yao Ming is one of the players who have played in the NBA.(one of+复数→从句谓语复数，拓展) 作宾语： 关系代词后紧跟主语，可省略： The movie (that) we watched last night was wonderful. 判断公式： 关系词后是动词→作主语；关系词后是主语(名词/代词)→作宾语。例句： ①The stories that he tells are always funny.(that作宾语，可省) ②The woman who lives next door is a doctor.(who作主语) ③Is this the book that you are looking for？(作宾语，look for短语完整)。省略技巧： 填空题若空后直接是谓语动词，选主格关系词且不可省。","keyPoints":["关系词后直接跟谓语动词→作主语，不可省","关系词后是主语→作宾语，可省略","从句谓语单复数与先行词一致","one of+复数名词+who后谓语用复数(拓展)","短语动词变定从时介词不丢: the book that you are looking for"],"example":"例: The photos ___ were taken in Yunnan are amazing. 解析: 先行词 photos 是复数,关系词在从句中作主语,从句谓语随先行词用 were,填 that/which。「先行词定谓语单复数」是定从与主谓一致的交叉考点。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： 作主语的关系词被省略导致从句无主语。错误二： The people who is...应为are(people表复数)。错误三： the only one of+复数+who后误用复数谓语(应为单数)。错误四： look for类短语动词在从句中丢介词。","examFocus":"单选考「作主还是作宾」的判断与谓语一致；语篇填空给从句动词提示数的一致。得分关键： 看关系词后面第一个词的词性。","tags":["中考高频","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-15-4","title":"介词+关系代词","content":"正式文体中介词可以提前到关系代词之前，公式： 介词+which(指物)/whom(指人)+从句其余部分，口诀： 「介前which/whom，that靠边站」。介词选择的两个依据： ①与先行词的固定搭配： the house in which I live(I live in the house) / the man to whom I spoke(speak to sb，介词与动词搭配) ②与从句动词的固定搭配。介词提前后关系代词不可用that，也不可省略；介词也可留在从句句尾，此时可用that/which/whom或省略： This is the school in which my mother works. = This is the school (that/which) my mother works in. 例句： ①The man to whom I spoke just now is our new teacher.(speak to) ②Do you remember the day on which we first met？(on the day) ③The person from whom I borrowed the bike is my neighbor.(borrow from)。判断步骤： 找动词或先行词的介词搭配→决定介词→提前则which/whom。","keyPoints":["介词提前时只用which(物)/whom(人)，不用that","介词选择看先行词搭配(on the day/in the house)或动词搭配(speak to)","介词留在句尾时可用that/which/whom或省略","in which=where；on which=when(拓展)","介词+关系代词结构更正式，常见于书面语"],"example":"例: The man ___ I talked about just now is our new English teacher. 解析: talk about 的介词 about 提前,先行词 man 是人,须用 whom,填 about whom。若介词不提前,则可填 who/that 或省略。「介词+空格」= 锁定 which/whom。","extension":"书面语中 the school in which he studies 比 the school he studies in 更显功力。中考以「识别」为主: 读到介词+which/whom 结构, 能立即还原为普通定从即可。","traps":"错误一： 介词提前后仍用that: in that应为in which。错误二： 介词与先行词搭配错配： the day in which...应为on which。错误三： 提前后关系代词被省略。错误四： 混淆「介词+关系代词」与「短语动词拆散」： look after提前不能说after whom(look after是固定短语)。","examFocus":"单选以「介词提前」设区分项；语篇填空无提示词空格考介词+which/whom。得分关键： 先定介词(看搭配)，再定which/whom。","tags":["拓展提升","中考高频"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-15-5","title":"关系副词when/where/why的选用","content":"关系副词三兄弟公式： when=介词+which(时间)； where=介词+which(地点)； why=for which(原因)。选用核心口诀： 「先行词是时间地点不必然用when/where——看从句缺什么」。缺状语(句子主干完整)→关系副词： I will never forget the day when we first met.(从句we first met主干完整，缺时间状语) 缺主语或宾语(句子缺成分)→关系代词： I will never forget the day that we spent together.(spent缺宾语，that作宾语) 对照示范： ①This is the school where my mother works.(works不及物，主干完整→where) ②This is the school that we visited last year.(visited缺宾语→that) ③The reason why he was late is unknown.(从句主干完整→why) ④Nobody knows the reason that he gave at the meeting.(gave缺宾语→that)。例句： ①Do you remember the afternoon when the accident happened？(happened不及物) ②The house where I lived ten years ago has been pulled down.(live不及物)。判断步骤： 找先行词→检查从句缺不缺成分→缺状语用when/where/why。","keyPoints":["when=on/in which(时间)；where=at/in which(地点)；why=for which","从句主干完整缺状语→关系副词","从句缺主语或宾语→关系代词","happen/work/live等不及物动词常配关系副词","visit/spend及物动词常配关系代词"],"example":"例题： This is the park ______ we took a lot of photos last spring. A.which B.where C.who D.when 解析： took photos及物但宾语(a lot of photos)已在从句中，从句主干完整，缺地点状语；先行词park是地点，选B where。若从句为we visited，则选A which。","extension":"进阶： where可修饰表「场面、情形」的抽象名词： I have reached the point where I must decide on my own.；阅读中出现此类抽象where按「地点引申」理解。","traps":"错误一： 见时间名词就填when： the day that we spent(缺宾语)填when错。错误二： 见地点名词就填where： the school that we visited填where错。错误三： when与that混淆于「spent the day」类及物动词句。错误四： why与for which重复使用。","examFocus":"单选高频「关系副词与关系代词」对比项；语篇填空考关系词选择。得分关键： 检查从句缺不缺主宾成分。","tags":["定语从句","易错点"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-15-6","title":"one of加复数名词的主谓一致","content":"定语从句中最精细的一致规则，口诀： 「one of复数从句复，the only one从句单」。规则一： one of+复数名词+who/that+从句，谓语用复数——先行词是one of后面的「复数名词们」： He is one of the students who have won the prize.(获奖的学生是一群) 规则二： the (only) one of+复数名词+who/that+从句，谓语用单数——先行词是the only one(唯一那一个)： He is the only one of the students who has won the prize.(获奖的只有他一个) 判断方法： 去掉定语从句看主干： He is one of the students——比较对象是一群学生。例句： ①Yao Ming is one of the players who have played in the NBA.(一群球员) ②This is one of the most interesting books that have been published this year.(have been published复数被动) ③She is the only one of the girls who is good at painting.(单数)。同源规则： 分数与百分数+of+名词，谓语随of后名词： Two thirds of the apple is left. / Two thirds of the apples are fresh.","keyPoints":["one of+复数+who/that从句谓语用复数","the (only) one of+复数+从句谓语用单数","去掉从句看主干确定先行词","one of the+最高级+复数也遵循本规则","分数/百分数+of短语谓语随of后名词"],"example":"例题： Wang Lin is one of the best students in our class who ______ (be) praised by the headmaster yesterday. 解析： one of+复数结构，从句主语实为students，谓语用复数；yesterday定过去时，填were praised(被动)。本题叠加「一致+时态+被动」三规则。","extension":"进阶： 阅读中one of the + 最高级 + 复数结构本身表「最...之一」： one of the most moving films；写作套用可自然升级句式。","traps":"错误一： 见one就用单数(has won错，应为have won)。错误二： the only one句误用复数。错误三： 忽略被动语境丢be。错误四： 分数+of+不可数误用复数。","examFocus":"单选考one of双规则；语篇填空在定从语境考谓语形式。得分关键： 先判断先行词是「一群」还是「唯一」。","tags":["定语从句","主谓一致"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"}]},{"uid":"english-16","name":"时态六与非谓语","grade":"九年级下册","order":15,"kps":[{"uid":"english-16-1","title":"过去完成时: had done","content":"过去完成时公式： had+过去分词，表「过去的过去」。适用口诀： 「by前已发生，过去的过去」。三个信号： ①by the time+过去从句： By the time we arrived, the train had left. ②before+过去时间点/从句： He had finished the report before ten. ③said/told/knew等过去动词后的宾语从句中「更早的事」： He told me that he had seen the film. 主从句时序规则： 先发生的事用had done，后发生的事用一般过去时： When I got to the cinema, the film had begun.(先： 开始；后： 到达)。例句： ①By the end of last term, we had learned about 1,000 English words.(by the end of+过去时间) ②She had never seen the sea before she came to Qingdao.(before从句) ③The class had started when we reached the classroom.(先上课后到达)。考场判断三步： 找到两个过去动作→排先后→先者用had done。","keyPoints":["公式: had+过去分词，与主语单复数无关","表「过去的过去」: 在过去某点之前已完成","信号: by the time, by the end of+过去时间, before+过去从句","宾语从句中「更早的事」用had done","两个过去动作先发生者用had done，后者用一般过去时"],"example":"例: By the end of last year, the factory ___ (produce) more than one million masks. 解析: by the end of last year「到去年年底为止」是过去参照点,生产发生在参照点之前,属「过去的过去」,填 had produced。见到 by the end of+过去时间,条件反射用 had done。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： 两个过去动作都用一般过去时，导致先后不清： When I got there, the film began(若想表达「早已开始」应为had begun)。错误二： by the time从句误用过去完成时(从句用一般过去时)。错误三： 与现在完成时混： by now配现在完成时，by then配过去完成时。错误四： 无过去参照点时滥用had done。","examFocus":"单选以「两个过去动作比先后」为高频题型；完形叙事文按时间轴定had done；教材九年级下课文是语料来源。得分关键： 先找出「过去参照点」，早于它才用had done。","tags":["中考高频","易错点"],"difficulty":3,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-16-2","title":"不定式作宾语与目的状语","content":"不定式=to+动词原形，三大身份： 宾语、宾补、目的状语。接不定式作宾语的动词口诀「想要希望与决定，同意学习拒选择」： want, hope, wish, would like, decide, plan, agree, promise, refuse, learn, choose, afford, fail, pretend。宾补句型： ask/tell/want/allow/encourage/invite/teach+sb+to do sth: The teacher told us to hand in the papers before Friday. 目的状语： to do=in order to do(更正式)，否定not to do，可放句首或句尾： He ran fast to catch the bus. = He ran fast in order to catch the bus. 句型转换常考： so that从句与to do互转。例句： ①We decided to stay for another two days.(decide接to do) ②My mother asked me to buy some vegetables on my way home.(宾补) ③To get there on time, they left very early.(句首目的状语)。语篇填空中出现to，多数情况提示不定式，后接动词原形。","keyPoints":["接不定式作宾语: want/hope/wish/decide/plan/agree/refuse/learn/choose/afford","宾补句型: ask/tell/want/allow/encourage+sb+to do sth","目的状语to do=in order to do，否定not to do","目的状语可置句首，用逗号隔开","so that+情态动词句可与to do句式互转"],"example":"例: My parents often tell me ___ (not spend) too much time on mobile phones. 解析: tell sb. to do 的否定是在 to 前加 not,填 not to spend。「to do 否定 not 先行」是非谓语动词的基本功,宾补考点年年出现。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： let与make后误加to: let him to go应为let him go。错误二： would like后误接doing: would like to drink，不是drinking。错误三： 目的状语误用for doing(中考以to do为主)： He ran fast for catching the bus应为to catch。错误四： forget/remember等双重性格动词后不分to do与doing。","examFocus":"单选考「接to do的动词」清单与宾补结构；语篇填空给to提示填原形；句式转换(so that↔to do)在写作与语法选择中常考。得分关键： 记牢两份清单(接to do/接doing)。","tags":["中考高频","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-16-3","title":"感官动词与使役动词后省to","content":"主动省to口诀： 「一听二看三使役，宾补to要删」。感官动词： see, watch, hear, notice, feel；使役动词： make, let, have。主动句公式： 感使+sb+do(动词原形)： I saw him enter the classroom just now.(看到进教室的全过程) / The boss made the workers work day and night. / Let us have a rest under the tree. 与doing的区别： 接原形表「看到/听到全过程」，接doing表「看到当时正在进行的片断」： I heard her sing an English song.(听整首) 与 I heard her singing an English song when I passed by.(路过时正在唱)。被动句to还原公式： be seen/made+to do: He was seen to enter the classroom. / The workers were made to work day and night. 例句： ①The teacher watched the students play games on the playground. ②Mom often has me wash the dishes after dinner. ③She was made to work for ten hours a day.(被动还原to)。","keyPoints":["主动句: 感官/使役+sb+动词原形(省to)","被动句必须还原to: be made/seen to do","接原形表全过程；接doing表正在进行片断","使役动词: make/let/have；感官动词: see/watch/hear/notice/feel","let一般不用于被动语态"],"example":"例: The boy was made ___ (copy) the words five times because of his mistakes. 解析: make sb. do 变被动后须还原 to,填 to copy。对照主动句 The teacher made the boy copy...。「主动省 to,被动还 to」是九年级必考点。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： 主动句误加to: I saw him to cross应为cross。错误二： 被动句忘还原to: He was seen enter应为to enter。错误三： 全过程与片断不分： 过路听到唱歌应用singing。错误四： help后to可省可不省，不属于强制省to清单，别混记。","examFocus":"单选高频「主动省to、被动还原to」；语篇填空在被动语境下考to还原；完形考see sb do与doing的画面差异。得分关键： 先判断主被动态，再定to的有无。","tags":["中考高频","记忆口诀","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-16-4","title":"动名词作宾语与doing/to do辨析","content":"只接动名词作宾语的动词口诀「喜欢放弃防延迟，考虑错过想练习」： enjoy, finish, mind, practice, suggest, keep, miss, consider, avoid, admit, delay，另有be busy, be worth, look forward to, feel like, can not help, be used to(习惯于)，这里的to都是介词，后接doing。双重性格动词(接doing与to do意义不同)： remember doing(记得做过)与remember to do(记得要去做)；forget doing(忘记做过)与forget to do(忘记要做)；stop doing(停止正在做的事)与stop to do(停下来去做另一件事)；try doing(尝试做)与try to do(努力做)；regret doing(后悔做过)与regret to do(遗憾要做)。例句： ①I enjoy reading novels in my free time.(enjoy接doing) ②Would you mind opening the window？(mind接doing) ③He is looking forward to hearing from his pen friend.(to为介词接doing)。语篇填空看到enjoy/mind/finish/look forward to立即填doing形式。","keyPoints":["只接doing: enjoy/finish/mind/practice/suggest/keep/miss/consider/avoid","短语中的介词to: look forward to doing, be used to doing, be worth doing","双重性格: remember/forget/stop/try/regret后doing与to do意义不同","stop doing=停止做；stop to do=停下来去做另一件","be busy doing与can not help doing固定搭配"],"example":"例: Remember ___ (turn) off the lights when you leave, and don't forget ___ (bring) your homework tomorrow. 解析: 两处都是「记得/别忘了去做(尚未做)」,接不定式,分别填 to turn, to bring。对比: I remember turning off the lights.(我记得已关了灯)。做没做,是不定式与动名词的分水岭。","extension":"「动词+doing」清单早读朗读成口诀, 语法填空遇到动词后接动词的形式, 先扫一遍清单再动笔: enjoy/finish/mind/keep/practice/suggest/avoid/consider/miss/risk。","traps":"错误一： look forward to后误接to do: look forward to see you应为to seeing you。错误二： Would you mind to open...应为opening。错误三： 「记得要做作业」说remember doing homework，应为remember to do。错误四： be used to do(被用来做)与be used to doing(习惯于)混为一谈。","examFocus":"单选经典「doing与to do意义辨析」；语篇填空考介词to后的doing；写作中look forward to hearing from you是书信高频结尾句。得分关键： 分清「动词不定式to」与「介词to」。","tags":["拓展提升","易错点","记忆口诀","中考高频"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-16-5","title":"不定式作定语与结果状语","content":"不定式两种「偏门」身份。①不定式作定语(后置修饰)： 放在被修饰名词之后，口诀「不定式作定语，跟在名词后」。四类常考搭配： something/anything/nothing+to do： I have something important to tell you.；序数词/最高级+名词+to do： the first man to walk on the moon；have+名词+to do： I have a lot of homework to do. / She has no one to talk with.；way/time/chance+to do： the best way to learn English。注意： 不定式的逻辑宾语若已出现，动词后不再加宾语： I have a lot of homework to do.(不说to do it) ②不定式作结果状语： so...as to(如此...以至于)， too...to(太...而不能)， enough to(足够到)， only to(不料却，拓展)： He hurried home only to find the door locked.(不料却发现门锁了) 例句： ①Would you like something to drink？(something后置定语) ②He is the youngest player to win the prize.(序数最高级类) ③The room is big enough to hold fifty people.(enough to结果)。判断空格名词后紧跟动词原形前有to，即考虑定语身份。","keyPoints":["不定式作定语放名词后: something to eat","the first/last+名词+to do: the first man to walk on the moon","have+名词+to do: have homework to do","逻辑宾语已出现则不再加it: to do it错","结果状语: too...to/enough to/so...as to/only to"],"example":"例题： I have no pen ______. A.to write B.to write with C.writing D.written 解析： 不定式作定语修饰pen；write是不及物用法(写信用write a letter，用钢笔写需借with)，逻辑上pen是with的工具，故选B to write with。类似： a room to live in, a chair to sit on, paper to write on。","extension":"进阶： 不定式作定语与被修饰名词构成动宾或介宾关系时保留介词： He is looking for a hotel to stay at.；这介词是不定式定语的深水区。","traps":"错误一： something to eat it(逻辑宾语重复)。错误二： a pen to write漏with。错误三： 不定式定语前置(something to eat写成to eat something修饰名词)。错误四： only to误当目的状语(是「不料」的结果义)。","examFocus":"单选考「介词保留型」不定式定语；语篇填空在名词后给动词考虑to do。得分关键： 检查不定式与名词的动宾/介宾关系。","tags":["非谓语动词","中考高频"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-16-6","title":"非谓语动词作主语与表语","content":"非谓语两大句内位置的分工口诀： 「动名作主表习惯，不定作主表具体」。动名词作主语表「抽象、习惯性」行为，谓语单数： Swimming is good for health. / Reading in the sun is bad for your eyes. 不定式作主语表「具体、一次性」行为，更正式： To finish the work today is not easy. 现代英语常借助形式主语it： It is not easy to finish the work today. / It is no use crying over spilt milk.(谚语： 覆水难收，crying作真主语)。作表语规则： 主语与表语「同源」——主语是动名词，表语用动名词；主语是不定式，表语用不定式： Seeing is believing. / To see is to believe.。It句型清单： It takes sb some time to do sth；It is + 形容词 +(for/of sb)+to do： It is kind of you to help me.(of配人品质形容词) 例句： ①Swimming in the river in summer is great fun.(习惯) ②My job is teaching English.(职业习惯) ③His dream is to travel around the world.(具体目标)。作主语的非谓语一律视为单数。","keyPoints":["动名词作主语表习惯，谓语单数","不定式作主语表具体目标，常用形式主语it","It is no use doing.../It takes sb time to do sth","表语与主语同源: Seeing is believing","It is kind of sb to do(人品质用of)"],"example":"例题： (1)It is no use ______ (argue) with him; he will not listen. 解析： It is no use后接动名词，填arguing。(2)My wish is ______ (become) a doctor. 解析： 主语wish是具体目标，表语用不定式，填to become。","extension":"进阶： There is no knowing...(无法知道)；How about/What about后接doing；这些「名词性」用法都属于动名词大家族，阅读中按「一件事」理解即可。","traps":"错误一： 动名词主语配复数谓语(Swimming are...)。错误二： It is no use to argue(应arguing)。错误三： My job is teaching与My dream is to travel混搭不同源。错误四： It is kind for you(人品质形容词用of)。","examFocus":"单选考It句型与动名词主语；语篇填空句首给动词考虑非谓语形式。得分关键： 区分「习惯」与「具体目标」。","tags":["非谓语动词","句型系统"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"}]},{"uid":"english-17","name":"主谓一致与倒装","grade":"九年级下册","order":16,"kps":[{"uid":"english-17-1","title":"主谓一致三原则","content":"主谓一致三原则口诀： 「语法一致看形式，意义一致看内涵，就近一致看邻居」。①语法一致： 主语单数→谓语单数；主语复数→谓语复数： My brother likes swimming. / The students are doing morning exercises. ②意义一致： 集合名词作整体→单数；指成员→复数： The family is a big one. / The family are having dinner together. 不可数名词news, math, physics作单数： The news is very exciting. and连接的两个名词表同一人/物→单数： The singer and dancer is coming. ③就近原则： or, nor, neither...nor, either...or, not only...but also连接并列主语，谓语与最近的主语一致： Not only the students but also their teacher is enjoying the trip. there be句型也就近： There is a pen and two books on the desk. 例句： ①Neither he nor I am right.(就近am) ②Each of the boys has a new bike.(each核心单数) ③Ten minutes is enough for the rest.(时间距离金钱作整体单数)。","keyPoints":["语法一致: 单数主语配单数谓语","意义一致: news/math/physics表单数；集合名词看整体或成员","and连接同一个人→单数: the singer and dancer","就近原则: or/nor/either...or/not only...but also/there be","时间金钱距离作主语视为整体: Ten minutes is..."],"example":"例: There ___ a dictionary and two pens on the desk. 解析: There be 句型遵循就近原则,be 的形式由最近的 a dictionary 决定,填 is。若改成 There ___ two pens and a dictionary...,则谓语随 two pens 用 are。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： Neither he nor I is...应为am(就近I)。错误二： The police is coming应为are(police表复数)。错误三： Every one of us have...应为has(of短语核心是one)。错误四： My family is watching TV想说「家人们」应用are。","examFocus":"单选每年必考；语篇填空中谓语动词形式由一致原则决定。得分关键： 先找并列连词与核心主语，再定单复数。","tags":["中考高频","易错点","记忆口诀"],"difficulty":3,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-17-2","title":"so do I与neither do I","content":"附和句公式口诀： 「肯附和so，否附和neither，助动提前倒装走」。肯定附和： So+助动词/情态动词/be+主语(倒装)，助动词与前句一致： —I have finished the work. —So has she. / —Li Lei can not swim. —Neither can I. / —They went to the park yesterday. —So did we. 否定附和： Neither/Nor+助动词+主语。三类句式对比： ①So do I(我也是，不同主语，倒装) ②So I do(的确如此，同主语，不倒装)： —It is hot today. —So it is. ③So it is with.../It is the same with...(前句既有肯定又有否定时用，拓展)。时态选择： 前句was→附和用was；前句has done→附和用has；前句实义动词过去式→附和用did。例句： ①—I am interested in the book. —So am I.(be用am) ②—He never gets up late. —Neither do I.(never否定，用Neither) ③—Mary will help us. —So will Tom.(will提前)。","keyPoints":["公式: So/Neither+助动词或be或情态+主语(倒装)","助动词形式与前句保持一致(时态拷贝)","So I do=的确如此，同主语不倒装","Neither/Nor用于否定附和","前句含never/hardly等否定词时用Neither附和"],"example":"例: — I have never watched such a wonderful football match. — ___. A. So have I B. Neither have I 解析: 前句含 never(否定),「我也没看过」用 Neither/Nor+助动词+主语,前句助动词是 have,选B。若前句是肯定句,才用 So have I。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： —I like English. —So I like.漏倒装与助动词，应为So do I。错误二： 前句否定却用So: —He can not swim. —So can I错误，应为Neither can I。错误三： 助动词时态不拷贝： 前句went附和用So do I，应为So did I。错误四： 把「的确如此」(So it is)与「我也是」(So is it)混用。","examFocus":"单选高频「so/neither倒装」，口语交际对话常考；完形对话段考查语气衔接。得分关键： 前句肯定否定定so/neither，前句助动词照搬。","tags":["中考高频","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-17-3","title":"感叹句、祈使句与反意疑问句","content":"三大句式系统。感叹句公式： How+形容词/副词+主谓！ What(a/an)+形容词+名词+主谓！ 互转口诀： 「How后裸形副，What后跟名词」： How beautiful the park is! = What a beautiful park it is! / How fast the boy is running! = What a fast runner he is! 无冠词的复数/不可数用What: What sweet music it is! 祈使句公式： 动词原形开头，否定Do not+原形；let us句型： Let us go home, will you? 反意疑问句公式口诀： 「前肯后否，前否后肯」： Tom never does his homework at school, does he？(never否定→尾部肯定) 特殊规则： ①祈使句反问用will you: Open the door, will you? ②Let us...will you；Let us...表建议(含对方)反问shall we(写作中用完整形式) ③there be句型反问附there: There is a book on the desk, is not there?。例句： ①What a lovely day it is!(感叹) ②Do not be late for school again.(祈使否定) ③She has never been to London, has she？(has never→肯定尾巴)。","keyPoints":["感叹句: How+形/副；What(a/an)+形+名词","How beautiful it is = What a beautiful...互转","祈使句以动词原形开头，否定Do not+原形","反意疑问: 前肯后否/前否后肯，助动词拷贝","祈使句反问用will you；there be句型反问附there"],"example":"例: ___ useful advice you gave me yesterday! 解析: advice 是不可数名词,感叹句用 What 引导且不加 a,填 What。检验法: 去掉主谓 you gave me yesterday,剩 useful advice(形容词+不可数名词),锁定 What;强调形容词则用 How useful the advice is!","extension":"感叹句+祈使句可制造高分结尾: What a wonderful trip it was! Let's look forward to the next one! 反意疑问句在补全对话中考查最多, 集中练十道即可通关。","traps":"错误一： What a beautiful it is!(a后裸接代词，应为What a beautiful park it is) 错误二： How a nice day!(How后不能加冠词名词) 错误三： never句子的反问仍用否定： ..., does not he？应为does he。错误四： 祈使句反问误用do you。","examFocus":"单选考感叹句How/What选择与反意疑问句；写作中感叹句增强语气。得分关键： 看感叹部分是形容词还是名词短语。","tags":["中考高频","易错点","记忆口诀"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-17-4","title":"not only...but also与either...or的就近一致","content":"就近原则总口诀： 「or家族看邻居，there be也随近」。就近结构清单： or, nor, neither...nor, either...or, not only...but also；there be句型。规则： 谓语动词与最近的主语保持一致： Not only the students but also their teacher is enjoying the trip.(靠近teacher单数→is) / Either you or he has to stay.(靠近he→has) / Neither the twins nor their mother was at home.(靠近mother→was) / There is a pen and two books on the desk.(靠近a pen→is) there be变体： there stands/lies/lives/hangs+主语： There stands an old tower on the hill. / There lived a fisherman by the sea.(故事开头)。not only...but also连接句子时的倒装(拓展)： Not only did he speak more correctly, but he also spoke more easily.(前句部分倒装)。例句： ①Either Tom or his brothers are going to help you.(靠近brothers复数→are) ②Not only the players but also the coach was excited.(靠近coach→was) ③There goes the bell.(倒装变体)。做题三步： 找并列连词→锁定靠近谓语的主语→按其单复数变形。","keyPoints":["就近结构: or/nor/neither...nor/either...or/not only...but also","谓语与最近的主语一致","there be就近: There is a pen and two books...","there stand/live/lie/hang变体","not only句首部分倒装(拓展)"],"example":"例题： Not only the children but also their mother ______ (be) interested in the cartoon. 解析： but also靠近their mother(单数)，谓语用单数，填is。若主语对调改为Not only their mother but also the children，则填are。","extension":"进阶： 连接句子的not only...but also，前分句要部分倒装；而连接主语或短语时不倒装——「连句倒装、连词不倒」八字分辨。","traps":"错误一： 按远端主语变形(意义顺延)。错误二： there be后并列主语一律用are。错误三： either...or误按both...and用复数。错误四： not only句首忘倒装。","examFocus":"单选每年必考就近原则；语篇填空由并列结构定谓语形式。得分关键： 先找连词再看「离动词最近的那个主语」。","tags":["主谓一致","中考高频"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"}]},{"uid":"english-18","name":"情景交际","grade":"中考专题","order":17,"kps":[{"uid":"english-18-1","title":"问候介绍与感谢道歉","content":"问候: Hello! / Good morning! / How are you? — Fine, thanks. And you? 介绍他人用 This is...(不用 He is/She is): Lucy, this is my cousin Jim. 初次见面: — Nice to meet you. — Nice to meet you, too. 感谢与应答: Thank you so much. / Thanks a lot. — You're welcome. / Not at all. / That's all right. / My pleasure. 道歉与应答: I'm sorry (for being late). — Never mind. / It doesn't matter. / That's OK. 关键区分: My pleasure 只回应感谢;回应道歉用 It doesn't matter 或 Never mind。交际题先「定位场景」,再按英语习惯作答,忌逐字翻译中文。","keyPoints":["介绍用语: This is...(不说He is/She is)","初次见面Nice to meet you; 熟人Nice to see you again","感谢应答: You're welcome. / Not at all. / My pleasure.","道歉应答: Never mind. / It doesn't matter.","How are you?答Fine, thank you. And you?"],"example":"例: — I'm terribly sorry. I've broken your glasses. — ___. A. You're welcome B. It doesn't matter C. My pleasure 解析: 对方道歉,应表示谅解,选B「没关系」。A 回应感谢,C 回应感谢或请求,都与道歉场景「错位」。错位应答是交际题最常设的陷阱。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["基础必会","易错点","中考高频"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-18-2","title":"请求允许与提供帮助","content":"请求允许: May/Can/Could I...? 肯定应答: Sure. / Of course. / Certainly. / No problem. 委婉拒绝: I'm afraid not. / Sorry, you can't. 提供帮助: Can I help you? / What can I do for you? / Would you like me to carry it for you? 接受: Yes, please. / That's very kind of you. 婉拒: No, thanks. I can manage. 请求对方: Could you (please)...? 应答: With pleasure.(乐意效劳)/ No problem. / Sorry, I'm afraid I can't. 关键区分: With pleasure 用于事前「愿意帮忙」,My pleasure 用于事后「不用谢」;Would you like...? 肯定答 Yes, please.,否定答 No, thanks.。","keyPoints":["May/Could I...? 应答: Sure/Certainly/Of course/No problem","婉拒三部曲: That's very kind of you, but...","Would you like...? Yes, please. / No, thanks.","Could you help me? — With pleasure.(事前乐意)","My pleasure=不用谢(事后), 与With pleasure区分"],"example":"例: — Could you please pass me the salt? — ___. A. With pleasure B. My pleasure C. Never mind 解析: 对方请求帮忙,现在乐意去做,用 With pleasure,选A。B「不用谢」用于对方道谢之后,C「没关系」用于回应道歉。三个「pleasure/mind」家族的分工必须门儿清。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["中考高频","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-18-3","title":"打电话、购物、就医与就餐场景","content":"打电话专属用语: Hello! May I speak to Gina? / Who's that (speaking)?(问对方是谁,不说 Who are you?)/ This is Mary speaking.(自报家门,不说 I am Mary)/ Hold on, please.(请稍等)/ Can I take a message?(捎个口信)/ Sorry, she isn't in.(不在家)。购物: Can I help you? / I'm looking for a schoolbag. / What color/size do you want? / How much is it? / I'll take it. 就医: What's the matter (with you)? = What's wrong? / I have a fever. / Take the medicine three times a day. / You'll be fine soon. 就餐: Would you like something to drink? / Help yourself to some fish. / Just a little, please.","keyPoints":["电话: This is...speaking. / Who's that? / Hold on, please.","May I speak to...? / Can I take a message? / She isn't in.","购物: I'm looking for... / How much is it? / I'll take it.","就医: What's the matter? I have a cold. Take the medicine.","就餐: Help yourself (to...). / Would you like some more?"],"example":"例: — Hello! May I speak to Mr. Black? — ___, please. He is coming. 解析: 对方要找的人马上来接,请对方稍等,填 Hold on。电话三大铁律: 自报家门用 This is...,问对方用 Who's that?,请稍候用 Hold on。I am.../Who are you? 是中式英语。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["中考高频","答题模板"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-18-4","title":"观点赞同与委婉拒绝(文化差异)","content":"表达观点: In my opinion... / I think... / As far as I know... 赞同: I agree (with you). / That's a good idea. / Exactly. / I can't agree more.(我非常赞同)不赞同: I don't think so. / I'm afraid I can't agree. 委婉拒绝: I'd love to, but... / I'm afraid I have to... / What a pity! Maybe next time. 文化差异三提醒: ①面对赞美说 Thank you,不说「哪里哪里」: — Your English is excellent. — Thank you. ②拒绝邀请要致谢并给出理由: Thanks for inviting me, but I'm busy preparing for the exam. ③不问年龄、收入、体重等隐私。中考交际题丢分多因中式思维。","keyPoints":["赞同升级句: I can't agree more.(非常赞同)","委婉拒绝: I'd love to, but... / I'm afraid...","被赞美只说Thank you, 不必谦虚推辞","拒绝邀请: 致谢+理由+期待下次","隐私话题不谈: age, salary, weight"],"example":"例: — Your new schoolbag looks really cool! — ___. A. No, it's just so-so B. Thank you C. Don't say that 解析: 按英语文化习惯,坦然接受赞美并致谢,选B。A「哪里哪里」是典型中式思维,英美人认为否认赞美反而不礼貌。文化差异题考的是英语思维。","extension":"西方交际三「不问」: 年龄、收入、体重; 三「常说」: 请、谢谢、对不起。得体的语言习惯比语法正确更显修养, 也是情景交际的隐形考纲。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["拓展提升","易错点","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-18-5","title":"情景交际解题法: 问什么答什么","content":"情景交际三大原则口诀： 「问什么答什么，礼貌优先，避开中式直译」。①问什么答什么——按疑问词与句式作答： How do you like the film？(问评价)——It is wonderful.(答感受，不是I like) Would you like some more rice？(邀请)——Yes, please. / No, thank you.(不能只答Yes/No) How about playing basketball？(建议)——Good idea. / That sounds great. ②礼貌优先： 拒绝先谢后拒并给理由： I would love to, but I have to look after my sister. ③避开中式英语： 中文「哪里哪里」「不用谢」直译是错的；英语用 You did a good job接受表扬，用 Not at all/You are welcome回应感谢。高频场景句： 祝愿与祝贺——Have a good weekend! —The same to you.(同类祝愿回敬)；Happy birthday to you!(专属节日不回The same to you) 打电话——This is Mary speaking.(不说I am Mary) 看病——What is the matter？ I do not feel well. 例句： ①—I will take an exam tomorrow. —Good luck to you!(祝愿) ②—Could I use your bike? —Sure, here you are.(许可) ③—I am sorry I broke your cup. —It does not matter.(安慰)。交际题考的是「得体」而非「语法」。","keyPoints":["How do you like...?问评价，答It is wonderful","Would you like...?答Yes, please/No, thank you","拒绝公式: I would love to, but...","接电话用This is...speaking","祝愿回敬The same to you；感谢回You are welcome/Not at all"],"example":"例题： —Shall we go to the museum this Sunday? —______ A.I think so. B.That is a good idea. C.You are welcome. D.It does not matter. 解析： Shall we...?是建议句式，应答接纳或拒绝；B为标准接受。C用于回应感谢，D用于回应道歉，A答非所问。","extension":"进阶： 西方文化中接受赞美直接说Thank you；被邀请不能立即追问隐私；这些「得体规则」是文化差异题的命题源。","traps":"错误一： 按中文习惯直译(「我非常喜欢」答How do you like)。错误二： 拒绝生硬No(需给理由)。错误三： 打电话自报I am...(应This is...)。错误四： 场景错配： 用You are welcome回应道歉。","examFocus":"单选交际题每年2至3道；听力对话高频。得分关键： 先判断「这是建议/邀请/祝愿/道歉哪一类」再选答句。","tags":["情景交际","解题方法"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"}]},{"uid":"english-19","name":"完形与阅读技巧","grade":"中考专题","order":18,"kps":[{"uid":"english-19-1","title":"完形填空三步法","content":"完形填空三步法口诀： 「一读抓主线，二选靠线索，三验通全篇」。第一步通读跳读(1至2分钟)： 不看选项，读首段抓主题、人物、时态与感情基调；首段是「总开关」，命题人把主题句放在首段。第二步逐题作答： 按线索优先级选： ①词汇复现(原词/同义/反义在前后文再现) ②逻辑衔接(but, so, however定方向) ③搭配与语法(固定短语、时态、连词) ④常识与情节合理。第三步复读验证： 把答案代入，全篇是否通顺，人称时态是否一致。示例： Tim was nervous, but he walked onto the stage and began to speak. His voice was low at first, then it grew stronger. The audience clapped warmly. 由此判断Tim最后感到 relieved(放心的)。例句线索示范： ①Tom broke the window. He was afraid that his father would punish him.(afraid与punish同线复现) ②The little girl smiled brightly when she saw her mother.(brightly与smiled同向) ③Although he failed, he did not give up.(although定让步基调)。先抓主线再选词，正确率提升一档。","keyPoints":["第一步: 通读首段抓主题/人物/时态/感情基调","线索优先级: 词汇复现>逻辑衔接>固定搭配>常识情节","第二步逐题作答，不恋战，卡住先跳过","第三步复读验证，全篇通顺才算完成","首段首句往往就是全文主题句"],"example":"例: (完形节选) The old man was too ___ to walk on, so we helped him go down the mountain. A. tired B. excited 解析: 由 so 后「我们帮他下山」可推知老人「累得走不动」,选A。命题逻辑是「前因后果」,解题逻辑是「由果溯因」,上下文就是证据链。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： 拿到题就逐题填，不读全文，主线丢失。错误二： 只看空格前后一小截，忽略远距离复现。错误三： 忽略感情色彩褒贬，选词与基调矛盾。错误四： 不留时间复验，时态人称前后不一。","examFocus":"完形是中考分值大头(10至15分)。命题点分布： 动词辨析、连词逻辑、名词语境、形容词褒贬。得分关键： 首段定基调+复现找答案。","tags":["答题模板","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-19-2","title":"上下文线索: 词汇复现与逻辑关系","content":"完形两大解题引擎。引擎一词汇复现，三种形式： ①原词复现： 前文出现teacher，后文空格再考teacher相关词 ②同义复现： get→receive/acquire；big→huge/large ③反义复现： but前后出现happy与sad对立。示例： The man was poor but happy. He had little money, yet he never felt sad. 复现词往往就是答案词或其同义替换。引擎二逻辑衔接，连词分类清单： 并列(and, or)、转折(but, however, yet)、因果(because, so, therefore)、递进(what is more, besides)、让步(although, though)、解释(that is, for example)、顺序(first, then, finally)。示例： He got up late. However, he was not late for school.(however转折定「没迟到」方向) 例句： ①She looked tired, so her mother let her rest.(so因果) ②The box was heavy. Tom tried to lift it but failed.(but反义复现) ③First, wash the rice. Then, put it into the pot.(then顺序)。做完形时把每个空格的「线索句」标出来，答案自现。","keyPoints":["原词复现: 前后文同词再现，常为答案","同义复现: get/receive；big/huge；look for/search","反义复现: but前后语义对立","逻辑连词七大类: 并列/转折/因果/递进/让步/解释/顺序","线索句常在空格的前一句或后一句"],"example":"例: (完形节选) At first I was nervous, but my teacher's warm words made me ___ again. A. sad B. relaxed 解析: but 表转折,前「紧张」后应转向积极,结合 again(重新)可知「放松下来」,选B。转折连词 but 就是本题的直接证据。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： 只盯空格那一行，漏看远距离复现。错误二： 见到however却按顺承理解。错误三： 复现词的词性不管，词对但性错。错误四： 连词与副词混淆： however虽表转折但需逗号分隔，用法与but不同。","examFocus":"完形核心得分技能，每年直接考查6至8空。得分关键： 每空先问「前后什么关系」，再问「哪个词复现」。","tags":["答题模板","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-19-3","title":"阅读理解四大题型技巧","content":"阅读四大题型各有解法公式。①细节理解题： 题干关键词回原文定位，题文同序(题目顺序与原文行文顺序基本一致)；答案常是原文的同义改写，照抄原文原话的选项反而多为陷阱。②推理判断题： 答案由原文推出，但不等于原文；标志词infer, suggest, learn from the passage；警惕「过度推理」与「常识误答」。③主旨大意题： 首尾段+各段首句+高频词；标题型答案特征： 概括性强、覆盖全文、不含细节。④词义猜测题： 见「词义猜测方法」条。做题顺序建议： 先读题干(带问题读原文)→标注定位→比对选项。例句示范(推理)： The boy looked at his watch twice and walked up and down. → We can infer that the boy was waiting for someone and feeling anxious. 示例(细节)： 原文 The library opens at 8:00 am and closes at 9:00 pm on weekdays. → When does the library close on weekdays? 答案 9:00 pm。阅读先问题后文章，效率提高一倍。","keyPoints":["细节题: 关键词定位+题文同序，答案多为同义改写","推理题: 从原文推出，不选照抄原文的选项","主旨题: 首尾段+各段首句+高频词；标题要概括不细节","词义题: 构词法+上下文线索","先读题干再读原文，带着问题定位"],"example":"例: Which is the best title for the passage? A. The History of Paper B. Paper: Old but Useful 解析: 若文章既讲纸的历史又讲纸的现在与用途,A 项只覆盖部分内容,以偏概全;B 项「古老而有用」统摄全文,选B。标题题先把各段大意串成「一句话」,再比对选项。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： 推理题选原文原句(那是细节不是推理)。错误二： 主旨题选细节项(以偏概全)。错误三： 凭常识答题，脱离原文依据。错误四： 定位错段落，答非所问。","examFocus":"阅读是分值最大板块(30分上下)。四题型分布约： 细节6至8题、推理2至3题、主旨1至2题、词义1至2题。得分关键： 定位准确+同义改写识别。","tags":["答题模板","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-19-4","title":"任务型阅读答题规范","content":"任务型阅读(阅读回答问题/表格填空)的核心是「信息转换+答法规范」。三大题型： ①回答问题型： 答案词数受限(通常不超过5词或10词)；特殊疑问句按疑问词答，答句与问句时态呼应： When did the story happen? —Last Friday.(时间) ②表格填空型： 表格栏目定词性，答案从原文定位后做词形转换： 原文 They planted trees on the hill. 表格要求名词： tree planting。③完成句子/补全短文型： 找同义改写句。答规规范口诀： 「看疑问词，看时态，看词数，看大小写」。大小写规则： 句首字母、专有名词大写；表格首格若在句中则不用大写。动词形式规则： 问句若问what...do，答句用动词原形短语或doing视句法而定。例句： ①Where do they have lunch? —In the school dining hall.(不超过5词) ②What did the children do last weekend? —They picked strawberries on the farm. / Picked strawberries on the farm.(两种答法都对) ③Why was Tom late? —Because he missed the bus.(because问原因)。任务型阅读是「格式分」题型，规范即得分。","keyPoints":["答案先定位原文，再做信息转换","回答问题注意词数限制与时态呼应","表格填空按栏目定词性与大小写","why问句用because开头；when问句答时间点","句首与专有名词必须大写"],"example":"例: (任务型阅读) Why did the students start the recycling club? 解析: 答句须以 Because 开头,时态用过去时,人称用 the students(第三人称复数): Because they wanted to make their school greener. 人称、时态、句式三对齐,才不丢冤枉分。","extension":"任务型阅读常「按点给分」: 该写的词漏写必扣分, 多余的话(超过字数限制)也会扣分。答完自查三问: 是完整句吗? 关键词抄对了吗? 大小写规范吗?","traps":"错误一： 超词数(抄整句)。错误二： 答句时态与问句不呼应。错误三： 忘记句首大写与句末标点。错误四： 表格栏要求名词却答动词。","examFocus":"任务型阅读10分上下，按点给分。命题点： 信息定位、词形转换、同义改写。得分关键： 答案照原文改写，格式规范不吃哑巴亏。","tags":["答题模板","拓展提升"],"difficulty":2,"type":"extension"}]},{"uid":"english-20","name":"书面表达","grade":"中考专题","order":19,"kps":[{"uid":"english-20-1","title":"应用文格式: 书信、邮件、通知与日记","content":"四大文体格式公式。书信： 称呼Dear + 称谓+逗号，另起行正文；结尾客套Yours, / Best wishes,换行署名。邮件： 主题(Subject)一行；称呼同书信；落款可简写Li Hua。通知(Notice)： 标题NOTICE居中；正文交代活动时间、地点、内容、注意事项；落款单位与日期；无称呼语，用第三人称与一般将来时/一般现在时。日记： 日期与天气写第一行(Monday, June 1st, Sunny)，正文用第一人称与一般过去时为主。格式占分1至2分，白送不容失。例句： ①Dear Mr. Green, I am writing to invite you to our English party...Yours, Li Hua. ②NOTICE: There will be a talk on Chinese culture in the school hall at 3:00 pm on Friday, June 6th. All students are welcome. The Student Union. ③Friday, May 10th, Fine. This morning our class went to the park to plant trees...。先格式后内容，检查称呼、落款、大小写。","keyPoints":["书信: Dear...开头+Yours,署名，各占一行","邮件有Subject主题行；正文称呼落款同书信","通知: 标题NOTICE居中，无称呼，交代时间地点内容","日记: 首行日期+天气；正文第一人称+一般过去时","格式分1至2分，固定送分"],"example":"例: 书信的正确落款: Yours,(另起一行) Li Hua。解析: Yours 后用逗号,署名单独成行。阅卷第一眼看格式: 称呼、正文、结束语、署名四件齐全,格式分一分不丢;日记漏写天气是年年都有的失分点。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： 称呼后用冒号(英文书信规范用逗号)。错误二： 落款忘写或写成中文「你的朋友」。错误三： 通知写成第一人称(应用第三人称)。错误四： 日记用将来时(记当天已发生的事用过去时)。","examFocus":"书面表达第一题常为应用文(书信/邮件占多数)。评分先看格式要素齐全度。得分关键： 背熟四模板，套题即可。","tags":["基础必会","答题模板"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-20-2","title":"写作五步法","content":"书面表达五步法口诀： 「一审二列三连四美五查」。第一步审题： 圈出文体(书信/话题)、人称(第一/三人称)、时态(过去/现在/将来)、要点数量；一篇作文要点漏一条扣2分上下。第二步列提纲： 每个要点配一个核心句，确定段落结构(三段式： 开头引题、中间展开、结尾点题)。第三步连句成文： 用连接词把要点串成线(first, then, besides, finally)。第四步美化升级： 换高级句式(定语从句、被动语态、not only...but also)、换高级词汇(very good→wonderful/fantastic)。第五步检查： 口诀「查时态、查三单、查拼写、查大小写、查标点」。例句升级对照： 原句 I like reading. It can help me learn a lot. 升级 Not only does reading bring me joy, but it also opens a window to the world. 例句对照二： 原句 We planted trees. 升级 Last Sunday, our class went to the hill and planted trees, which made the hill greener.。五步法每步30秒，总分提高一个档次。","keyPoints":["一审: 文体/人称/时态/要点数，缺一不可","二列: 每要点一个核心句，三段式结构","三连: 连接词成线(first/then/besides/finally)","四美: 高级句式+高级词汇替换","五查: 时态三单拼写大小写标点"],"example":"例: 题目「上周的志愿活动」,要点: 时间地点、做了什么、感受。解析: 审题定「一般过去时」;列点: last Saturday, at the nursing home, clean the rooms, sing songs, feel proud;连句成文后查过去式 cleaned, sang, felt;再加感叹句 What a meaningful day it was! 收尾。五步环环相扣,高分水到渠成。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： 动笔就写不审题，要点遗漏。错误二： 通篇简单句，无连接词，结构松散。错误三： 时态混乱，叙事文里现在过去混杂。错误四： 超词数过多或过少(通常要求80词上下)。","examFocus":"书面表达15至20分，按档次给分。得分关键： 要点全(保底)、句式多样(冲高档)、书写工整(印象分)。","tags":["答题模板","写作技巧"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-20-3","title":"常用连接词与结构搭建","content":"连接词是作文的「骨架钢筋」，按功能分类背。开头引题： To begin with, At first, First of all；递进补充： besides, what is more, in addition, moreover；转折对比： but, however, yet, on the other hand；因果： because, so, therefore, as a result；举例： for example, such as；总结点题： in a word, in short, all in all, in conclusion；时间顺序： first, then, next, after that, finally。三段式模板： 开头(1至2句)引出主题；中间(3至5句)按要点展开，每句配连接词；结尾(1至2句)总结或倡议。例句： ①First of all, we should make a study plan. Besides, taking notes in class is necessary. In a word, good habits lead to good grades. ②On the one hand, playing computer games helps us relax. On the other hand, it wastes time. ③As a result, he made great progress in English.。连接词一上，文章立刻「有条理」，评分档次随之上升。","keyPoints":["开头类: to begin with/first of all","递进类: besides/what is more/in addition","转折类: however/on the other hand","因果类: as a result/therefore","总结类: in a word/in short/all in all"],"example":"例: 升级改写: We got to the farm. We picked apples. We went home. 解析: 加路标词后: First, we got to the farm. Then we picked apples happily. Finally, we went home with full baskets. 三个孤立短句立刻变成流畅记叙,逻辑感与结构感双双在线。","extension":null,"traps":"错误一： 通篇无连接词，句句孤立。错误二： 连接词堆砌成灾(一句三个besides)。错误三： however当连词用却不管逗号(however是副词，需逗号分隔)。错误四： 中文式连接「and then and then」连环。","examFocus":"书面表达结构分占重要权重；阅读推理题也考逻辑词理解。得分关键： 每段至少一个连接词，首尾必须有总起总结。","tags":["写作技巧","基础必会"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-20-4","title":"话题佳句积累","content":"按高频话题储备「万能佳句」。写人: My mother is a nurse who is always ready to help others.(职业+定语从句)She not only works hard but also takes good care of our family. 写活动: Last Saturday, our class went to the nursing home to cheer the old people up. It was tiring but meaningful. 表观点: In my opinion, reading is like opening a window to a bigger world. The more we read, the wiser we will become.(越……越……)提建议: Why not take more exercise? It's a good idea to keep a diary in English. 抒感受: What an unforgettable experience it was! 每个话题备好「开头句+过程句+感受句」三件套。","keyPoints":["写人句: ...is a ... who...(职业+品质+定从)","活动句: It was tiring but meaningful.","观点句: The more..., the more...(越...越...)","建议句: Why not...? / It's a good idea to...","结尾感叹: What an unforgettable day it was!"],"example":"例: 话题「难忘的一天」收尾: What an unforgettable day it was! I will keep this sweet memory forever. 解析: 感叹句+情感升华,首尾呼应,比平淡的 I was very happy today. 更能打动阅卷老师,这正是佳句的价值。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["写作技巧","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-20-5","title":"高分句型: 宾从、定从与被动在写作中的运用","content":"高分句式三件套，写作升档立竿见影。①宾语从句表达观点： I think that... / I believe that... 升级版： What is more, I believe that reading opens a window to the world. ②定语从句合并两句： 原句 Li Hua is my friend. He helped me with math. 合并 Li Hua, who is my friend, helped me with math. / I have a friend who can always cheer me up. ③被动语态显客观： We should protect the environment. 升级 The environment should be protected by everyone. / Trees were planted on the hill by our class. 组合示范(范文片段)： I think that reading is important. Books which tell stories of heroes can encourage us. What is more, knowledge should be spread through reading. 例句对照： 原句 The book is interesting. I like it. 升级 The book, which is full of adventures, interests me a lot.。使用原则： 一篇80词作文放2至3个高级句式即可，过犹不及。","keyPoints":["宾从表观点: I believe that.../I am sure that...","定从合并两句: who/which作主语最常用","被动显客观: The environment should be protected","not only...but also与as...as提升表达档次","高级句式2至3个为宜，宁精勿滥"],"example":"例: 将 I met a girl. She helped me find the way. 合并为一句。解析: 用定语从句: I met a girl who helped me find the way. 两个短句压成一句长句,信息密度与语言档次同步提升——高分句型的本质是用语法工具「压缩」信息,展示语言驾驭能力。","extension":"高分句型「红绿灯原则」: 绿灯=滚瓜烂熟的句型放心用; 黄灯=没把握的换成简单句; 红灯=中式英语坚决不用。稳中求胜, 一档作文向你招手。","traps":"错误一： 定从关系词用错(人用who物用which)。错误二： 被动语态丢be或丢过去分词。错误三： 句式堆砌导致语法错误反扣分。错误四： 宾从语序写倒装。","examFocus":"书面表达按档次评分，高级句式是二档升一档的关键。得分关键： 观点句用宾从、合并句用定从、客观句用被动。","tags":["拓展提升","写作技巧","中考高频"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"}]},{"uid":"english-21","name":"教材课文·七年级上册","grade":"七年级上册","order":20,"kps":[{"uid":"english-21-1","title":"Starter Unit 1 Good morning!——问候与字母","content":"本单元是初中英语的第一课, 学会用英语打招呼并认读写前八个字母 Aa-Hh。核心功能是分时段问候: Good morning!(早晨/上午)、Good afternoon!(下午)、Good evening!(晚上), 以及关心近况的 How are you? — I'm fine, thanks. And you? 注意问候与告别的区别: Good evening 是晚上见面问好, Good night 则是睡前道别。字母学习要求「三会」: 会认、会读、会写, 特别留意小写 a 占中格、b 与 d 的开口方向。本单元是七年级上册的入门基石, 中考听力「听句子选图片」与辨字母题都从这里起步。","keyPoints":["分时段问候: Good morning!(上午) Good afternoon!(下午) Good evening!(晚上)","关心近况: — How are you? — I'm fine, thanks. And you?","问候与道别: Good evening 是晚上问好, Good night 是睡前道别","字母 Aa-Hh: 大写占上两格, 小写 a 在中格, b/d 方向要分清","语法提示: 回应问候应与对方保持同一时段, 问好用语成对出现"],"example":"课文选段: A: Good morning, Cindy! B: Good morning, Dale! A: How are you? B: I'm fine, thanks. And you? A: I'm fine, too. It's time for class. Goodbye, Dale! B: Goodbye, Cindy! 译文: ——早上好, 辛迪!——早上好, 戴尔!——你好吗?——我很好, 谢谢。你呢?——我也很好。该上课了, 再见, 戴尔!——再见, 辛迪!","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","情景交际"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-21-2","title":"Unit 1 My name's Gina——自我介绍","content":"本单元围绕「自我介绍与结交朋友」展开, 核心句型是 What's your name? — My name's Gina. / I'm Gina. 以及第三人称问答 What's his/her name? His name's Tony. 初次见面要说 Nice to meet you! 对方回答 Nice to meet you, too. 本单元首次集中呈现缩略形式: name's = name is, what's = what is, I'm = I am, 为整个初中的听说读写打基础。电话用语 Call Alan at 495-3539. 直接来源于本单元的对话板块。作为七年级上册的正式第一单元, 它奠定了人称代词与 be 动词缩写的基调, 中考情景交际「询问姓名」类题目均由此起航。","keyPoints":["核心句型: — What's your name? — My name's Gina. / I'm Gina.","第三人称问答: What's his/her name? His name's Tony. / Her name's Mary.","初次见面交际: — Nice to meet you! — Nice to meet you, too.","电话用语: Call Alan at 495-3539.(拨打某号码找某人)","语法提示: name's = name is, what's = what is, I'm = I am, 缩写无处不在"],"example":"课文选段: A: Good morning! I'm Gina. What's your name? B: My name's Jenny. Nice to meet you! A: Nice to meet you, too. That girl is my friend. B: What's her name? A: Her name's Mary. She's new here. B: What's her phone number? A: It's 281-9176. You can call Mary at 281-9176 after class. B: Great! Thank you, Gina. 译文: ——早上好!我叫吉娜, 你叫什么名字?——我叫珍妮, 很高兴认识你!——我也很高兴认识你。那个女孩是我的朋友。——她叫什么名字?——她叫玛丽, 是新来的。——她的电话号码是多少?——是281-9176, 放学后你可以拨打281-9176找玛丽。——太好了!谢谢你, 吉娜。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","情景交际"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-21-3","title":"Unit 2 This is my sister——介绍家人","content":"本单元话题为「介绍家人」, 核心是指示代词系统: 单数近指 this(这)、远指 that(那), 复数近指 these(这些)、远指 those(那些)。典型句型 This is my sister. / These are my parents. 用于把家人介绍给别人; That/Those are... 则指向稍远的人或物。配合 family tree(家谱)梳理 grandparents、parents、uncle、aunt、cousin 等亲属称谓, 是词汇考查的重点。Thanks for the photo of your family. 一句集中体现「thanks for + 名词」与「of 所有」结构。本单元是指示代词单复数的起点, 中考情景交际里的「介绍他人」均以此为母版。","keyPoints":["单数介绍: This is my sister.(近指) / That is my brother.(远指)","复数介绍: These are my parents. / Those are my grandparents.","指示代词配对: this→these, that→those, 复数回答用 they","重点短语: thanks for the photo of your family; a photo of my family","语法提示: 指示代词的单复数决定 be 动词, This is... 不能说 This are..."],"example":"课文选段: A: Hi, Dave. Is this a photo of your family? B: Yes, it is. Look! This is my sister, Mary. A: Is that your brother? B: No, that isn't my brother. That's my cousin, Tom. A: Who's the little boy? B: He's my brother, Jack. And these are my parents. Those are my grandparents. A: What a big family! Thanks for the photo of your family. B: You're welcome. 译文: ——嗨, 戴夫。这是一张你的全家福吗?——是的。看!这是我妹妹玛丽。——那是你哥哥吗?——不, 那不是我哥哥, 那是我的表弟汤姆。——这个小男孩是谁?——他是我弟弟杰克。这些是我的父母, 那些是我的祖父母。——好大的一个家庭啊!谢谢你给我看你们家的照片。——不客气。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","话题写作"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-21-4","title":"Unit 3 Is this your pencil?——物品所属","content":"本单元围绕「确认物品归属」展开, 核心句型是一般疑问句 Is this/that your pencil? 及其简略回答 Yes, it is. / No, it isn't. 注意回答时用 it 代替 this/that。询问物品的英语说法用 What's this in English? — It's an eraser. 打扰别人先说 Excuse me, 得到帮助要 Thank you for your help. 本单元系统学习学习用品词汇(pencil, eraser, ruler, dictionary, schoolbag)与物主代词 my/his/her 的搭配, 并首次出现 How do you spell it? 的拼读问答。它是七年级上册 be 动词一般疑问句的操练场, 中考单项选择与情景对话中「认领物品」题均出自这里。","keyPoints":["核心句型: — Is this your pencil? — Yes, it is. / No, it isn't.","询问物品: What's this in English? — It's an eraser. How do you spell it?","礼貌交际: Excuse me. / Thank you for your help. / You're welcome.","物主搭配: my schoolbag, his dictionary, her ID card","语法提示: be 动词一般疑问句读升调, 回答用 it/they 代替 this/that"],"example":"课文选段: A: Excuse me, Jane. Is this your pencil? B: No, it isn't. My pencil is in my pencil box. A: Is this your eraser? B: Yes, it is. Thank you for your help. A: You're welcome. What's this in English? B: It's a ruler. A: How do you spell it? B: R-U-L-E-R. 译文: ——打扰一下, 简。这是你的铅笔吗?——不, 不是。我的铅笔在铅笔盒里。——这是你的橡皮吗?——是的, 它是。谢谢你的帮助。——不客气。这个用英语怎么说?——它是一把尺子。——怎么拼写?——R-U-L-E-R。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","情景交际"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-21-5","title":"Unit 4 Where's my schoolbag?——位置与方位","content":"本单元话题为「物品的位置」, 核心句型 Where's my schoolbag? — It's under the table. 复数问法 Where are my books? — They're on the sofa. 其中 where's = where is, where're = where are。方位介词三巨头 in(在……里)、on(在……上)、under(在……下)是本单元的语法心脏, 常与家具类词汇 table、sofa、bed、bookcase 同现。2b 阅读 My room 讨论房间是否 tidy, 引出「整洁房间」的话题写作。本单元是特殊疑问词 where 的首次亮相, 中考听力「听对话选图片」与单选介词填空高频引用本单元句型, 是七年级上册期中考试的必考点。","keyPoints":["核心句型: — Where's my schoolbag? — It's under the table.","复数问法: — Where are my books? — They're on the sofa.","方位介词三巨头: in(在里), on(在上), under(在下)","缩写形式: where's = where is, where're = where are","语法提示: where 问位置, 回答主语的单复数要与问句保持一致"],"example":"课文选段: A: Mom, where's my schoolbag? B: It's under the table. A: Where are my books? B: They're on the sofa. A: Where's my computer game? B: Is it in your room? A: No, it isn't. Oh, look! It's under the bed. B: Tom, your room isn't tidy. A: Sorry, Mom. And where's my hat? B: It's on your head! 译文: ——妈妈, 我的书包在哪里?——它在桌子下面。——我的书在哪里?——它们在沙发上。——我的电子游戏机在哪里?——在你的房间里吗?——不, 不在。哦, 看!它在床下面。——汤姆, 你的房间可不整洁。——对不起, 妈妈。那我的帽子在哪里?——它就在你头上!","extension":"中考链接: 方位介词常与「听对话选图」连考, 抓住介词后面的名词即可定位: in the drawer、on the sofa、under the chair 分别对应「抽屉里、沙发上、椅子下」。写介绍房间的作文时, 先总说 My room is tidy, 再逐件物品交代位置, 层次立现。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","听力考点"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-21-6","title":"Unit 5 Do you have a soccer ball?——拥有与运动","content":"本单元围绕「谈论拥有与运动」展开, 核心句型 Do you have a soccer ball? — Yes, I do. / No, I don't. 第三人称用 Does he have a tennis ball? — Yes, he does. / No, he doesn't. 由此建立 have 的人称意识: I/you/we/they have, he/she/it has。提建议说 Let's go! We're late! 评价建议用 That sounds interesting / fun / relaxing. 读写板块围绕「sports collection」谈论运动收藏与感受。本单元是动词 have 的一般现在时一般疑问句的起点, 与七年级下册、八年级上册的相关单元形成链条, 中考情景交际「相约运动」类题目几乎全部出自这里。","keyPoints":["核心句型: — Do you have a soccer ball? — Yes, I do. / No, I don't.","第三人称: Does he have a tennis ball? — Yes, he does. / No, he doesn't.","提建议与评价: Let's go! We're late! That sounds interesting/fun/relaxing.","have 的人称: I/you/we/they have, he/she/it has","语法提示: do/does 开头的一般疑问句, 简略回答仍用 do/does"],"example":"课文选段: A: Hi, Bob! Do you have a soccer ball? B: No, I don't. But I have a basketball. A: Great! Let's play basketball after school. B: That sounds interesting! A: Does Peter have a basketball, too? B: No, he doesn't. He has a ping-pong ball and two ping-pong bats. A: Does he like sports? B: Yes, he does. He plays ping-pong every day. A: OK. See you after school! 译文: ——嗨, 鲍勃!你有一个足球吗?——不, 我没有, 但我有一个篮球。——太好了!放学后我们打篮球吧。——那听起来很有趣!——彼得也有篮球吗?——不, 他没有。他有一个乒乓球和两个球拍。——他喜欢运动吗?——是的, 他喜欢。他每天打乒乓球。——好, 放学后见!","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","情景交际","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-21-7","title":"Unit 6 Do you like bananas?——食物与好恶","content":"本单元话题为「食物与喜好」, 核心句型 Do you like bananas? — Yes, I do. Does she like ice-cream? — No, she doesn't. like 后接可数名词复数表一类(I like apples), 接不可数名词表物质(I like rice)。三餐表达 have...for breakfast/lunch/dinner 是本单元的读写亮点, 2b 阅读 Sports Star Eats Well! 以体育明星的饮食习惯示范了 What do you like for breakfast? 的问答。本单元同时区分可数与不可数名词(food, fruit, milk, bread), 是七年级上册名词数概念的深化, 也是中考完形「健康饮食」语篇的素材库。","keyPoints":["核心句型: — Do you like bananas? — Yes, I do. / No, I don't.","第三人称: Does she like ice-cream? — No, she doesn't.","三餐表达: have...for breakfast/lunch/dinner; Sports Star Eats Well!","like 的搭配: like + 可数复数表一类(I like apples), like + 不可数表物质","语法提示: 可数与不可数名词是本单元词汇分类的主线"],"example":"课文选段: A: Hi, Sally! Do you like bananas? B: Yes, I do. I like bananas and apples. A: Do you like ice-cream? B: No, I don't. I don't want to be fat. What about you? A: I like vegetables and rice. I have eggs and milk for breakfast. B: Does your brother like vegetables? A: No, he doesn't. He only likes chicken. He has chicken and rice for dinner. B: Oh, that's not good. Good eating habits are important. 译文: ——嗨, 萨莉!你喜欢香蕉吗?——是的, 我喜欢。我喜欢香蕉和苹果。——你喜欢冰淇淋吗?——不, 我不喜欢, 我可不想变胖。你呢?——我喜欢蔬菜和米饭。我早餐吃鸡蛋、喝牛奶。——你弟弟喜欢蔬菜吗?——不, 他不喜欢, 他只喜欢鸡肉。他晚饭吃鸡肉和米饭。——哦, 那可不好。良好的饮食习惯很重要。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","话题写作"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-21-8","title":"Unit 7 How much are these socks?——购物与价格","content":"本单元围绕「购物与询问价格」展开, 核心句型 How much is this T-shirt? — It's seven dollars. 复数问法 How much are these socks? — They're two dollars. 价格随主语单复数选 is/are 是必考细节。购物全程用语: 售货员说 Can I help you?, 顾客说 I need a sweater for school., 试后决定 I'll take it., 付钱成交 Here you are. 量词短语 a pair of 与裤子、短裤、鞋袜等「成双成对」名词连用。本单元还学习数字 10-31, 完成七年级上册数字系统的收尾; 中考情景交际「购物」对话题与听力「听价格」题均以此单元为原型。","keyPoints":["核心句型: — How much is this T-shirt? — It's seven dollars.","复数价格: — How much are these socks? — They're two dollars.","购物交际: Can I help you? / What color do you want? / I'll take it. / Here you are.","量词短语: a pair of socks/shorts/trousers, two pairs of...","语法提示: How much 问价格, be 动词由商品的单复数决定"],"example":"课文选段: A: Can I help you? B: Yes, please. I need a sweater for school. A: OK. What color do you want? B: Blue. How much is this blue sweater? A: It's nine dollars. B: And how much are these socks? A: They're two dollars a pair. B: Great! I'll take the sweater and two pairs of socks. A: Here you are. B: Thank you. 译文: ——要帮忙吗?——是的。我需要一件上学穿的毛衣。——好的。你想要什么颜色?——蓝色。这件蓝毛衣多少钱?——九美元。——那这些袜子多少钱?——两美元一双。——太好了!我要买这件毛衣和两双袜子。——给你。——谢谢。","extension":"中考链接: 购物场景对话是情景交际的高频题。答题先分清角色: 售货员常说 Can I help you? / What can I do for you?, 顾客则说 I want... / I need... / How much is it? 价格问句 How much is/are...? 中的 be 动词由后面的名词单复数决定, 这是单选题最容易失分的一格。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","情景交际","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"}]},{"uid":"english-22","name":"教材课文·七年级下册","grade":"七年级下册","order":21,"kps":[{"uid":"english-22-1","title":"Unit 1 Can you play the guitar?——能力与加入社团","content":"本单元围绕「谈论能力与加入社团」展开, 核心句型 Can you play the guitar? — Yes, I can. / No, I can't. 询问意愿 What club do you want to join? — I want to join the art club. can 后接动词原形、没有人称和数的变化, 是本单元的语法核心。重点短语 be good with...(善于应付……)、talk to...(和……交谈)、play the piano(西洋乐器前加 the)高频出现。2b 阅读 Help for Old People's Home 把「能力 + 意愿」写成招聘启事, 是应用文写作的范例。本单元开启七年级下册的情态动词序列, 中考单项选择「can + 动词原形」与招聘海报写作均源于此。","keyPoints":["核心句型: — Can you play the guitar? — Yes, I can. / No, I can't.","询问意愿: What club do you want to join? — I want to join the art club.","重点短语: be good with..., talk to..., help with..., play the piano","能力陈述: I can speak English and I can also play the piano.","语法提示: can 后接动词原形, 无人称与数的变化; 西洋乐器前加 the"],"example":"课文选段: A: Hi, Lisa! What club do you want to join? B: I want to join the music club. I can sing and dance. What about you, Eric? A: I want to join the chess club. I can play chess, but I can't sing or dance. B: Can Mary play the piano? A: Yes, she can. She can also draw very well. She wants to join the art club. B: Does she want to join the music club, too? A: No, she doesn't. But she's good with old people. She can talk to them and play games with them. 译文: ——嗨, 丽莎!你想加入什么社团?——我想加入音乐社团, 我会唱歌跳舞。你呢, 埃里克?——我想加入棋类社团。我会下棋, 但不会唱歌跳舞。——玛丽会弹钢琴吗?——会, 她画画也很好, 她想加入美术社团。——她也想加入音乐社团吗?——不, 她不想。不过她善于和老人相处, 能陪他们聊天、做游戏。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","情景交际","话题写作"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-22-2","title":"Unit 2 What time do you go to school?——作息时间","content":"本单元话题为「作息时间」, 核心句型 What time do you usually get up? — I usually get up at six thirty. 频度副词 usually/always/sometimes/never 是语法焦点: 位于实义动词之前、be 动词之后。either...or...(要么……要么……)与 lots of 在 2b 阅读 Tony and Mary 的作息语篇中集中呈现, 并以 bad habits 呼应健康生活话题。时间表达有顺读、逆读两种: six thirty 或 half past six。本单元把「问时刻」与「谈习惯」合二为一, 是中考听力「听时间」、单选频度副词定位与「良好习惯」话题写作的共同源头。","keyPoints":["核心句型: — What time do you usually get up? — I usually get up at six thirty.","频度副词: usually/always/sometimes/never, 实义动词前、be 动词后","时间表达: at six thirty = at half past six; from...to...","重点句式: either...or...(要么……要么……); lots of = a lot of","语法提示: What time 问具体时刻, 回答用 at + 时刻"],"example":"课文选段: A: Mary, what time do you usually get up? B: I usually get up at six thirty and eat a good breakfast. A: What time do you go to school? B: I go to school at seven thirty. A: What do you do after school? B: I sometimes play basketball for half an hour. Then I always do my homework first. A: What do you do in the evening? B: I either watch TV or play computer games. At ten thirty, I brush my teeth and then go to bed. 译文: ——玛丽, 你通常几点起床?——我通常六点半起床, 吃一顿丰盛的早餐。——你几点去上学?——七点半。——放学后你做什么?——我有时打半小时篮球, 然后总是先做作业。——晚上你做什么?——我要么看电视, 要么玩电脑游戏。十点半我刷完牙就去睡觉。","extension":"中考链接: 频度副词的位置是单选与语法填空的常设错点——实义动词之前、be 动词之后: He is always late. / He always gets up late. 写作中用 usually、sometimes、either...or... 组织作息段落, 能让「我的日常生活」类作文层次分明。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","话题写作","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-22-3","title":"Unit 3 How do you get to school?——出行方式","content":"本单元围绕「出行方式」展开, 疑问词 how 家族全员登场: How do you get to school? — I ride my bike. / I take the bus. 问时长 How long does it take? — It takes about 20 minutes. 问距离 How far is it from your home to school? — It's about three kilometers. 核心句型 It takes sb. some time to do sth. 是写作黄金句。出行方式有两类表达: by bike/bus/subway(介词短语, 名词前不加冠词)与 ride a bike / take the bus(动词短语)。2b 阅读 Crossing the River to School 讲山区孩子滑索上学的故事, 升华「珍惜学习机会」的主题。本单元是 how 系列问答与数字运算听力的母题。","keyPoints":["核心句型: — How do you get to school? — I ride my bike. / I take the bus.","问时长: — How long does it take? — It takes about 20 minutes.","问距离: How far is it from your home to school? — It's about three kilometers.","两类方式表达: by bike/bus/subway(介词) 与 ride a bike / take the bus(动词)","语法提示: It takes sb. some time to do sth. 是写作黄金句型"],"example":"课文选段: A: Hi, Jane. How do you get to school? B: I usually ride my bike. How about you, Tom? A: I take the subway. B: How long does it take? A: It takes about 15 minutes. How far is it from your home to school? B: It's about three kilometers. The bus ride takes about 20 minutes. A: Does Lisa go to school by bus? B: No, she doesn't. She walks to school. It takes her 25 minutes. 译文: ——嗨, 简。你怎么去上学?——我通常骑自行车。你呢, 汤姆?——我乘地铁。——要花多长时间?——大约15分钟。从你家到学校有多远?——大约三公里, 坐公交要花20分钟左右。——丽莎乘公交上学吗?——不, 她步行上学, 要花25分钟。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","情景交际","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-22-4","title":"Unit 4 Don't eat in class——校规与家规","content":"本单元话题为「规章制度」, 核心句型是否定祈使句 Don't eat in class. / Don't run in the hallways. 谈规则先问 Can we wear a hat in class? — No, we can't. 表义务用 We have to be quiet in the library. 语法上区分三兄弟: 祈使句以动词原形开头、否定在句首加 Don't; have to 强调客观要求(有人称与时态变化); must 强调主观必须(无人称变化)。2b 阅读 Dear Dr. Know 以书信吐槽家规, 呼应「规则与自由」话题写作。本单元是祈使句的起点, 中考单选「Don't + 动词原形」与「家规校规」书面表达均以此为模板。","keyPoints":["核心句型: Don't eat in class. / Don't run in the hallways.","询问规则: Can we wear a hat in class? — No, we can't.","表义务: We have to be quiet in the library. / You must be on time.","祈使句结构: 动词原形开头, 否定在句首加 Don't","语法提示: have to 强调客观要求(有人称变化), must 强调主观必须(无人称变化)"],"example":"课文选段: A: Hi, Molly. What are some of your school rules? B: Well, we can't arrive late for class. We must be on time. A: Can you eat in the classroom? B: No, we can't. But we can eat in the dining hall. A: Do you have to wear the school uniform? B: Yes, we do. We also have to be quiet in the library. A: What else? B: Don't run in the hallways and don't listen to music in class. A: Can you bring music players to school? B: No, we can't. And we can't fight with our classmates, either. 译文: ——嗨, 莫莉。你们学校有哪些校规?——嗯, 我们上课不能迟到, 必须准时。——你们能在教室里吃东西吗?——不能, 但我们可以在食堂吃。——你们必须穿校服吗?——是的, 我们在图书馆还必须保持安静。——还有呢?——不能在走廊里跑, 也不能在课上听音乐。——能带音乐播放器到学校吗?——不能, 我们也不能和同学打架。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","话题写作"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-22-5","title":"Unit 5 Why do you like pandas?——动物与喜好","content":"本单元围绕「动物与喜好原因」展开, 核心句型 Why do you like pandas? — Because they're kind of interesting. 问答链条完整呈现: What animals do you like? 问喜好, Why...? 问原因, 回答必用 because。程度词 kind of / a little(有点儿)与 very 修饰形容词形成梯度。be from... = come from...(来自)是高频同义转换。2b 阅读 Let's Save the Elephants 揭示大象因象牙贸易而 in great danger, 呼吁 save the elephants, 把语言学习与动物保护议题结合。本单元是 why/because 逻辑问答的起点, 中考完形「保护动物」语篇与情景交际「谈喜好」均以此为原型。","keyPoints":["核心句型: — Why do you like pandas? — Because they're kind of interesting.","问答链: What animals do you like? → Why...? → Because...","程度表达: kind of = a little(有点儿), 与 very 形成梯度","同义转换: be from... = come from...(来自)","语法提示: why 问原因, 回答必须用 because, 二者成对出现"],"example":"课文选段: A: Let's see the pandas first. They're my favorite animals. B: Why do you like pandas? A: Because they're kind of interesting. And they're from China. B: Well, I like elephants because they're really smart. A: But elephants are in great danger now. B: Why? A: People cut down many trees and kill elephants for their ivory. B: That's too bad. We must save the elephants. A: Yes. Remember: never buy things made of ivory. 译文: ——我们先看熊猫吧, 它们是我最喜欢的动物。——你为什么喜欢熊猫?——因为它们有点有趣, 而且它们来自中国。——我喜欢大象, 因为它们非常聪明。——可现在大象正处于极大的危险之中。——为什么?——人们砍伐大量树木, 还为了象牙猎杀大象。——太糟糕了。我们必须拯救大象。——是的。记住: 永远不要买象牙制品。","extension":"文化拓展: 大象在泰国文化中是吉祥与力量的象征; 中国的大熊猫更是「活化石」, 世界自然基金会(WWF)的会徽即以熊猫为原型。中考话题写作「保护动物」可直接借用本单元句型: Animals are our friends. They are in great danger. We must save them.","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","阅读拓展"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-22-6","title":"Unit 6 I'm watching TV——现在进行时入门","content":"本单元首次系统学习现在进行时, 核心句型 What are you doing? — I'm watching TV. 第三人称 What's he doing? — He's using the computer. 构成口诀「be 动词加动词-ing」, 表示此时此刻正在进行的动作。动词-ing 变化规则集中操练: 一般直接加(watch→watching); 以不发音的 e 结尾去 e 加(use→using, make→making); 重读闭音节双写尾字母再加(run→running, swim→swimming)。2d 对话围绕 TV show 谈论节目是否有趣。本单元是初中三大时态学习的第一站, 中考「看图选进行时」听力题与 now 信号词单选题均由此起步。","keyPoints":["核心句型: — What are you doing? — I'm watching TV.","第三人称: What's he doing? — He's using the computer.","构成口诀: be 动词(am/is/are) + 动词-ing, 表正在进行","ing 变化: 直接加(watching); 去e加(using, making); 双写加(running, swimming)","语法提示: 看到 now、Look!、Listen! 等信号词, 优先考虑现在进行时"],"example":"课文选段: A: Hi, Jenny. What are you doing? B: I'm watching TV. But this TV show is kind of boring. A: Do you want to play tennis with me? B: Sure. What's Jack doing? A: He's using the computer. B: What about Laura? Is she reading a newspaper? A: No, she isn't. She's talking on the phone. B: OK. Let's meet at my home first. See you then! 译文: ——嗨, 珍妮。你在做什么?——我在看电视, 可这个节目有点无聊。——你想和我打网球吗?——当然。杰克在做什么?——他在用电脑。——劳拉呢?她在看报纸吗?——不, 她在打电话。——好, 我们先在我家碰头。到时见!","extension":"中考链接: 现在进行时是中考必考时态。看到 now、Look!、Listen! 等信号词, 或问句 What are you doing? 时, 立即锁定 be + doing 结构; 静态动词 know、like、want 一般不用于进行时, 是单选题的高频陷阱。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-22-7","title":"Unit 7 It's raining!——天气与活动","content":"本单元话题为「天气与正在进行的活动」, 两问同一答: How's the weather in Beijing? = What's the weather like? — It's sunny. / It's windy. 天气形容词由名词加 y 构成: sun→sunny, wind→windy, cloud→cloudy, rain→rainy, snow→snowy。「天气 + 进行时」搭配是本单元特色, 电话场景中 How's it going? — Not bad. 以及捎口信 Could you just tell him to call me back? 是高频交际用语。2b 明信片语篇把天气、活动与心情串成一篇应用文。本单元是中考听力「听天气选图」与电话情景交际的固定取材地。","keyPoints":["核心句型: — How's the weather in Beijing? — It's sunny.","同义句转换: How's the weather? = What's the weather like?","天气词构成: sun→sunny, wind→windy, cloud→cloudy, rain→rainy, snow→snowy","电话交际: Could you just tell him to call me back? Can I take a message?","语法提示: weather 不可数, 问天气用 it 指代; 天气常与正在进行的活动搭配出题"],"example":"课文选段: A: Hello, Rick speaking. B: Hi, Rick. It's Steve. How's the weather in Moscow? A: It's windy and cold here. What are you doing? B: I'm playing basketball with some friends at the park. A: Sounds like you're having a good time. B: Yeah. Is your brother Scott at home? A: Oh, he's not here. He's studying at his friend's home. Can I take a message for him? B: Yes. Could you just tell him to call me back? A: Sure, no problem. 译文: ——你好, 我是里克。——嗨, 里克。我是史蒂夫。莫斯科的天气怎么样?——这里多风又冷。你在做什么?——我正在公园里和朋友们打篮球。——听起来你玩得很开心。——是啊。你哥哥斯科特在家吗?——哦, 他不在, 他在朋友家学习。要我给他捎个口信吗?——好的。你能让他给我回个电话吗?——当然, 没问题。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","情景交际"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-22-8","title":"Unit 8 Is there a post office near here?——问路与指路","content":"本单元围绕「问路与指路」展开, 核心句型 Is there a post office near here? — Yes, there is. There be 句型遵循就近原则: be 动词与它最近的名词保持一致, 如 There is a pen and two books on the desk. 指路用语成串: Go along Bridge Street and turn left. / Go straight and turn right on First Street. 方位介词 across from(在……对面)、next to(紧挨着)、in front of(在……前面)、behind(在……后面)构成空间坐标系。2b 阅读介绍小区环境, 是「介绍周边」话题写作的范本。本单元是中考情景交际「问路指路」与方位介词单选的必考点, 规律性强, 需整体打包记忆。","keyPoints":["核心句型: — Is there a post office near here? — Yes, there is.","问路指路: Where's the hotel? Go along Bridge Street and turn left.","方位介词: across from, next to, in front of, behind, between...and...","There be 句型: 就近原则, There is a pen and two books on the desk.","语法提示: There is + 单数/不可数, There are + 复数; 肯定回答 Yes, there is."],"example":"课文选段: A: Excuse me. Is there a post office near here? B: Yes, there is. A: Where is it? B: Just go along Bridge Street and turn left when you see the library. It's between the restaurant and the supermarket. A: Thanks. And is there a hotel near here? B: Yes, there's one on New Street. It's across from the park, next to the bank. A: How can I get to the hotel from the post office? B: Go straight and turn right on First Street. A: Thank you very much. B: You're welcome. 译文: ——打扰一下, 这附近有邮局吗?——有。——它在哪里?——沿着大桥街走, 看到图书馆就左转。它在餐馆和超市之间。——谢谢。这附近还有旅馆吗?——有, 新街上就有一家, 在公园对面、银行旁边。——从邮局到旅馆怎么走?——直走, 到第一街右转。——非常感谢。——不客气。","extension":"中考链接: there be 与 have 的辨析是常考点——there be 表「某地存在」, have 表「某人拥有」; 就近原则要求 be 与最近的名词一致。情景交际「问路」必与方位介词连考, 先定位, 再说 go along / turn left / turn right 的路线动词。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","情景交际","易错点"],"difficulty":3,"type":"core"}]},{"uid":"english-23","name":"教材课文·八年级上册","grade":"八年级上册","order":22,"kps":[{"uid":"english-23-1","title":"Unit 1 Where did you go on vacation?——过去活动","content":"本单元以「假期活动」为话题, 学习用一般过去时询问和描述过去发生的事。核心句型: Where did you go on vacation? I went to the mountains. Did you go with anyone? No. No one was here. Everyone was on vacation. 语法焦点是复合不定代词 anyone、something、nothing、everyone 与一般过去时的综合运用: 不定代词作主语时谓语动词用单数, 形容词修饰不定代词要后置(something important)。中考定位: 一般过去时是听力与单选的必考点, something 与 anything 的辨析、anywhere 的用法高频出现, 假期经历更是书面表达「难忘的一件事」的万能素材。","keyPoints":["核心句型: Where did you go on vacation? I went to the mountains.","核心句型: Did you go with anyone? No. No one was here. Everyone was on vacation.","重点短语: go to summer camp, quite a few photos, of course, stay at home, seem to be bored","交际用语: How was your vacation? It was wonderful! / Did everyone have a good time?","语法点: 复合不定代词 everyone, nothing, anyone 作主语时, 谓语动词用单数","语法点: 形容词修饰不定代词要后置: something important, nothing special"],"example":"课文选段: A: Hi, Helen. Long time no see. B: Hi, Rick — I was on vacation last month. A: Did you go anywhere interesting? B: Yes, I went to Guizhou with my family, and we saw Huangguoshu Waterfall. A: How was it? B: It was wonderful, and we took quite a few photos there. A: Did you do anything special? B: Not really — I just stayed at home to read and relax. 译文: ——你好, 海伦。好久不见。——你好, 里克, 我上个月去度假了。——你去什么有趣的地方了吗?——去了, 我和家人去了贵州, 我们还看了黄果树瀑布。——怎么样?——太壮观了, 我们还在那儿拍了不少照片。——你做什么特别的事了吗?——也没什么, 我只是待在家里看书放松。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","阅读话题"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-23-2","title":"Unit 2 How often do you exercise?——频率与生活习惯","content":"本单元话题是「日常活动与生活习惯」, 学习用频度副词和次数短语谈论做事的频率。核心句型: What do you usually do on weekends? I often go to the movies. How often do you exercise? Hardly ever. 语法焦点是频度副词 always、usually、often、sometimes、hardly ever、never 的程度排序与位置, 以及 once a week、twice a month、three times a day 等次数表达。中考定位: How often 问频率与 How long、How soon 的辨析是单选经典考点, 频度副词的位置(实义动词之前、be 动词之后)常设陷阱, 健康生活方式是阅读理解与书面表达的双料热点。","keyPoints":["核心句型: How often do you exercise? Hardly ever. / I exercise once a week.","核心句型: What do you usually do on weekends? I often help with housework.","重点短语: how often, at least, junk food, such as, more than, less than","频度由高到低: always→usually→often→sometimes→hardly ever→never","语法点: 频度副词放在实义动词之前、be 动词之后; How often 问频率, How long 问时长","次数表达: once a week, twice a month, three times a day, every day"],"example":"课文选段: A: What do you usually do on weekends, Claire? B: I often go to the movies with my friends. A: How often do you watch TV? B: Every day — I love sitcoms. A: How often do you exercise? B: Hardly ever, because I'm always busy with my homework. A: That's too bad — you should exercise at least three times a week. B: You're right, and maybe I can play tennis with you this Saturday. 译文: ——克莱尔, 你周末通常做什么?——我常和朋友们去看电影。——你多久看一次电视?——每天都看, 我喜欢情景喜剧。——你多久锻炼一次?——几乎从不, 因为我总是忙着写作业。——那可不行, 你应该一周至少锻炼三次。——你说得对, 或许这个周六我可以和你一起打网球。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","中考高频"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-23-3","title":"Unit 3 I'm more outgoing than my sister——人物比较","content":"本单元话题是「描述人物并作比较」, 核心语法是形容词比较级。核心句型: Is that Sam? No, that's Tom. Sam has longer hair than Tom. Both Sam and Tom can play the drums, but Sam plays them better than Tom. 语法焦点是比较级的构成(单音节加-er、重读闭音节双写末字母、辅音字母+y变i再加-er、多音节用more)、than 连接比较对象、as...as... 同级比较与 both...and... 的用法。中考定位: 比较级构成与 as...as... 是单选与完形的高频考点, 比较级的同义句转换常出现在句型转换题中, 「我的朋友」类作文用比较级刻画人物更出彩。","keyPoints":["核心句型: Sam has longer hair than Tom. / Sam plays them better than Tom.","核心句型: Is Tara as friendly as Tina? No, Tina is friendlier than Tara.","重点短语: be similar to, be different from, be good at, care about, as long as","交际用语: Who is smarter, your mother or your father?","语法点: 比较级构成——单音节加er, 重读闭音节双写末字母加er, 辅音+y变i加er, 多音节用more","语法点: as...as... 中间用原级; both...and... 连接并列主语时谓语用复数"],"example":"课文选段: A: Is that Paul playing the guitar? B: No, that's Peter — he is taller than Paul and has shorter hair. A: They look similar. B: Yes, they're brothers, and both of them can play the guitar, but Peter plays it better. A: Are you as talented as them? B: I don't think so, but I'm more hard-working — I practice the guitar every day. A: That's important, because my mother says a good friend is like a mirror. B: Yes, good friends always make us want to be better. 译文: ——弹吉他的那个是保罗吗?——不, 那是彼得, 他比保罗个子高, 头发也更短。——他们看起来很像。——是啊, 他们是兄弟, 都会弹吉他, 不过彼得弹得更好。——你和他们一样有天分吗?——我不觉得, 但我更勤奋, 我每天都练吉他。——这很重要, 因为我妈妈说, 好朋友就像一面镜子。——是的, 好朋友总能让我们想变得更好。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","语法焦点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-23-4","title":"Unit 4 What's the best movie theater?——优选与最高级","content":"本单元话题是「比较不同场所并做出选择」, 核心语法是形容词、副词的最高级。核心句型: What's the best movie theater to go to? Town Cinema. It's the closest to home. And it has the shortest waiting time. 语法焦点是最高级的构成与 the+-est、the most... 句型, 用 in 或 of 短语限定比较范围, so far、thanks for telling me 等标志语提示最高级语境。中考定位: 最高级句型与 one of the+最高级+复数名词是单选必考点, 听力常设三家场所的比较对话, 「介绍我最喜欢的地方」类作文可直接调用本单元句型。","keyPoints":["核心句型: What's the best movie theater to go to? Town Cinema. It's the closest to home.","核心句型: Which is the worst clothes store in town? Dream Clothes. It has the worst service.","重点短语: so far, thanks for telling me, no problem, be close to, in town","交际用语: Can I ask you some questions? Sure. / Welcome to the neighborhood!","语法点: 最高级前必须加 the; 比较范围用 in(大范围)或 of(同类成员)限定","语法点: one of the+最高级+复数名词, 如 one of the longest rivers"],"example":"课文选段: A: What's the best movie theater to go to? B: Town Cinema — it's the closest to home, and it has the shortest waiting time. A: But Movie World has the biggest screens. B: That's true, but it's also the most expensive. A: What about Screen City? B: It has the most comfortable seats, and you can buy tickets the most quickly there. A: How about the price? B: Don't worry — its tickets are the cheapest. A: Great, let's go to Screen City this weekend, and thanks for telling me. B: No problem. 译文: ——去哪家电影院最好?——城镇影院, 它离家最近, 排队时间也最短。——可影视天地有最大的银幕啊。——那倒是, 不过它也最贵。——银幕城怎么样?——它的座位最舒服, 而且在那儿买票最快。——价格呢?——放心, 它的票最便宜。——太好了, 这周末我们就去银幕城, 谢谢你告诉我。——不客气。","extension":"中考链接: 听力对话常出现三家商店或影院的比较, 听到 the closest、the cheapest、the most comfortable 等最高级表达即可锁定答案; 单选中 one of the+最高级+复数名词作主语接单数谓语的结构, 几乎每年都会考到。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","语法焦点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-23-5","title":"Unit 5 Do you want to watch a game show?——节目喜好","content":"本单元话题是「谈论电视节目与表达喜好」, 核心语法是动词不定式。核心句型: What do you think of talk shows? I don't mind them. / I can't stand them. I like to follow the story and see what happens next. 语法焦点是 want to do、plan to do、hope to do、expect to do 等不定式结构, let、make 后接动词原形的对比, 以及 mind、stand 后接动名词的区别。中考定位: 不定式做宾语是单选必考点, 动名词与不定式的搭配辨析是易错点, 「我最喜欢的节目」是口语交际与书面表达的常见情境。","keyPoints":["核心句型: What do you think of talk shows? I don't mind them. / I can't stand them.","核心句型: I like to follow the story and see what happens next.","重点短语: find out, learn from, a pair of, come out, think of","交际用语: Do you want to watch the news? Yes, I'd love to. / I hope to be a TV reporter one day.","语法点: want, plan, hope, expect, decide 后接 to do; let/make+宾语+动词原形(不带to)","易错点: mind, stand, enjoy 后接动名词: I don't mind watching soap operas."],"example":"课文选段: A: What do you want to watch tonight? B: I plan to watch a talk show, because I love to hear people talk about their lives. A: I can't stand talk shows — they're too noisy, and I hope to watch a game show. B: OK, do you want to watch the news first? A: Sure, I expect to find out what's going on around the world. B: Good idea, and after that we can watch an exciting movie together. A: Sounds great! 译文: ——今晚你想看什么节目?——我打算看脱口秀, 因为我喜欢听人们谈论自己的生活。——我可受不了脱口秀, 太吵了, 我想看体育节目。——行, 要先看新闻吗?——好啊, 我想了解一下世界各地发生了什么。——好主意, 之后我们可以一起看一部刺激的电影。——听起来太棒了!","extension":"文化拓展: 美国电视文化中的常见节目类型有 talk show(脱口秀)、soap opera(肥皂剧, 因早期赞助商是肥皂厂商而得名)、sitcom(情景喜剧)、game show(益智竞赛节目), 了解这些背景有助于快速判断阅读理解中的话题语境。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","交际口语"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-23-6","title":"Unit 6 I'm going to study computer science——理想与计划","content":"本单元话题是「职业理想与人生计划」, 核心语法是一般将来时 be going to。核心句型: What do you want to be when you grow up? I want to be an engineer. How are you going to do that? I'm going to study math really hard. 语法焦点是 be going to+动词原形表计划打算, when 引导时间状语从句的「主将从现」, 以及 New Year's resolutions 新年计划的读写。中考定位: be going to 与 will 的语境辨析、主将从现是单选经典考点, 「我的新年计划」「我的梦想」是书面表达高频命题, 本单元句型可直接迁移。","keyPoints":["核心句型: What do you want to be when you grow up? I want to be an engineer.","核心句型: How are you going to do that? I'm going to study math really hard.","重点短语: grow up, be sure about, make sure, be able to, take up, at the beginning of","交际用语: Where are you going to work? I'm going to move to Shanghai.","语法点: be going to+动词原形表计划; when 引导的时间状语从句用一般现在时表将来(主将从现)","话题词块: make the soccer team, get good grades, eat healthier food, learn another foreign language"],"example":"课文选段: A: What do you want to be when you grow up, Ken? B: I want to be a writer. A: How are you going to do that? B: I'm going to keep on writing stories, but my parents want me to be a doctor. A: Don't worry — just make sure you try your best. B: Thanks, and what about you? A: I'm going to study computer science, because I want to be an engineer like my father. B: Great — let's work hard for our dreams! 译文: ——肯, 你长大后想做什么?——我想成为一名作家。——你打算怎么实现呢?——我打算坚持写故事, 不过我父母想让我当医生。——别担心, 只要确保自己尽了最大努力就行。——谢谢, 你呢?——我打算学计算机科学, 因为我想成为像我爸爸那样的工程师。——太好了, 让我们为梦想而努力吧!","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","写作话题"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-23-7","title":"Unit 7 Will people have robots?——未来畅想","content":"本单元话题是「预测未来的生活」, 核心语法是一般将来时 will。核心句型: Do you think there will be robots in people's homes? Yes, there will. / I think there will be more pollution. Will people use money in 100 years? No, they won't. Everything will be free. 语法焦点是 will 表预测与承诺、there will be 句型、fewer 与 less 的区别, 以及 in+时间段与 How soon 的问答。中考定位: will 句型是单选必考点, fewer、less、more 的可数不可数区分几乎每年必考, 「未来的生活」是想象类作文的热门命题, 机器人话题的说明文也常成为阅读理解的选材。","keyPoints":["核心句型: Do you think there will be robots in people's homes? Yes, there will.","核心句型: Will people use money in 100 years? No, they won't. Everything will be free.","重点短语: in 100 years, in the future, over and over again, hundreds of, fall down, wake up","交际用语: I agree. / I disagree. / That sounds like fun.","语法点: fewer+可数名词复数, less+不可数名词, more+两者皆可","语法点: in+时间段表「多久之后」, 用 How soon 提问; there will be 是 there be 的将来式"],"example":"课文选段: A: Do you think there will be robots in people's homes in the future? B: Yes, I do — I saw a robot on TV yesterday, and it cooked dinner by itself. A: Cool, will robots think like humans one day? B: Maybe — some scientists say robots will even talk like humans in 25 to 50 years. A: I disagree, because robots will never really think like us. B: You may be right, and I just hope people will have more free time in the future. A: Me too, but if we don't protect the earth, there will be more pollution. 译文: ——你觉得将来人们的家里会有机器人吗?——会的, 我昨天在电视上看到一个机器人, 它自己做了晚饭。——真酷, 有一天机器人会像人一样思考吗?——也许吧, 有科学家说, 25到50年后机器人甚至能像人一样交谈。——我不同意, 因为机器人永远不会真正像我们一样思考。——也许你说得对, 我只希望将来人们能有更多空闲时间。——我也是, 不过如果我们不保护地球, 污染会更多。","extension":"中考链接: more、fewer、less 的选择是历年单选必争之地——先判断名词可数与否, 再选限定词; 写作「Life in the Future」时, 用 there will be 与 more/fewer/less 搭配造句, 内容与句型档次同步提升。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","写作话题"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-23-8","title":"Unit 8 How do you make a banana milk shake?——制作流程","content":"本单元话题是「描述制作过程」, 核心功能是按顺序说明操作步骤。核心句型: How do you make a banana milk shake? First, peel the bananas. Next, put the bananas in the blender. Then, pour the milk into the blender. Finally, turn on the blender. 语法焦点是顺序词 First、Next、Then、Finally 的运用, how many 与 how much 对数量的提问, 以及可数与不可数名词的区分和计量表达。中考定位: 顺序词是完形与短文填空的常设选项, how many、how much 的选择取决于名词是否可数, 「介绍美食做法」是书面表达的应用文命题方向。","keyPoints":["核心句型: How do you make a banana milk shake? First, peel the bananas. Next, put the bananas in the blender.","核心句型: How many bananas do we need? We need three. / How much yogurt do we need? One cup.","重点短语: turn on, pour...into..., cut up, mix up, add...to..., one spoon of honey","顺序词: First, Next, Then, Finally——流程说明文的路标词","语法点: how many+可数名词复数, how much+不可数名词; 不可数名词计量用「数词+量词+of」","交际用语: Do you know how to make a banana milk shake? Yes, let me tell you."],"example":"课文选段: A: I'm hungry — let's make a banana milk shake! B: Good idea, but how do we make it? A: First, peel three bananas and cut them up. B: OK, what's next? A: Next, put the bananas and two spoons of honey in the blender, then pour a cup of milk into it. B: Is that all? A: Not yet — finally, turn on the blender and wait for one minute. B: Wow, it looks delicious, and thanks for teaching me! 译文: ——我饿了, 我们做香蕉奶昔吧!——好主意, 可是怎么做呢?——首先, 剥三根香蕉并切碎。——好的, 然后呢?——接着, 把香蕉和两勺蜂蜜放进搅拌机, 再往里面倒一杯牛奶。——就这些吗?——还没有, 最后打开搅拌机, 等一分钟。——哇, 看起来真好喝, 谢谢你教我!","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","应用文写作"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"}]},{"uid":"english-24","name":"教材课文·八年级下册","grade":"八年级下册","order":23,"kps":[{"uid":"english-24-1","title":"Unit 1 What's the matter?——健康与身体","content":"本单元话题是「身体健康与提出建议」, 核心功能是询问身体状况并给出建议。核心句型: What's the matter? I have a stomachache. You should drink some hot tea with honey. Do you have a fever? Yes, I do. / I don't feel well. 语法焦点是身体部位与疾病表达 headache、toothache、sore throat, should/shouldn't+动词原形表建议, 以及 lie down and rest 等短语。中考定位: What's the matter? 与 should 建议句是补全对话的必背句型, 「看病就医」情境几乎每年出现在听力或交际题中, 健康生活也是书面表达的热门话题。","keyPoints":["核心句型: What's the matter? I have a stomachache. / I have a sore throat.","核心句型: You should drink some hot tea with honey. / You shouldn't eat so much next time.","重点短语: lie down and rest, take one's temperature, have a fever, take breaks, get an X-ray","交际用语: Do you have a fever? Yes, I do. / Are you OK? No, I don't feel well.","语法点: should/shouldn't+动词原形提建议; 疾病表达用 have a+病症名词","话题拓展: should 还可用于表达观点: Students should exercise more to keep healthy."],"example":"课文选段: A: You look terrible — what's the matter? B: I don't feel well, because I have a sore throat and a headache. A: Do you have a fever? B: Yes, I do — it's over 38 degrees. A: Oh, you should drink some hot tea with honey and lie down to rest. B: That sounds like a good idea. A: If your throat still hurts tomorrow, you should see a doctor and get an X-ray. B: OK, thank you for your advice. 译文: ——你脸色不太好, 怎么了?——我不舒服, 因为嗓子疼, 还头疼。——你发烧了吗?——发了, 超过38度了。——哦, 你应该喝点加蜂蜜的热茶, 躺下休息。——听起来是个好主意。——如果明天嗓子还疼, 你就该去看医生, 拍个片子。——好的, 谢谢你的建议。","extension":"中考链接: 补全对话中「看病」场景的应答链条要背熟: What's the matter?→I have a...→You should...→Thank you. 单选中 should 表建议还常与 You'd better... 同义转换, 二者都接动词原形。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","交际口语"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-24-2","title":"Unit 2 I'll help to clean up the city parks——志愿服务","content":"本单元话题是「志愿服务与主动提供帮助」, 核心语法是动词不定式做宾语、宾语补足语和目的状语。核心句型: You could help to clean up the city parks. Let's make some notices. I'm making some plans to work in an old people's home this summer. 语法焦点是 would like to do、volunteer to do、help sb. (to) do、ask/tell/want sb. to do, 不定式作目的状语, 以及 cheer up、give out、put off、come up with 等短语动词。中考定位: 不定式做宾补是单选必考点, 短语动词接代词宾语的位置(cheer them up)是易错点, 志愿服务是近年阅读与写作的热点主题。","keyPoints":["核心句型: You could help to clean up the city parks. / I'm making some plans to work in an old people's home.","核心句型: A lot of old people are lonely. We should listen to them and care for them.","重点短语: cheer up, give out, put off, call up, come up with, raise money","语法点: help sb. (to) do; ask/tell/want sb. to do; let/make sb. do(不带to)","语法点: 不定式可作目的状语: She volunteers there to learn more about art.","易错点: 短语动词接代词宾语时放在中间: cheer them up, put it off"],"example":"课文选段: A: Hi, Tom — I'm making some plans to work in an old people's home this summer. B: Really — I did that last summer! A: Oh, what did they ask you to help out with? B: Things like reading the newspaper to the old people, or just talking to them. A: That sounds interesting. B: Yeah, a lot of old people are lonely — we should listen to them and care for them. A: You're right, and we're all going to be old one day, too. B: That's true — could I join you this summer? 译文: ——嗨, 汤姆, 我正在制定今年夏天去养老院帮忙的计划。——真的吗, 我去年夏天就做过!——哦, 他们请你帮些什么忙?——比如给老人们读报纸, 或者就陪他们聊聊天。——听起来很有意思。——是啊, 很多老人都很孤独, 我们应该倾听他们、关心他们。——你说得对, 我们总有一天也会变老的。——确实, 今年夏天我能加入你们吗?","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","写作话题"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-24-3","title":"Unit 3 Could you please clean your room?——家务与礼貌请求","content":"本单元话题是「家务劳动与礼貌请求」, 核心语法是情态动词 could 的委婉用法。核心句型: Could you please clean your room? Yes, sure. / Sorry, I can't. I have to do my homework. Could I go out for dinner with my friends? 语法焦点是 Could you please+动词原形表请求、Could I...? 表征求许可、have to 与 must 的区别, 以及 as...as...、all the time 等结构的复现。中考定位: Could you please...? 的请求与应答是补全对话的必背句型, could 表请求与表能力的语境区分是单选考点, 「该不该做家务」是观点表达类作文的高频话题。","keyPoints":["核心句型: Could you please clean your room? Yes, sure. / Sorry, I can't. I have to do my homework.","核心句型: Could I go out for dinner with my friends? No, you can't. You have a basketball game tomorrow.","重点短语: take out the rubbish, do the dishes, sweep the floor, all the time, in surprise","交际用语: Could I at least finish watching this show? / No problem.","语法点: Could you please+动词原形表委婉请求; Could I...? 表征求许可","辨析: have to 强调客观要求, must 强调主观看法; as...as... 同级比较在本单元复现"],"example":"课文选段: A: Could you please take out the rubbish, Peter? B: Sure, Mom — could I finish watching this show first? A: No, you can't, because your grandma is coming over at six. B: OK, could I go to the movies with my friends after dinner? A: Sorry, you can't — you have to practice the violin tonight. B: Then could I at least invite my friends here this weekend? A: Sure, but you'll have to clean your room first — it's a mess! B: No problem, Mom — I'll do it right away. 译文: ——彼得, 你能把垃圾拿出去吗?——好的, 妈妈, 我能先看完这个节目吗?——不行, 你奶奶六点钟要过来。——好吧, 晚饭后我能和朋友去看电影吗?——抱歉, 不行, 你今晚得练小提琴。——那我至少可以这个周末请朋友来家里吧?——当然可以, 不过你得先把房间打扫干净, 乱得一团糟!——没问题, 妈妈, 我马上就打扫。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","交际口语"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-24-4","title":"Unit 4 Why don't you talk to your parents?——烦恼与建议","content":"本单元话题是「倾诉成长的烦恼并提出建议」, 核心功能是综合运用各种提建议的句型。核心句型: What's wrong? I have too many after-school classes. Why don't you talk to your parents? Maybe you could do more jobs around the house. 语法焦点是建议句型集锦 Why don't you...?、Why not...?、You should...、You could...、What about...?, not...until 的用法, 以及 too many、too much、much too 的区分。中考定位: 建议句型是补全对话与单选的常考点, 「成长的烦恼与亲子沟通」是书面表达热门话题, not...until 与 so...that 常在语法填空中设空。","keyPoints":["核心句型: What's wrong? I have too many after-school classes. / I got into a fight with my best friend.","核心句型: Why don't you talk to your parents? / Maybe you could do more jobs around the house.","建议句型: Why don't you+动词原形?=Why not+动词原形? / What about+doing?","重点短语: too many+可数复数, too much+不可数, much too+形容词; work out, get on with, cut out","语法点: not...until 直到……才; so...that... 如此……以至于","交际用语: Hope things work out. / I guess you're right. Thanks for your advice."],"example":"课文选段: A: You look sad, Kim — what's wrong? B: Well, I found my sister looking through my things yesterday, and she took some of my new magazines and CDs. A: Hmm, that's not very nice — did she give them back to you? B: Yes, but I'm still angry with her — what should I do? A: Well, I guess you could tell her to say sorry, but why don't you forget about it so that you can be friends again? B: Maybe you're right — thanks for your advice. A: No problem — hope things work out! 译文: ——金, 你看起来不太高兴, 怎么了?——唉, 昨天我发现妹妹在翻我的东西, 她还拿了我几本新杂志和几张光盘。——嗯, 这可不太好, 她还给你了吗?——还了, 但我还在生她的气, 我该怎么办?——嗯, 我想你可以让她道歉, 不过为了你们能重新做朋友, 何不把这件事忘掉呢?——也许你是对的, 谢谢你的建议。——不客气, 希望事情顺利解决!","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-24-5","title":"Unit 5 What were you doing when the rainstorm came?——过去进行时","content":"本单元话题是「讲述过去某一时刻正在发生的事」, 核心语法是过去进行时。核心句型: What were you doing when the rainstorm came? I was doing my homework. While I was sleeping, my mother was cooking dinner. 语法焦点是 was/were+动词-ing 的构成, when 与 while 引导时间状语从句的区别(when 后可接短暂性动词, while 后接延续性动词), 以及报道事件 when the school basketball competition started 的表达。中考定位: 过去进行时是时态考查重点, when 与 while 的选用是单选必考点, 「长动作+短动作」的搭配是命题人最爱设置的陷阱。","keyPoints":["核心句型: What were you doing when the rainstorm came? I was doing my homework.","核心句型: While I was sleeping, my mother was cooking dinner. / While Linda was sleeping, Jenny was helping Mary with her homework.","重点短语: at the time of, go off, pick up, fall asleep, die down, in a mess","语法点: 过去进行时=was/were+动词-ing, 表示过去某一时刻正在进行的动作","辨析: when 后可接短暂性动词; while 后接延续性动词, 从句常用进行时","中考链接: was/were doing...when...did...「正在做……这时……」是完形与单选高频句式"],"example":"课文选段: A: What were you doing when the rainstorm came? B: I was walking home from the supermarket, and suddenly the wind picked up and it started to rain heavily. A: Were you carrying an umbrella? B: No, I wasn't — I was completely wet when I got home. A: Poor you, what was your family doing then? B: While I was walking in the rain, my mother was cooking dinner and my father was watching TV. A: What about your sister? B: She was doing her homework, and while we were having dinner, the rain finally began to die down. 译文: ——暴风雨来的时候你在做什么?——我正从超市往家走, 突然风大了起来, 雨下得很急。——你带伞了吗?——没带, 到家时我浑身都湿透了。——真可怜, 那时你家人在做什么?——我在雨中赶路的时候, 我妈妈在做晚饭, 我爸爸在看电视。——你妹妹呢?——她在写作业, 我们吃晚饭的时候, 雨终于渐渐变小了。","extension":"中考链接: 看到 at that time、at eight o'clock last night、when+一般过去时从句等标志词, 立即锁定过去进行时; when 强调「这时突然」, while 强调「与此同时」, 互换时必须检查动词是否延续。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","语法焦点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-24-6","title":"Unit 6 An old man tried to move the mountains——故事与传说","content":"本单元话题是「讲述故事与传说」, 核心功能是按情节叙述故事。核心句型: How does the story begin? Once upon a time, there was a very old man... Yu Gong tried to move the mountains because they were so big that it took a long time to walk to the other side. 语法焦点是 unless、as soon as、so...that... 引导的状语从句, 故事开头套语 once upon a time, 以及《愚公移山》和戏剧课文《糖果屋》(Hansel and Gretel) 的阅读。中考定位: 状语从句连词的辨析是单选必考点, so...that 与 such...that 的区分是易错点, 用英语讲故事是读写结合的新趋势。","keyPoints":["核心句型: How does the story begin? Once upon a time, there was a very old man...","核心句型: Yu Gong tried to move the mountains because they were so big that it took a long time to walk to the other side.","重点短语: once upon a time, fall in love with, get married, instead of, turn...into..., come out","语法点: unless=if...not 除非; as soon as 一……就……; so...that... 如此……以至于","辨析: so+形容词/副词+that..., such+名词短语+that...","文体知识: 课文 Hansel and Gretel 是戏剧(script)文本, 台词与舞台说明是戏剧的基本要素"],"example":"课文选段: A: What are you reading, Lucy? B: A famous story called Yu Gong Moves a Mountain. A: How does the story begin? B: Well, once upon a time, there was a very old man, and there were two mountains near his house — they were so big and high that it took a long time to walk to the other side. A: So what happened next? B: The old man told his family that they should all help him to move the mountains, and they could put all the earth and stone into the sea. A: Did they start right away? B: Yes, as soon as Yu Gong finished talking, they started digging. A: What a wonderful story — it reminds me that nothing is impossible as long as we work hard! 译文: ——露西, 你在读什么?——一个很有名的故事, 《愚公移山》。——故事是怎么开头的?——嗯, 很久很久以前, 有一位很老很老的老人, 他家附近有两座大山, 山又高又大, 走到另一边要花很长时间。——接下来发生了什么?——老人告诉家人, 他们都应该帮他搬山, 还可以把挖出的土和石头放进海里。——他们马上开始挖了吗?——是的, 愚公一说完, 大家就动手挖了起来。——多精彩的故事啊, 它让我想到, 只要努力, 没有什么是不可能的!","extension":"文化拓展: 用英语讲中国故事是新课标的热点, the Monkey King(美猴王)、Hou Yi Shoots the Suns(后羿射日)、Nu Wa Repairs the Sky(女娲补天) 都可以套用 once upon a time 开头, 再辅以 as soon as、unless、so...that 等连词, 故事立刻有「讲」的味道。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","阅读话题"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-24-7","title":"Unit 7 What's the highest mountain in the world?——世界之最与数字","content":"本单元话题是「世界之最与地理数据」, 核心语法是大数字与比较级、最高级的综合运用。核心句型: What's the highest mountain in the world? Qomolangma. It's 8,844.43 meters high. The Amazon River is one of the longest rivers in the world. 语法焦点是大数字 thousand、million、billion 的读写, 「数字+单位+形容词」的表达(8,844.43 meters high), one of the+最高级+复数名词, 以及保护大熊猫等濒危动物的话题。中考定位: 数字表达是听力必考技能, one of the+最高级是单选高频结构, 「保护濒危动物」是书面表达命题热点。","keyPoints":["核心句型: What's the highest mountain in the world? Qomolangma. It's 8,844.43 meters high.","核心句型: The Amazon River is one of the longest rivers in the world. / China has the biggest population in the world.","重点短语: as you can see, in the face of, even though, at birth, up to, take in","语法点: 数字+单位+形容词: 8,844.43 meters high / about 9 million square kilometers in size","语法点: one of the+最高级+复数名词, 作主语时谓语用单数: One of the oldest countries is China.","话题拓展: 保护动物——There are only about 2,000 pandas living in the forests."],"example":"课文选段: A: What's the highest mountain in the world? B: Qomolangma — it's 8,844.43 meters high. A: Wow, which is the longest river in the world? B: The Nile — it's about 6,671 kilometers long, but the Amazon River has the most water. A: Is China one of the oldest countries in the world? B: Yes, it is — it has a much longer history than the US. A: Why do so many people want to climb Qomolangma even though it is dangerous? B: Because they want to challenge themselves in the face of difficulties. A: I see — we should never give up trying to achieve our dreams, just like these climbers. 译文: ——世界上最高的山是哪座?——珠穆朗玛峰, 高8844.43米。——哇, 那世界上最长的河呢?——尼罗河, 大约长6671公里, 不过亚马孙河的水量最大。——中国是世界上最古老的国家之一吗?——是的, 它的历史比美国长得多。——攀登珠穆朗玛峰那么危险, 为什么还有那么多人想去?——因为他们想直面困难、挑战自我。——我明白了, 就像这些登山者一样, 我们应该永不放弃地努力实现梦想。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-24-8","title":"Unit 8 Have you read Treasure Island yet?——现在完成时入门","content":"本单元话题是「谈论书籍与音乐」, 核心语法是现在完成时的入门。核心句型: Have you read Little Women yet? Yes, I have. / No, not yet. I've already finished reading it. It's about four sisters growing up. 语法焦点是 have/has+过去分词的构成, already 与 yet 的位置和区别, ever 与 never 表经历, 以及 What's it about? 等谈论作品的交际用语。中考定位: 现在完成时是初中阶段最难的时态, already 与 yet 的辨析是单选经典考点, 「读书的乐趣」是书面表达高频话题, 本单元是九年级系统学习该时态的地基。","keyPoints":["核心句型: Have you read Little Women yet? Yes, I have. / No, not yet.","核心句型: I've already finished reading it. It's about four sisters growing up.","重点短语: hurry up, full of, at least, can't wait to do, be interested in, put...down","交际用语: What's it about? / What do you think of it? / I couldn't put it down.","语法点: 现在完成时=have/has+过去分词; already 用于肯定句, yet 用于疑问句和否定句","语法点: ever/never 表经历: Have you ever read Robinson Crusoe? I've never read it."],"example":"课文选段: A: Have you read Little Women yet, Amy? B: No, not yet — what's it about? A: It's about four sisters growing up, and I've already finished reading it — I really enjoyed it. B: Sounds good — I read Oliver Twist last month, and I couldn't put it down. A: Then have you read Treasure Island yet? B: Not yet, is it interesting? A: Yes, it's full of exciting stories about the sea. B: I can't wait to read it, and I'll borrow it from the library this afternoon. A: Great — reading opens a window to the world for us! 译文: ——艾米, 你读过《小妇人》了吗?——还没呢, 它讲的是什么?——讲四姐妹成长的故事, 我已经读完了, 非常喜欢。——听起来不错, 我上个月读了《雾都孤儿》, 简直爱不释手。——那你读过《金银岛》吗?——还没有, 好看吗?——好看, 书里全是惊险的海上故事。——我都等不及要读了, 今天下午就去图书馆借。——太好了, 阅读为我们打开了一扇通向世界的窗!","extension":"中考链接: already 与 yet 是现在完成时的信号灯——肯定句用 already(位于句中), 疑问句与否定句用 yet(位于句末); Have you...yet? 的应答 Yes, I have. / No, not yet. 在补全对话中也常常出现。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","语法焦点","中考高频"],"difficulty":3,"type":"core"}]},{"uid":"english-25","name":"教材课文·九年级上册","grade":"九年级上册","order":24,"kps":[{"uid":"english-25-1","title":"Unit 1 How can we become good learners?——学习方法","content":"本单元围绕「如何成为优秀学习者」展开, 核心句型是 How do you study for a test? I study by working with a group. 语法焦点为 by + doing 结构表方式, 用于回答 How 引导的特殊疑问句。功能上学会询问并描述学习策略: by making word cards, by reading the textbook, by asking the teacher for help。词汇聚焦学习策略类词(aloud, pronunciation, patient, expression 等), 听说读写全面训练。中考考点: by doing 结构在单选与首字母填空中高频出现, too...to... 结构与 spoken English 是完形与听力的常考素材。阅读语篇 How Can You Become a Successful Learner? 强调兴趣与习惯的养成, 常考短语还有 connect...with..., pay attention to, even if。词形变化: pronounce(动)→pronunciation(名), patient(形)→patience(名)是词形填空常客。","keyPoints":["核心句型: How do you study for a test? I study by working with a group.","by + doing 表方式: I learn English by watching English movies.","too...to...(太…而不能…): It's too hard to understand spoken English.","重点短语: ask the teacher for help, fall in love with, look up...in a dictionary, take notes","学习策略词汇: aloud, pronunciation, patient, expression, discover, repeat","语法提示: 对方式状语提问用 How, 答语用 by + doing"],"example":"课文选段: A: How do you study for a test, Meiping? B: I study by making word cards. A: Do you learn English by reading aloud? B: Yes, I do. It helps my pronunciation. A: What about listening to tapes? B: Sometimes, but it's too hard to understand spoken English. A: You can try to listen for the key words. B: That sounds like a good idea. Thanks! 译文: 甲: 梅平, 你是怎么备考的? 乙: 我通过制作单词卡片来学习。甲: 你通过大声朗读学英语吗? 乙: 是的, 这对我的发音有帮助。甲: 那听磁带呢? 乙: 有时听, 但英语口语太难听懂了。甲: 你可以试着抓关键词去听。乙: 这听起来是个好主意, 谢谢!","extension":"易错辨析: by doing 表方式手段, with 表工具——I cut the apple with a knife(用刀, 工具); I improved my English by practicing every day(通过每天练习, 方式)。中考单选常把两者放在一起对比考查。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-25-2","title":"Unit 2 I think that mooncakes are delicious!——节日与文化","content":"本单元以中外节日为话题, 学会用宾语从句表达看法。核心句型: What do you like about the Mid-Autumn Festival? I think that mooncakes are delicious! 语法焦点是 that 引导的宾语从句(一), 陈述句作宾语, that 无实义可省略。话题涵盖 Spring Festival, Mid-Autumn Festival, Water Festival, Christmas 等节日的名称、时间、习俗与感受, 并初步接触感叹句: What fun the Water Festival is! 中考考点: 宾语从句的陈述语序是单选必考, 节日文化是阅读理解与书面表达的热门素材。书面表达可按「时间—活动—感受」三步介绍一个节日, 恰当运用宾语从句与感叹句是主要加分点。","keyPoints":["核心句型: What do you like about the Mid-Autumn Festival? I think that mooncakes are delicious!","宾语从句(一): that 引导陈述句作宾语, that 可省略——I think (that) the races are fun to watch.","感叹句: What fun the Water Festival is! / How pretty the dragon boats were!","节日词汇: the Spring Festival, the Mid-Autumn Festival, the Dragon Boat Festival, Christmas","重点短语: put on (weight), lay out, admire the moon, share...with..., as a result","文化提示: 谈节日抓三要素——名称+活动+感受"],"example":"课文选段: A: What do you like about the Mid-Autumn Festival? B: I think that mooncakes are delicious! A: Do you know the story of Chang'e? B: Yes. People say that a goddess flew to the moon long ago. A: So Chinese people admire the moon and eat mooncakes on that day. B: That's right. Families get together and share the mooncakes. A: How happy they are! I love the festival, too. 译文: 甲: 你喜欢中秋节的什么? 乙: 我觉得月饼很好吃! 甲: 你知道嫦娥的故事吗? 乙: 知道, 人们说很久以前有位仙女飞到了月亮上。甲: 所以中国人在那一天赏月吃月饼。乙: 没错, 家人团聚, 分享月饼。甲: 他们多幸福啊! 我也喜欢这个节日。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","阅读话题","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-25-3","title":"Unit 3 Could you please tell me where the restrooms are?——礼貌问路","content":"本单元话题为礼貌地询问信息与指路, 核心句型: Excuse me, could you please tell me where the restrooms are? Sure. There's a restroom on the second floor. 语法焦点是宾语从句(二), 由连接代词与连接副词引导, 特别注意从句用陈述语序。功能上区分 direct questions 与 polite requests, 学会依据场合选择得体语气: Could you please...? / Do you know where...? / I wonder if...。话题词汇涉及校园与街区场所(restroom, bookstore, post office, bank 等)与方位表达。中考考点: 宾语从句连接词与语序是单选必考, 礼貌问路是情景交际高频对话。语篇 Fun Times Park 围绕游园问路展开, 写作可直接套用 Could you please...? 与 Do you know...? 句式。补充: Pardon me? 与 Excuse me 同义, 均用于礼貌地引起对方注意。","keyPoints":["核心句型: Excuse me, could you please tell me where the restrooms are? (疑问词+陈述语序)","宾语从句(二): Do you know where I can buy some stamps? / I wonder if there's a bank near here.","礼貌用语: Could you please...? 比 Tell me... 更礼貌, 请求帮助首选","指路表达: Go along Main Street, turn left/right, go past the bookstore, on the second floor","重点短语: a pair of, between...and..., on one's way to, pass by","易错提示: 从句必须用陈述语序, 不能说 could you tell me where are the restrooms"],"example":"课文选段: A: Excuse me, could you please tell me where the restrooms are? B: Sure. There's a restroom on the second floor. A: And do you know where I can get a dictionary? B: Yes, there's a bookstore on Main Street. A: Could you tell me how to get there? B: Go along this street and turn left. The bookstore is next to the bank. A: Thanks a lot. B: You're welcome. 译文: 甲: 打扰一下, 请问洗手间在哪儿? 乙: 当然, 二楼有一个洗手间。甲: 你知道我在哪儿能买到词典吗? 乙: 知道, 主街上有一家书店。甲: 能告诉我怎么去那儿吗? 乙: 沿着这条街走, 然后左转, 书店就在银行旁边。甲: 多谢。乙: 不客气。","extension":"中考链接: 宾语从句三步解题——①看从句缺什么成分选连接词(that/if/特殊疑问词); ②把从句改回陈述语序; ③依据主句时态定从句时态。语序错误是本单元最高频的失分点。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-25-4","title":"Unit 4 I used to be afraid of the dark——变化与成长","content":"本单元围绕「人的变化」展开, 谈论过去与现在的对比。核心句型: I used to be short. / She didn't use to have short hair. 语法焦点是 used to 结构, 表示过去经常做某事或过去的状态, 而现在已不再如此。功能句型: What did you use to be like? I used to be really quiet. 话题涉及外貌、性格、爱好的变化与青少年成长中的烦恼。中考考点: used to do 的否定式(didn't use to)与疑问式(Did you use to...?)、used to do 与 be used to doing 的辨析是单选高频易错点。阅读语篇 He Studies Harder Than He Used to 讲述乡村孩子的求学变化, 提示写作要用具体事例支撑「变化」, 忌空泛描述。","keyPoints":["核心句型: I used to be short. / She didn't use to have short hair.","used to do 表过去常常: I used to be afraid of the dark.","疑问句: Did you use to play the piano? — Yes, I did. / No, I didn't.","对比表达: What did you use to be like? Now I'm much more outgoing than before.","重点短语: be afraid of, be interested in, from time to time, deal with, in public","易错辨析: used to do 过去常常做; be used to doing 习惯于做, 形式相近含义不同"],"example":"课文选段: A: You've changed a lot, Emily! B: That's true. I used to be really quiet, but now I'm outgoing. A: Did you use to have long hair? B: Yes, I did, but I cut it short last year. A: What did you use to do after school? B: I used to watch TV at home. Now I like playing tennis. A: Great changes! B: Yes, people sure change. 译文: 甲: 埃米莉, 你的变化真大! 乙: 确实, 我过去很文静, 但现在很外向。甲: 你过去留长发吗? 乙: 是的, 但去年剪短了。甲: 你放学后过去常做什么? 乙: 我过去常在家看电视, 现在我喜欢打网球。甲: 变化真大! 乙: 是啊, 人是会变的。","extension":"写作链接: 「今昔对比」是中考书面表达高频题——先用 used to 描述过去的外貌、性格与爱好, 再用 now/but now 转折写现在, 最后用 People sure change 收尾, 结构清晰易得分。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","易错点","书面表达"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-25-5","title":"Unit 5 What are the shirts made of?——材料与产地","content":"本单元话题为产品的材料与产地, 核心句型: What are the shirts made of? They're made of cotton. And they were made in the US. 语法焦点是一般现在时与一般过去时的被动语态(be + 过去分词), 强调主语是动作的承受者。词汇涉及材料(cotton, silk, steel, glass, paper)与产地表达。功能上学会介绍中国传统文化, 如 kites, paper cutting, sky lanterns, 并用 be famous for / be known for 说明地方特色。中考考点: 被动语态的构成与时态、be made of/in/from 的辨析是单选与完形高频。书面表达常考「介绍中国传统工艺」, 模板: 原料(be made of)+产地(be made in)+用途(be used for)+意义, 一文打通被动语态。","keyPoints":["核心句型: What are the shirts made of? They're made of cotton. They were made in the US.","被动语态: be + 过去分词; 一般现在时 is/are made, 一般过去时 was/were made","辨析: be made of 看得出原料; be made from 看不出原料; be made in+产地; be made by+执行者","重点短语: be famous for, be known for, as far as I know, by hand, all over the world","文化话题: Chinese paper cutting, sky lanterns, clay art, kites——传统工艺的英文介绍","句型: It seems that many people all over the world drink Chinese tea."],"example":"课文选段: A: Look at these kites! What are they made of? B: They're made of silk and bamboo. A: Where were they made? B: They were made in Weifang, a city famous for kites. A: Wow! Are the paper cuttings made by hand? B: Yes, they are. They are put on windows as good luck during the Spring Festival. A: Chinese culture is really amazing. 译文: 甲: 看这些风筝! 它们是用什么做的? 乙: 用丝绸和竹子做的。甲: 它们产自哪里? 乙: 潍坊, 一座以风筝闻名的城市。甲: 哇! 这些剪纸是手工做的吗? 乙: 是的, 春节期间人们把它们贴在窗户上以求好运。甲: 中国文化真了不起。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","阅读话题"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-25-6","title":"Unit 6 When was it invented?——发明与历史","content":"本单元以发明创造与科技史为话题, 核心句型: When was the car invented? It was invented in 1885. Who was it invented by? It was invented by Karl Benz. What is it used for? It's used for serving really cold ice cream. 语法焦点是被动语态的综合运用, 重点是一般过去时被动语态的特殊疑问句。词汇涉及发明物(zipper, telephone, computer)与发明家。阅读语篇讲述茶、薯片、篮球等事物的趣味发明史。中考考点: 被动语态特殊疑问句与 be used for doing 是单选高频, 发明史是阅读理解常见说明文。书面表达常考「介绍一项发明」, 要点: 发明时间+发明者+用途+影响, 时态以一般过去时被动语态为主。","keyPoints":["核心句型: When was the car invented? It was invented in 1885.","Who was it invented by? It was invented by Karl Benz.","What is it used for? It's used for serving really cold ice cream. (be used for doing)","被动语态特殊疑问句: 疑问词 + was/were + 主语 + 过去分词 (+ by ...)?","重点短语: by accident, take place, without doubt, divide...into..., look up to","文化链接: 茶由神农 by accident 发现, 篮球由 James Naismith 发明——阅读说明文常考"],"example":"课文选段: A: When was the telephone invented? B: I think it was invented in 1876. A: Who was it invented by? B: It was invented by Alexander Bell. A: What is it used for? B: It's used for talking with people far away. A: How about the computer? B: It was invented later, and now it's used for doing almost everything. A: Inventions really changed our lives. 译文: 甲: 电话是什么时候发明的? 乙: 我想是1876年发明的。甲: 它是谁发明的? 乙: 是亚历山大·贝尔发明的。甲: 它用来做什么? 乙: 用来和远方的人交谈。甲: 那电脑呢? 乙: 电脑发明得晚一些, 现在几乎什么都能用来做。甲: 发明真的改变了我们的生活。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","阅读话题"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-25-7","title":"Unit 7 Teenagers should be allowed to choose their own clothes——规则与观点","content":"本单元围绕家庭与学校规则展开, 讨论青少年应被允许做什么。核心句型: Teenagers should be allowed to choose their own clothes. Students should not be allowed to have part-time jobs. 语法焦点是含情态动词的被动语态: 情态动词 + be + 过去分词。功能上学会表达同意与不同意, 陈述观点并给出理由: I agree. / I disagree. / I don't think so. 话题贴近学生生活, 涉及校规、发型、兼职、考勤等。中考考点: should be allowed to do 结构与 agree/disagree 的情景交际是高频考点, 规则话题也是书面表达常客。阅读语篇 Should I Be Allowed to Make My Own Decisions? 讨论青少年追梦与学业的平衡, 是观点表达类写作的范本。","keyPoints":["核心句型: Teenagers should be allowed to choose their own clothes.","否定式: Students should not be allowed to have part-time jobs.","含情态动词的被动语态: 情态动词 + be + 过去分词, 如 should be done / must be done","表达观点: I agree. / I disagree. / Do you ever get to class late? / I think students should...","重点短语: be worried about, talk back, keep...away from, make one's own decision","写作提示: 谈规则类作文先亮观点, 再给两三条理由, 最后总结"],"example":"课文选段: A: Do you think teenagers should be allowed to choose their own clothes? B: Yes, I do. They're old enough to decide by themselves. A: What about part-time jobs? B: I disagree. Students should not be allowed to have part-time jobs. A: Why do you think so? B: Because they may get too tired to study. A: But working can help them learn more about the world. B: Maybe you're right. 译文: 甲: 你认为应该允许青少年自己挑选衣服吗? 乙: 我认为应该, 他们足够大了, 可以自己做决定。甲: 那兼职工作呢? 乙: 我不同意, 不应该允许学生做兼职。甲: 你为什么这么想? 乙: 因为他们可能会累得没精力学习。甲: 但打工能帮助他们更多地了解世界。乙: 也许你说得对。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","书面表达"],"difficulty":3,"type":"core"}]},{"uid":"english-26","name":"教材课文·九年级下册","grade":"九年级下册","order":25,"kps":[{"uid":"english-26-1","title":"Unit 8 It must belong to Carla——推测与归属","content":"本单元话题为对事物归属的推测, 核心句型: Whose volleyball is this? It must belong to Carla. She loves volleyball. / It could be Mei's hair band. 语法焦点是情态动词表推测: must 表示肯定推测(把握极大), might/could 表示有可能, can't 表示不可能。功能上学会依据事实线索作出判断并说明理由, 话题围绕校园里的神秘事件展开, 如奇怪的噪声、丢失的物品。中考考点: 表推测的情态动词辨析是单选高频, must 与 can't 的对比常出现在完形与情景交际中。阅读语篇 Stonehenge 以「证据+推测」行文, 写作可借 I think/believe that... 引出判断, 用 because 交代依据。","keyPoints":["核心句型: Whose volleyball is this? It must belong to Carla. She loves volleyball.","推测梯度: must 一定 > might/could 或许 > can't 不可能","It could be Mei's hair band. / It can't be John's. It's too small for him.","belong to sb. 相当于 be sb.'s: belong to 后接宾格代词或名词原形","重点短语: run after, at the same time, not only...but also..., have fun","答题技巧: 先找证据句再选推测词——证据确凿用 must, 证据不足用 might/could"],"example":"课文选段: A: Whose schoolbag is this? B: It must belong to Rita. She's the only one with a pink schoolbag. A: What about this hair band? B: It could be Mei's, because she has long hair. A: It can't be Mei's. She cut her hair short last week. B: Then it might be Linda's, and she also has long hair. A: Let's go and ask her after class. 译文: 甲: 这是谁的书包? 乙: 一定是丽塔的, 只有她背粉色书包。甲: 那这个发带呢? 乙: 可能是梅的, 因为她留长发。甲: 不可能是梅的, 她上周把头发剪短了。乙: 那可能是琳达的, 她也留长发。甲: 我们课后去问问她吧。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-26-2","title":"Unit 9 I like music that I can dance to——偏好与定语从句","content":"本单元以音乐与电影偏好为话题, 核心句型: What kind of music do you like? I love music that I can sing along with. I like movies that are scary. 语法焦点是 that/which/who 引导的定语从句: 先行词指物用 that/which, 指人用 who/that, 关系词在从句中作主语或宾语。功能上学会表达个人喜好并说明理由, 词汇涉及音乐类型(pop, jazz, classical)与电影种类(action movie, comedy, documentary)。中考考点: 定语从句关系词的选择、关系代词作主语时从句谓语与先行词保持一致是高频考点。阅读语篇 Sad but Beautiful 讲述阿炳与《二泉映月》, 把音乐话题与中国文化结合, 是阅读理解的高频语篇。","keyPoints":["核心句型: What kind of music do you like? I love music that I can sing along with.","定语从句: 先行词指物用 that/which, 指人用 who——I like musicians who write their own songs.","关系代词作主语时, 从句动词与先行词一致: movies that are scary","重点短语: sing along with, dance to, in that case, stick to, plenty of, shut off","偏好表达: prefer...to..., I like...that..., My favorite...is...","易错点: 关系代词在从句中作宾语时可省略, 作主语时不能省"],"example":"课文选段: A: What kind of music do you like? B: I love music that I can sing along with. What about you? A: I prefer music that has great lyrics. B: Do you like movies, too? A: Yes. I like movies that are funny because they cheer me up. B: I'd rather watch movies that are scary because they're exciting. A: In that case, let's watch a comedy tonight. B: OK! 译文: 甲: 你喜欢哪种音乐? 乙: 我喜欢能跟着唱的音乐, 你呢? 甲: 我更喜欢歌词优美的音乐。乙: 你也喜欢电影吗? 甲: 是的, 我喜欢搞笑的电影, 因为它们能让我开心起来。乙: 我宁愿看恐怖片, 因为很刺激。甲: 那样的话, 我们今晚看一部喜剧吧。乙: 好!","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","中考高频"],"difficulty":3,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-26-3","title":"Unit 10 You're supposed to shake hands——习俗礼仪","content":"本单元话题为各国见面礼仪与餐桌文化, 核心句型: What are people in Korea supposed to do when they meet for the first time? They're supposed to bow. 语法焦点是 be supposed to do 结构, 表示「应该做、被期望做」, 多指约定俗成的规矩。功能上学会比较不同国家的习俗差异, 涉及问候方式(shake hands, kiss, bow)、时间观念与 table manners, 并学习感叹句 How pretty the dragon boats were! 中考考点: be supposed to 的用法、习俗差异话题的阅读理解与书面表达。语篇对比 Colombia 与 Switzerland 的守时观念, 写作按「国家—习俗—态度」展开, 常用 while 与 however 表对比。补充表达: be relaxed about time(对时间随意), be on time(准时), make plans to do(计划做)。","keyPoints":["核心句型: What are people in Korea supposed to do when they meet for the first time? They're supposed to bow.","be supposed to do 表示按规矩应该做: You're supposed to shake hands.","否定式: You're not supposed to eat with your hands.","礼仪词汇: shake hands, bow, kiss, greet, table manners, wipe...with...","重点短语: for the first time, drop by, after all, get mad, make an effort","文化链接: 巴西人见面亲吻脸颊, 日本人鞠躬, 瑞士人重视守时——比较文化差异是写作高频"],"example":"课文选段: A: What are people in Korea supposed to do when they meet for the first time? B: They're supposed to bow. A: How about in Brazil? B: They usually kiss on the side of the face. A: That's different from China. We shake hands. B: By the way, are you supposed to arrive on time for a party in Switzerland? A: Yes, if you're late, your friend may get mad. B: Interesting! Every country has different customs. 译文: 甲: 在韩国, 人们初次见面时应该做什么? 乙: 应该鞠躬。甲: 那在巴西呢? 乙: 他们通常亲吻脸颊。甲: 那和中国不一样, 我们握手。乙: 顺便问一下, 在瑞士参加聚会应该准时到吗? 甲: 是的, 如果迟到, 朋友可能会生气。乙: 真有趣! 每个国家都有不同的习俗。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","阅读话题"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-26-4","title":"Unit 11 Sad movies make me cry——情绪与因果","content":"本单元围绕情绪感受与因果关系展开, 核心句型: Sad movies make me cry. Money and fame don't always make people happy. Waiting for Amy drove Tina crazy. 语法焦点是 make 的复合结构: make sb. + 形容词(使某人处于某种状态)与 make sb. do sth.(使某人做某事), make 后接动词原形。功能上学会描述事物给人的感受及情绪的成因, 词汇聚焦情感类形容词(nervous, relaxed, upset, sleepy)。中考考点: make sb. do sth. 省略 to、变被动后还原为 be made to do sth. 是高频易错点。阅读语篇 The Shirt of a Happy Man 借国王寻衫的故事探讨快乐真谛, 寓意理解与 make 复合结构的语法填空是常考题型。关联考点: 感官动词 see/watch/hear sb. do 后同样接原形, 常与 make sb. do 一起考查。","keyPoints":["核心句型: Sad movies make me cry. (make sb. do sth.)","make sb. + adj.: Soft music makes me sleepy. / Waiting for Amy drove Tina crazy.","否定式: Money and fame don't always make people happy.","重点短语: would rather do, drive sb. crazy/mad, leave out, be friends with sb., kick sb. off","易错点: make sb. do 变被动语态要还原 to, 即 be made to do sth.","情感形容词: nervous, relaxed, comfortable, upset, angry, sleepy"],"example":"课文选段: A: Did you watch the movie last night? B: Yes, sad movies make me cry. A: Me too. The music in it made me nervous. B: But the ending made us happy. A: By the way, would you rather watch comedies? B: Yes. Funny movies make me relaxed. A: Let's watch one together this weekend. B: Good idea! 译文: 甲: 你昨晚看电影了吗? 乙: 看了, 悲伤的电影让我流泪。甲: 我也是, 片中的音乐让我紧张。乙: 但结尾让我们很开心。甲: 顺便问一下, 你更愿意看喜剧吗? 乙: 是的, 搞笑的电影让我放松。甲: 这周末我们一起看一部吧。乙: 好主意!","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","易错点"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-26-5","title":"Unit 12 Life is full of the unexpected——过去完成时","content":"本单元以「意外与巧合」为话题, 讲述生活中充满意想不到的事。核心句型: By the time I got up, my brother had already gotten in the shower. When I got to school, I realized I had left my backpack at home. 语法焦点是过去完成时(had + 过去分词), 表示「过去的过去」发生的动作, 必须有一个过去的参照点, 常与 by the time, when, before 连用。话题包括 oversleep 赶车迟到的尴尬经历与愚人节趣闻。中考考点: 过去完成时的判定(找过去参照点)与 already/just 的位置是单选高频。书面表达常考「难忘的一天»: 主线用一般过去时, 回忆「之前已发生」的环节用过去完成时, 两条时间线要分清。","keyPoints":["核心句型: By the time I got up, my brother had already gotten in the shower.","When I got to school, I realized I had left my backpack at home.","过去完成时: had + 过去分词, 表示过去某时之前已完成(过去的过去)的动作","标志词: by the time, when, before, by the end of last term","重点短语: by the time, wake up, go off, give...a lift, show up, sell out","判定技巧: 句中出现两个过去动作, 先发生的那个用过去完成时"],"example":"课文选段: This morning was terrible. By the time I woke up, my father had already gotten into the bathroom, so I had to wait. Then I found that my brother had taken my bike to school. I ran to the bus stop, but the bus had already left. When I finally got to school, the class had been on for ten minutes. My teacher said I had missed the most important part of the lesson. What an unexpected morning! 译文: 今天早晨糟透了。我醒来时, 爸爸已经进了浴室, 我只好等着。接着我发现弟弟已经骑着我的自行车上学去了。我跑到公交站, 可公交车已经开走了。当我终于赶到学校, 课已经开始十分钟了。老师说我已经错过了这节课最重要的部分。真是意想不到的一个早晨!","extension":"中考链接: 判断过去完成时的关键是「两个过去」——By the time I arrived, the film had begun. 中 arrived 是过去参照点, 「电影开始」发生得更早, 故用 had begun。缺少参照点时不能单独使用过去完成时。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","中考高频"],"difficulty":3,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-26-6","title":"Unit 13 We're trying to save the earth!——环保行动","content":"本单元以环境保护为话题, 核心句型: We're trying to save the earth. The river used to be so clean. Everyone should help to solve the problem. 语法上是综合时态复习: 现在进行时、used to、情态动词与被动语态在同一语篇中交替出现。词汇聚焦环保三原则 reduce, reuse, recycle 与污染类型(air pollution, water pollution, noise pollution)。阅读语篇讨论 shark fin soup 与海洋保护。中考考点: 环保话题词汇与提建议句型(should..., It's important to...)是书面表达高频素材。写作按「点明问题—描述现状—提出建议」展开, 建议至少列三条并配理由, 卷面更充实。其他高频词: pollution, harmful, afford, take public transportation(乘坐公共交通)。","keyPoints":["核心句型: We're trying to save the earth. / Everyone should help to solve the problem.","综合时态: We're trying...(现在进行时), The river used to be...(used to), should help(情态动词)","环保三原则: reduce(减少), reuse(重复利用), recycle(回收)","重点短语: cut down, cut off, throw away, pull...down, turn off, pay for, take action","提建议句型: We should..., It's important to..., Remember to...","阅读链接: shark fin soup 与 Save the Sharks!——环保说明文高频话题"],"example":"课文选段: A: The river used to be so clean, didn't it? B: Yes, but now it's badly polluted. Factories are pouring waste water into it. A: That's awful! We're trying to save the earth, so everyone should help. B: What can we do? A: We should write to the government and ask it to close down the factories. B: Good idea. And we can also recycle books and paper. A: Right, small things can make a big difference. 译文: 甲: 这条河过去很干净, 是吧? 乙: 是的, 但现在污染严重, 工厂正往河里排放废水。甲: 太糟糕了! 我们正努力拯救地球, 每个人都该出一份力。乙: 我们能做些什么? 甲: 我们应该给政府写信, 请它关掉这些工厂。乙: 好主意, 我们还可以回收利用书本和纸张。甲: 对, 小事也能带来大改变。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","书面表达","阅读话题"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-26-7","title":"Unit 14 I remember meeting all of you in Grade 7——毕业与回忆","content":"本单元是全一册的收官单元, 话题为毕业回忆与未来展望。核心句型: I remember meeting all of you in Grade 7. You were all so full of energy and thirsty for knowledge. I'm looking forward to going to senior high school. 语法焦点是 remember doing(记得做过, 动作已发生)与 remember to do(记得要去做, 动作未做)的辨析, 以及 look forward to doing, be thirsty for 等固定搭配。语篇以毕业致辞(graduation speech)为主, 回顾三年成长、感谢师友、展望高中生活。中考考点: remember doing/to do 辨析与毕业感想类书面表达。本单元句型集中复现初中三年核心知识, 是总复习的天然语料库, 毕业类写作情感真挚最易得高分。","keyPoints":["核心句型: I remember meeting all of you in Grade 7.","remember doing 记得做过(已发生); remember to do 记得要去做(未做)","I'm looking forward to going to senior high school. (to 是介词, 后接 doing)","重点短语: be thirsty for, be proud of, be thankful to sb., ahead of, along with, set out","毕业致辞三段式: 回忆过去→感谢师长→展望未来","写作金句: None of you did it alone. Keep your dream in mind and never give up."],"example":"课文选段: Ladies and gentlemen, thank you for coming today. I remember meeting all of you in Grade 7. You were all so full of energy and thirsty for knowledge. Over the past three years, we have laughed and cried together. I'm proud of what you have done. Now it's time to say goodbye. I'm looking forward to hearing about your success in senior high school. Good luck, and never give up! 译文: 女士们、先生们, 感谢大家今天到来。我还记得七年级与你们初见的情景, 那时你们个个精力充沛、求知若渴。三年来, 我们一起欢笑, 一起流泪。我为你们取得的成就感到骄傲。现在是道别的时候了。我期待听到你们在高中取得成功的消息。祝你们好运, 永不放弃!","extension":"写作链接: 毕业感言类作文可用「三段+金句」结构——开头用 I remember doing 回忆初见, 中间用 be proud of / be thankful to 致谢, 结尾用 look forward to 与 never give up 展望, 情感真挚易得高分。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["课内课文","书面表达"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"}]},{"uid":"english-27","name":"书面表达范文·应用文","grade":"中考专题","order":26,"kps":[{"uid":"english-27-1","title":"自我介绍——书信·应用文","content":"审题: 用书信格式向笔友介绍自己, 人称以第一人称为主, 介绍姓名、年龄、爱好、家庭与学校生活等基本情况用一般现在时。结构安排: 开头点明写信目的并回应对方来信; 主体分三层展开——基本情况(姓名、年龄、学校)、家庭与爱好、学校生活, 一层一段; 结尾表达结交朋友的心愿并期待回信。常用句型: I'm glad to tell you something about... / My name is... / There are four people in my family. / My favorite subject is... because... / I hope we can be good friends. 题目给出的要点必须全部覆盖, 漏点即扣分。","keyPoints":["开头句: I'm glad to receive your letter, and I'd like to introduce myself to you.","基本句: My name is Li Hua, a fourteen-year-old boy from Beijing, China.","爱好句: As for my hobbies, I like playing basketball and reading books about science.","结尾句: I really hope we can be good friends. Please write to me soon.","衔接词: As for..., Besides, What's more","写作步骤: 列要点(姓名/年龄/家庭/爱好/学校)→逐条成句→补称呼落款→检查动词第三人称单数"],"example":"范文: Dear Tom, I'm glad to receive your letter, and I'd like to introduce myself to you. My name is Li Hua, a fourteen-year-old boy from Beijing, China. I study in Grade Eight at Sunshine Middle School. There are four people in my family: my parents, my little sister and me. We get along well with each other. As for my hobbies, I like playing basketball and reading books about science. On weekends, I often play basketball with my friends, which keeps me healthy and happy. My favorite subject is English because it helps me learn about the world. I really hope we can be good friends. Please write to me soon and tell me about yourself. Yours, Li Hua 译文: 亲爱的汤姆: 很高兴收到你的来信, 我想向你介绍一下我自己。我叫李华, 是一个来自中国北京的十四岁男孩, 在阳光中学八年级读书。我家有四口人: 爸爸、妈妈、妹妹和我, 我们相处得很融洽。说到爱好, 我喜欢打篮球和读科学类书籍。周末我常和朋友们打篮球, 这让我健康又快乐。我最喜欢的科目是英语, 因为它帮助我了解世界。真心希望我们能成为好朋友。请尽快回信告诉我你的情况。你的朋友, 李华","extension":"变式训练: 把「介绍自己」改为「介绍我的新学校生活」, 要点换成课程、老师、课后活动, 开头结尾句型可直接迁移使用。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["作文范文","中考高频"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-27-2","title":"邀请信——书信·应用文","content":"审题: 邀请朋友参加毕业聚会, 文体为邀请信, 第一人称, 时间、地点与活动安排用一般将来时(will / be going to), 语气热情有礼。结构安排: 开头说明写信缘由(毕业在即, 想聚一聚); 主体交代聚会的时间、地点、时长与活动流程, 用 First / Then / What's more 串联; 结尾发出邀请并期待答复。常用句型: I would like to invite you to... / The party will start at... and last about... / Will you come? / I'm looking forward to your reply. 时间、地点是邀请信的给分点, 必须写清、写具体。","keyPoints":["邀请句: I'm going to hold a party, and I would like to invite you to come.","安排句: The party will start at 6:00 p.m. and last about three hours.","流程衔接: First... Then... What's more...","目的句: We will take photos so that we can keep this special moment forever.","结尾句: Will you come? I'm looking forward to your reply.","写作步骤: 定时间地点→列活动流程→按顺序连句→检查将来时态与称呼落款"],"example":"范文: Dear Lucy, How time flies! Our junior high school life is coming to an end. To celebrate our graduation, I'm going to hold a party at my home this Saturday evening, and I would like to invite you to come. The party will start at 6:00 p.m. and last about three hours. First, we will have a big dinner together. Then we can sing songs, play games and share our sweet memories of the past three years. What's more, we will take photos so that we can keep this special moment forever. It will be a great chance for us to say thank you to each other. Will you come? I'm looking forward to your reply. Yours, Li Hua 译文: 亲爱的露西: 时间过得真快! 我们的初中生活即将结束。为了庆祝毕业, 这周六晚上我打算在家办一场聚会, 想邀请你来参加。聚会晚上六点开始, 大约三个小时。首先我们一起吃一顿丰盛的晚餐, 然后可以唱歌、做游戏, 分享这三年来的美好回忆。此外, 我们还会拍照留念, 把这个特别的时刻永远留住。这也将是我们互相道谢的好机会。你会来吗? 期待你的回复。你的朋友, 李华","extension":"变式训练: 把毕业聚会换成生日聚会, 增加要点「可带一份小礼物」; 注意邀请信面向个人、语气亲切, 通知面向全体, 两者不可混写。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["作文范文","应用文格式"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-27-3","title":"感谢信——书信·应用文","content":"审题: 感谢帮助过自己的老师, 第一人称, 时态混合使用——回忆对方帮助的具体事例用一般过去时, 表达感谢、感受与祝愿用一般现在时及将来时。结构安排: 开头点明写信目的(致谢); 主体回顾一件具体的事: 曾经的困难、对方怎么帮、自己有了什么变化, 事例越具体越动人; 结尾再次致谢并送上祝愿。常用句型: I'm writing this letter to say thank you for... / It was you who... / Because of your help, I have made great progress. / I wish you... 切忌空喊感谢, 「事例+变化+感受」三要素缺一不可。","keyPoints":["开头句: I'm writing this letter to say thank you for your help.","强调句亮点: It was you who encouraged me and taught me how to learn English well.","因果句: Because of your help, I have made great progress.","承诺句: I will work even harder and never let you down.","祝愿句: I wish you good health and happiness every day.","写作步骤: 定感谢对象→选一件具体事例→写出自己的变化→再次致谢并祝愿"],"example":"范文: Dear Miss Wang, I'm writing this letter to say thank you for your help. Two years ago, I was weak in English and almost wanted to give it up. It was you who encouraged me and taught me how to learn English well. You were always patient when I asked you questions, and you often lent me interesting English books after class. Because of your help, I have made great progress and now English is my favorite subject. Whenever I meet difficulties, your warm words give me courage. I will work even harder and never let you down. Thank you again for everything you have done for me. I wish you good health and happiness every day. Yours, Li Hua 译文: 亲爱的王老师: 我写这封信是想感谢您对我的帮助。两年前, 我英语很差, 几乎想放弃。是您鼓励了我, 教我如何学好英语。每次我问问题, 您总是那么耐心, 课后还常借给我有趣的英文书。在您的帮助下, 我取得了很大进步, 现在英语是我最喜欢的科目。每当我遇到困难, 您温暖的话语都给我勇气。我会更加努力, 绝不辜负您。再次感谢您为我所做的一切, 祝您每天都健康快乐! 您的学生, 李华","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["作文范文","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-27-4","title":"建议信——书信·应用文","content":"审题: 给学习压力大的朋友回信提建议, 第二人称为主、第一人称辅助, 建议句用情态动词 should / shouldn't / you'd better / why not 引导, 时态以一般现在时为主。结构安排: 开头表达同情并点明写信目的; 主体分三条建议——制订学习计划、坚持体育锻炼、找人倾诉, 用 First of all / Second / Third 排序, 每条建议后附一句理由; 结尾用 In a word 总结并送上祝愿。常用句型: I'm sorry to hear that... / You should... so that... / Why not...? / It's a good idea to... 三条建议务必写足, 「一条建议+一句支撑」是基本盘。","keyPoints":["同情句: I'm sorry to hear that you are under too much pressure.","建议句型: You should make a study plan. / Why not do some sports? / You'd better listen to some light music.","It's a good idea to talk about your problems with your parents, teachers or friends.","顺序衔接: First of all... Second... Third... Besides...","结尾句: In a word, keep a balanced life between study and rest.","写作步骤: 列三条建议→每条配一个理由→排序连段→检查情态动词后接动词原形"],"example":"范文: Dear Peter, I'm sorry to hear that you are under too much pressure these days. Here is some advice for you. First of all, you should make a study plan so that you can finish your homework on time and have enough sleep. Second, why not do some sports after class? Playing basketball or running can help you relax. Third, it's a good idea to talk about your problems with your parents, teachers or friends. They are always there to help you. Besides, you'd better listen to some light music when you feel tired. In a word, keep a balanced life between study and rest, and you will feel much better. I hope my advice will be helpful to you. Yours, Li Hua 译文: 亲爱的彼得: 听说你最近压力很大, 我很难过。这里给你一些建议。首先, 你应该制订一个学习计划, 这样就能按时完成作业并有充足的睡眠。其次, 为什么不课后做做运动呢? 打篮球或跑步都能帮你放松。第三, 把你的烦恼说给父母、老师或朋友听是个好主意, 他们随时都愿意帮助你。此外, 感到累的时候, 你最好听听轻音乐。总之, 保持学习与休息的平衡, 你会感觉好很多。希望我的建议对你有帮助。你的朋友, 李华","extension":"变式训练: 同款句型可迁移到「如何学好英语」「如何保持健康」等建议类话题, 只需替换三条建议的具体内容。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["作文范文","建议句型","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-27-5","title":"请假条——便条·应用文","content":"审题: 因生病向老师请假, 第一人称, 说明现状与请求用一般现在时, 叙述生病就医经过用一般过去时, 承诺补课用将来时。格式要点: 称呼 Dear Mr. Smith, 正文说明事由与请假天数, 落款 Yours, + 姓名, 日期另起一行写在右下角。结构安排: 开头致歉并说明请假原因; 主体交代病情、就医经过与请假天数; 结尾承诺补上功课并致谢。常用句型: I'm sorry to tell you that... / I have to ask for two days' leave. / The doctor said... / I will work hard to catch up with others. 语言简洁得体, 事由与天数两要素必须明确。","keyPoints":["开头句: I'm sorry to tell you that I can't go to school today because I have a bad cold.","事由句: The doctor said I had the flu and told me to stay in bed for two days.","请求句: So I have to ask for two days' leave.","补救句: I will ask my classmates for notes and study by myself at home.","格式提醒: 落款 Yours, + 姓名, 日期另起一行写在右下角","写作步骤: 致歉说明事由→就医经过→请假天数→承诺补课+致谢"],"example":"范文: Dear Mr. Smith, I'm sorry to tell you that I can't go to school today because I have a bad cold. Last night I had a headache and a fever. This morning my mother took me to the hospital. The doctor said I had the flu and told me to stay in bed for two days. So I have to ask for two days' leave. Don't worry about my lessons. I will ask my classmates for notes and study by myself at home as soon as I feel better. When I come back to school, I will work hard to catch up with others. Thank you for your understanding. Yours, Li Hua 译文: 亲爱的史密斯老师: 很抱歉告诉您, 我今天患了重感冒, 不能到校上课。昨晚我头疼发烧, 今天早上妈妈带我去了医院。医生说我得了流感, 要卧床休息两天, 因此我不得不请两天假。请不用担心我的功课, 身体一好转我就会向同学借笔记并在家自学, 返校后我会努力赶上的。感谢您的理解。您的学生, 李华","extension":"变式训练: 把「生病请假」换成「家中有事请假」或「因病缺席活动向组织者说明」, 保留「事由+请求+补救+致谢」四步框架即可。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["作文范文","应用文格式"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-27-6","title":"活动通知——通知·应用文","content":"审题: 口头通知英语角活动, 面向全体同学, 活动安排用一般将来时, 兼用被动语态(will be held)提升档次, 注意事项用祈使句。结构安排: 开头吸引注意(Boys and girls, may I have your attention, please?); 主体依次交代时间、地点、参加对象、活动内容, 内容较多时用 First / Then / Besides 排序; 结尾提出要求并致谢(That's all. Thank you!)。常用句型: An English Corner will be held on... / All the students who are interested in... are welcome. / Please come on time. / Don't be afraid of making mistakes. 「时间、地点、对象、内容、要求」五要素一项不能少。","keyPoints":["被动语态亮点: An English Corner will be held on the playground this Friday afternoon.","开头固定句: Boys and girls, may I have your attention, please?","参与句: All the students who are interested in English are welcome to take part in it.","祈使句提醒: Please come on time. / Don't be afraid of making mistakes.","结尾句: That's all. Thank you!","写作步骤: 列出五要素→按时间地点内容要求排序→用被动语态与祈使句提升档次"],"example":"范文: Boys and girls, may I have your attention, please? An English Corner will be held on the playground this Friday afternoon, from 4:30 to 5:30. All the students who are interested in English are welcome to take part in it. There will be many interesting activities. First, a foreign teacher, Mr. Green, will give us a talk about American culture. Then we can practice speaking English with him and other students in groups. Besides, an English singing competition will be held at the end of the activity. Please come on time and try to speak English as much as possible. Don't be afraid of making mistakes. I believe you will enjoy yourselves and learn a lot. That's all. Thank you! 译文: 同学们, 请注意! 本周五下午4:30至5:30将在操场举办英语角活动, 欢迎所有对英语感兴趣的同学参加。活动内容丰富: 首先外教格林老师将为我们做一场关于美国文化的讲座, 然后大家可以和他以及其他同学分组练习英语口语。此外, 活动最后还将举行英语歌唱比赛。请准时参加, 尽量多说英语, 不要怕犯错。相信你们会玩得开心并学到很多。就这些, 谢谢大家!","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["作文范文","应用文格式","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-27-7","title":"调查汇报——图表作文·应用文","content":"审题: 汇报同学们周末活动的调查结果, 报告数据用第三人称复数(动词用原形), 谈看法转为第一人称, 时态以一般现在时为主, 交代调查背景可用过去时。结构安排: 开头交代调查的时间与主题; 主体按比例从大到小逐项汇报数据, 每组数据后可加 such as 举例, 避免数字堆砌; 结尾谈两三句看法并发出倡议。常用句型: Last week, our school did a survey about... / Forty percent of the students... / However, only ten percent... / In my opinion, we should... / Why not...? 数据抄写要准确, 百分数后的动词单复数别出错。","keyPoints":["开头句: Last week, our school did a survey about what students usually do on weekends.","数据句型: Forty percent of the students do their homework and read books at home.","对比衔接: However, only ten percent of the students take part in social activities.","看法句: In my opinion, we should make our weekend life colorful and meaningful.","倡议句: Why not spend more time with our family or do something helpful for society?","写作步骤: 抄全数据→按比例从大到小汇报→每项加举例→结尾谈看法发倡议"],"example":"范文: Last week, our school did a survey about what students usually do on weekends. Here are the results. Forty percent of the students do their homework and read books at home. Thirty percent take exercise, such as playing ball games and swimming. Twenty percent help their parents with housework. However, only ten percent of the students take part in social activities, like volunteering in the community. In my opinion, we should make our weekend life colorful and meaningful. It's important to study hard, but doing sports and helping others are also good for us. Why not spend more time with our family or do something helpful for society? I'm sure we can learn a lot from these activities. 译文: 上周, 我们学校就「同学们周末通常做什么」做了一项调查, 结果如下。40%的同学在家写作业、读书; 30%参加锻炼, 比如打球和游泳; 20%帮父母做家务; 然而只有10%的同学参加社区志愿活动等社会实践。在我看来, 我们应当让周末生活丰富多彩且有意义。努力学习固然重要, 但运动和帮助他人对我们也有好处。为什么不多陪陪家人, 或为社会做点有益的事呢? 我相信我们能从这些活动中学到很多。","extension":"变式训练: 换成「同学们上网习惯」调查: 要点改为上网时长、主要内容、利与弊, 数据句型不变, 看法部分改为「合理使用网络」的建议。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["作文范文","图表作文","拓展提升"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-27-8","title":"申请当志愿者——启事回复·应用文","content":"审题: 读到招募志愿者的启事后写申请信, 第一人称, 陈述自身优势用一般现在时, 介绍相关经历用一般过去时, 表达愿望用 I would be thankful if... 等句型。结构安排: 开头自报身份并表明申请意愿; 主体从三方面证明自己——健康与特长、性格品质、英语能力与志愿经历, 每点都说明「这项优势如何匹配岗位」; 结尾恳请机会并期待回复。常用句型: I think I'm suitable for the job because... / I'm good at... / What's more, I'm always ready to help others. / I'm looking forward to your reply. 核心策略: 启事要求什么, 就证明自己有什么。","keyPoints":["开头句: I'm Li Hua, a student from Class 2, Grade 9. I really want to be one of them.","匹配句: I think I'm suitable for the job because I'm healthy and good at sports.","优势句: What's more, I'm outgoing and always ready to help others.","经验句: Last year, I worked as a volunteer in a marathon and learned a lot.","结尾句: I would be thankful if you could give me this chance.","写作步骤: 圈出启事要求→逐条对应自身优势→按重要程度排序→礼貌恳求收尾"],"example":"范文: Dear Sir or Madam, I'm Li Hua, a student from Class 2, Grade 9. I hear that some volunteers are needed for the city sports meeting, and I really want to be one of them. I think I'm suitable for the job. First of all, I'm healthy and good at sports, so I can serve the players well. What's more, I'm outgoing and always ready to help others, which makes it easy for me to communicate with people. Besides, my English is good, so I can talk with foreign friends if necessary. Last year, I worked as a volunteer in a marathon and learned a lot. I would be thankful if you could give me this chance. I'm looking forward to your reply. Yours sincerely, Li Hua 译文: 尊敬的先生或女士: 我是李华, 九年级二班的学生。我听说城市运动会需要一些志愿者, 非常想成为其中一员。我认为自己很适合这份工作。首先, 我身体健康、擅长运动, 能很好地为运动员服务。其次, 我性格外向、乐于助人, 这让我很容易与人沟通。此外, 我英语很好, 必要时可以和外国朋友交流。去年我曾在一场马拉松比赛中担任志愿者, 学到了很多。如果您能给我这个机会, 我将不胜感激。期待您的回复。您真诚的, 李华","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["作文范文","应用文格式","拓展提升"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"}]},{"uid":"english-28","name":"书面表达范文·话题作文","grade":"中考专题","order":27,"kps":[{"uid":"english-28-1","title":"My Best Friend——话题作文","content":"审题: 写最好的朋友, 主体用第三人称单数(动词别忘加-s / -es), 外貌性格用一般现在时, 共同经历用一般过去时, 感悟用现在时或现在完成时。结构安排: 开头点明「谁是我最好的朋友」; 主体分两层——外貌与性格一笔带过, 共同经历重点展开(受挫时他如何帮助我), 详略得当才有感染力; 结尾用谚语升华友谊并表达愿望。常用句型: He is not only... but also... / It was... who... / With his help, I made great progress. / A friend in need is a friend indeed. 「先概括、后叙事、再升华」是写人作文的黄金结构。","keyPoints":["外貌句: He is tall and thin, with a pair of bright eyes behind his glasses.","性格句: He is not only smart but also kind, and he is always ready to help others.","强调句亮点: It was Li Ming who cheered me up.","谚语升华: A friend in need is a friend indeed.","结尾句: I hope our friendship will last forever.","写作步骤: 外貌性格(现在时)→共同经历(过去时)→友谊感悟(谚语升华收尾)"],"example":"范文: Li Ming is my best friend. He is tall and thin, with a pair of bright eyes behind his glasses. He is not only smart but also kind, and he is always ready to help others. We have known each other since primary school. We both like basketball, so we often practice together after school. Last term, I failed my math exam and felt very sad. It was Li Ming who cheered me up. He spent his free time helping me with math. With his help, I made great progress in the final exam. A friend in need is a friend indeed. I feel lucky to have such a good friend, and I hope our friendship will last forever. 译文: 李明是我最好的朋友。他又高又瘦, 明亮的眼睛上架着一副眼镜。他不仅聪明而且善良, 总是乐于助人。我们从小学就认识, 都喜欢篮球, 放学后常一起练球。上学期我数学考试没考好, 心情很低落, 是李明鼓励了我, 他把课余时间用来帮我补习数学。在他的帮助下, 我期末考试进步很大。患难见真情, 有这样的好朋友我感到幸运, 希望我们的友谊天长地久。","extension":"变式训练: 把朋友换成「我的老师」或「我的妈妈」, 保留「外貌性格+具体事例+感悟升华」结构, 叙事部分换一件对方帮助你的事即可。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["作文范文","写人叙事","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-28-2","title":"My School Life——话题作文","content":"审题: 介绍学校生活, 第一人称, 课程、活动与师生关系用一般现在时, 加入社团的经历可用一般过去时或现在完成时。结构安排: 开头一句总起点题(busy but colorful); 主体按「课程学习→课外活动→师生同学」三层展开, 每层补一个细节或原因(如最喜欢的科目及原因); 结尾总结感受并表达愿望, 与开头呼应。常用句型: Among all the subjects, I like... best because... / After class, I often... / Besides, our school has many clubs. / In a word, I love my school life. 总起句定基调, 细节句撑内容, 总结句收情感。","keyPoints":["总起句: My school life is busy but colorful.","课程句: Among all the subjects, I like English best because it's interesting and useful.","活动句: After class, I often play basketball with my friends on the playground.","社团句: Besides, our school has many clubs, such as the music club and the science club.","总结句: In a word, I love my school life very much.","写作步骤: 定基调→选三个层面(课程/活动/师生)→每层加细节→首尾呼应"],"example":"范文: My school life is busy but colorful. Every day I have four classes in the morning and three in the afternoon. Among all the subjects, I like English best because it's interesting and useful. After class, I often play basketball with my friends on the playground. It makes me relaxed and healthy. Besides, our school has many clubs, such as the music club and the science club. I joined the reading club last year and have read many wonderful books. My teachers are patient and my classmates are friendly. We often help each other. In a word, I love my school life very much. I will study hard and enjoy every day here. 译文: 我的学校生活忙碌而多彩。每天上午上四节课, 下午上三节课。在所有科目中, 我最喜欢英语, 因为它既有趣又有用。课后我常和朋友们在操场上打篮球, 这让我放松又健康。此外, 学校有很多社团, 比如音乐社和科学社。去年我加入了阅读社, 读了许多好书。老师们很有耐心, 同学们也很友好, 我们经常互相帮助。总之, 我非常热爱我的学校生活, 我会努力学习, 享受在这里的每一天。","extension":"变式训练: 同题改写为书信体——笔友询问你的学校生活, 开头加 I'm glad to tell you something about my school life, 结尾加 I'm looking forward to your reply, 正文可复用。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["作文范文","中考高频"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-28-3","title":"My Hobby——话题作文","content":"审题: 介绍自己的爱好, 第一人称, 写爱好的日常与收获用一般现在时, 回忆如何开始、如何克服困难用一般过去时。结构安排: 开头点明「我的爱好是什么」; 主体按「起因(怎样爱上)→过程(一次先困难后成功的经历)→收获(健康、朋友、道理)」推进, 有起伏的情节最能打动阅卷人; 结尾用一句道理完成升华。常用句型: My hobby is... / I fell in love with it when... / At first, I was afraid of... / It not only keeps me healthy but also makes me relaxed. / Nothing is impossible if we keep trying. 过去时段落写完必查动词过去式。","keyPoints":["点题句: Everyone has his own hobby, and mine is swimming.","起因句: I fell in love with it when I was seven years old.","经历句: At first, I was afraid of water and couldn't swim at all.","递进句: It not only keeps me healthy but also makes me feel relaxed after study.","升华句: Nothing is impossible if we keep trying.","写作步骤: 点明爱好→交代起因→写一次先困难后成功的经历→收获与道理收尾"],"example":"范文: Everyone has his own hobby, and mine is swimming. I fell in love with it when I was seven years old. My father often took me to the swimming pool. At first, I was afraid of water and couldn't swim at all. My father encouraged me to be brave and taught me step by step. After practicing for a whole summer, I could finally swim like a fish in the water. How happy I was! Now I go swimming twice a week. It not only keeps me healthy but also makes me feel relaxed after study. What's more, I have made many friends there. Swimming teaches me that nothing is impossible if we keep trying. 译文: 每个人都有自己的爱好, 我的爱好是游泳。七岁那年我就爱上了它, 爸爸经常带我去游泳池。起初我很怕水, 一点也不会游。爸爸鼓励我要勇敢, 一步一步地教我。练习了整整一个夏天后, 我终于能像鱼一样在水里游了, 我多么开心啊! 现在我每周去游泳两次, 它不仅让我保持健康, 还让我在学习后得到放松。而且, 我在那里交了很多朋友。游泳让我懂得: 只要坚持尝试, 没有什么是不可能的。","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["作文范文","写人叙事"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-28-4","title":"Healthy Life——话题作文","content":"审题: 健康生活话题, 面向同龄人提建议, 人称用 we, 建议句以 should / shouldn't / you'd better / Let's 为骨架, 全文用一般现在时。结构安排: 开头点明健康的重要性并引出建议; 主体分三条——饮食(健康食物、按时吃早餐)、运动(每天至少一小时)、作息(不熬夜), 可加第四条「好心情」, 每条建议配一句理由或例子; 结尾 In a word 总结并呼吁。常用句型: We should eat healthy food, such as... / We'd better... / We shouldn't stay up late... / Let's start a healthy life from now on! 建议类作文的关键是「一条建议+一句支撑」。","keyPoints":["点题句: As middle school students, we should live a healthy life.","饮食句: We should eat healthy food, such as vegetables and fruit, and stay away from junk food.","运动句: We should do sports for at least one hour every day, such as running or playing ball games.","作息句: We shouldn't stay up late playing computer games.","呼吁句: Let's start a healthy life from now on!","写作步骤: 饮食/运动/作息各一条建议→每条配一句理由→In a word 总结呼吁"],"example":"范文: As middle school students, we should live a healthy life. First of all, we should eat healthy food, such as vegetables and fruit, and stay away from junk food. Breakfast is the most important meal of the day, so we'd better eat it every morning. Second, doing exercise is necessary. We should do sports for at least one hour every day, such as running or playing ball games. Third, enough sleep is also important. We shouldn't stay up late playing computer games. Besides, keeping a good mood is good for our health. When we feel stressed, talking to friends can help. In a word, health is the most important thing. Let's start a healthy life from now on! 译文: 作为中学生, 我们应该过健康的生活。首先, 要吃蔬菜水果等健康食物, 远离垃圾食品。早餐是一天中最重要的一餐, 最好每天早上都吃。其次, 锻炼必不可少, 每天至少运动一小时, 比如跑步或打球。第三, 充足的睡眠也很重要, 我们不应该熬夜玩电脑游戏。此外, 保持好心情有益健康, 感到压力大时, 找朋友聊聊会有帮助。总之, 健康是最重要的, 让我们从现在开始健康生活吧!","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["作文范文","建议句型","中考高频"],"difficulty":1,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-28-5","title":"My Dream——话题作文","content":"审题: 谈自己的梦想, 第一人称, 点明梦想与原因用一般现在时, 畅想如何实现用 be going to / will 表打算, since then 句可用现在完成时。结构安排: 开头点明「我的梦想是什么」; 主体回答两个问题——「为什么」(用一件具体的小事作起因)与「怎么做」(两三条行动: 学好相关学科、锻炼身体等); 结尾用谚语与信念句升华。常用句型: My dream is to be... / Since then, I have wanted to... / I'm going to study hard, especially in... / Where there is a will, there is a way. 起因要具体到事, 行动要落到学科。","keyPoints":["点题句: Everyone has a dream, and my dream is to be a doctor.","原因句: When I was young, my grandma was often ill, and I felt sad to see her suffer.","打算句: I'm going to study hard, especially in biology and chemistry.","谚语: Where there is a will, there is a way.","信念句: I believe my dream will come true if I keep working hard.","写作步骤: 点明梦想→一个具体起因→两三条行动(be going to / will)→谚语升华"],"example":"范文: Everyone has a dream, and my dream is to be a doctor. When I was young, my grandma was often ill, and I felt sad to see her suffer. The doctors helped her a lot, and since then I have wanted to be a doctor like them. To make it come true, I have made a plan. First of all, I'm going to study hard, especially in biology and chemistry. What's more, I will keep exercising to stay healthy. I know there will be many difficulties on the way, but I will never give up. Where there is a will, there is a way. I believe my dream will come true if I keep working hard. 译文: 每个人都有梦想, 我的梦想是成为一名医生。小时候奶奶经常生病, 看到她受苦我很难过。医生们给了她很大帮助, 从那时起我就想成为像他们一样的医生。为了让梦想成真, 我制订了计划: 首先, 我要努力学习, 尤其是生物和化学; 而且, 我会坚持锻炼保持健康。我知道逐梦路上会有很多困难, 但我绝不放弃。有志者事竟成, 我相信只要坚持努力, 梦想终会实现。","extension":"变式训练: 换成 I Want to Be a Teacher / Scientist, 起因句改为「受某位老师影响」或「一次科技馆参观」, 行动句换成对应学科即可。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["作文范文","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-28-6","title":"An Unforgettable Day——话题作文","content":"审题: 记叙难忘的一天, 第一人称, 全文以一般过去时为主, 抒发感悟可用现在完成时; 时间顺序词是文章的命脉。结构安排: 开头总起点题(什么时候、发生了什么); 主体按时间顺序叙事, 写清起因、经过与结果, 高潮部分(如救人)要有动作细节, 让文章「有画面」; 结尾抒发感受, 用感叹句升华。常用句型: ...when we heard someone calling for help / Without thinking twice, ... / We felt very proud of what we had done. / What an unforgettable day it was! 写完逐个检查动词过去式, 时态错误是记叙文最大失分点。","keyPoints":["点题句: Last summer vacation, I had an unforgettable experience.","时间顺序词: at first, at the same time, soon, finally, from then on","高潮句: Without thinking twice, Jim jumped into the river and swam quickly to the boy.","感受句: We felt very proud of what we had done.","感叹升华: What an unforgettable day it was!","写作步骤: 定时间地点→起因经过结果→逐个检查过去式→结尾抒情升华"],"example":"范文: Last summer vacation, I had an unforgettable experience. It was a hot afternoon. My friend Jim and I were walking along the river when we heard someone calling for help. A little boy had fallen into the water! Without thinking twice, Jim jumped into the river and swam quickly to the boy. At the same time, I called 120 and asked adults nearby for help. Soon, the boy was saved. Luckily, he was fine. His parents came and thanked us again and again. Although we were tired and wet, we felt very proud of what we had done. What an unforgettable day it was! From then on, I have understood the happiness of helping others. 译文: 去年暑假, 我有一次难忘的经历。那是一个炎热的下午, 我和朋友吉姆正沿着河边散步, 突然听到有人呼救——一个小男孩掉进了水里! 吉姆毫不犹豫地跳进河里, 迅速朝男孩游去; 与此同时, 我拨打了120并向附近的大人求助。很快, 男孩得救了, 幸运的是他安然无恙。他的父母赶来, 一次又一次地向我们道谢。虽然我们又累又湿, 但我们为自己所做的一切感到自豪。多么难忘的一天啊! 从那以后, 我体会到了帮助他人的快乐。","extension":"变式训练: 改写为「难忘的一场比赛/一次旅行」, 保留时间顺序词与感叹句结尾, 换掉起因经过即可; 注意全文保持一般过去时。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["作文范文","写人叙事","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-28-7","title":"Protect Our Environment——话题作文","content":"审题: 保护环境话题, 采用「问题+建议+呼吁」三段式, 人称用 we, 摆问题用一般现在时, 提建议用 should / shouldn't / why not / Let's 等情态与祈使句型。结构安排: 开头一两句点出环境问题, 不必长篇描述; 主体分三至四条建议——节约水电、垃圾分类回收、绿色出行、植树造林, 每条附一句理由或例子; 结尾 In a word 总结并发出呼吁。常用句型: Our environment is getting worse and worse. / We should turn off the lights when we leave a room. / Why not ride a bike to school? / Let's take action now! 建议必须紧扣「环境」, 不写偏题。","keyPoints":["问题句: Our environment is getting worse and worse.","节约句: We should save water and electricity in our daily life.","举例句: For example, we should turn off the lights when we leave a room.","绿色出行句: Why not ride a bike or walk to school instead of taking a car?","呼吁句: Let's take action now and make it a better place to live!","写作步骤: 一两句摆问题→三条建议各配理由→In a word 呼吁行动"],"example":"范文: Our environment is getting worse and worse. As students, we should do something to protect it. First of all, we should save water and electricity in our daily life. For example, we should turn off the lights when we leave a room. Second, don't throw rubbish everywhere. We should sort the rubbish and recycle useful things, such as paper and bottles. Third, why not ride a bike or walk to school instead of taking a car? It can reduce air pollution. Besides, we can plant more trees on Tree Planting Day. Trees can make the air clean and fresh. In a word, the earth is our home. Let's take action now and make it a better place to live! 译文: 我们的环境正变得越来越差。作为学生, 我们应该做点什么来保护它。首先, 日常生活中要节约水电, 比如离开房间时随手关灯。其次, 不要乱扔垃圾, 我们应当给垃圾分类并回收纸张、瓶子等有用物品。第三, 为什么不骑自行车或步行上学来代替坐汽车呢? 这样能减少空气污染。此外, 植树节时我们可以多植树, 树木能让空气清新。总之, 地球是我们的家园, 让我们立刻行动起来, 把它变成更美好的家园!","extension":null,"traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["作文范文","建议句型","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-28-8","title":"Life in the Future——话题作文","content":"审题: 想象二十年后的生活, 全文以一般将来时(will / won't / there will be)为骨架, 人称以 we 与泛指的 people、students 交替。结构安排: 开头设问引入(What will our life be like in twenty years?); 主体从三个角度展开想象——家庭生活(机器人做家务)、学习方式(网络课堂)、环境与健康, 每个角度「预测一句+影响一句」; 结尾回归情感: 无论世界怎么变, 爱与陪伴不变, 立意即胜人一筹。常用句型: There will be more robots in every family. / Students won't go to school every day. Instead, they will... / No matter how the world changes, love will never change.","keyPoints":["设问开头: What will our life be like in twenty years?","核心句型: There will be more robots in every family.","对比句: Students won't go to school every day. Instead, they will have lessons on the Internet.","环境句: There will be fewer cars, and the sky will be bluer.","立意句: No matter how the world changes, love will never change.","写作步骤: 设问开头→三个想象角度(家/学/环境)→一律用 will→结尾情感升华"],"example":"范文: What will our life be like in twenty years? I think it will be quite different from now. First of all, there will be more robots in every family. They will help us do the housework, so we will have more free time. Second, computers will be more important in our life. Students won't go to school every day. Instead, they will have lessons at home on the Internet. What's more, our environment will be better. There will be fewer cars, and the sky will be bluer. People will eat healthier food and exercise more. No matter how the world changes, love will never change. I'm looking forward to the life in the future! 译文: 二十年后的生活会是什么样子? 我想它将与现在大不相同。首先, 每个家庭都会有更多机器人, 它们帮我们做家务, 我们就会有更多空闲时间。其次, 电脑在生活中会更重要, 学生们不必每天去上学, 而是在家通过网络上课。而且, 环境会更好, 汽车会更少, 天空会更蓝, 人们会吃得更健康、锻炼得更多。无论世界如何变化, 爱永远不会改变。我期待着未来的生活!","extension":"变式训练: 缩小范围写「二十年后的学校」, 想象角度改为教室、课程与师生互动, 开头结尾句型照用; 注意全文保持一般将来时。","traps":null,"examFocus":null,"tags":["作文范文","想象话题","拓展提升"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"}]},{"uid":"english-29","name":"高阶语法突破","grade":"中考专题","order":28,"kps":[{"uid":"english-29-1","title":"非谓语动词总览: to do/doing/done选用框架","content":"非谓语三形式的选用总口诀： 「主动进行doing，主动目的to do，被动完成done」。决策框架三问： 一问「与逻辑主语的关系」——主动关系选doing/to do，被动关系选done： The story is exciting.(令人兴奋，主动义) / I am excited about the trip.(被逗兴奋) 二问「时间关系」——doing表正在进行或伴随： He stood there, looking at the picture.(一边站着一边看)；to do表将来/目的： He got up early to catch the train.；done表完成/被动： the risen sun, a broken cup。三问「句法位置」——作定语： a developing country(发展中)与a developed country(发达)；作宾补： see sb do/doing与have sth done(请人做)： I had my hair cut yesterday.。例句： ①Seeing from the hill, we found the village beautiful.——错例警示： 应为Seen from the hill(被动义) ②He has a lot of work to do.(to do定语) ③The machine was kept running all day.(doing持续)。非谓语是九年级到高中的衔接高地，先建框架再填细节。","keyPoints":["主动进行用doing；目的将来用to do；被动完成用done","exciting修饰物；excited修饰人","a developing country与a developed country对照","have sth done请人做: I had my hair cut","doing作伴随状语；to do作目的状语；done表被动完成"],"example":"例题： ______ from space, the earth looks like a blue ball. A.Seeing B.Seen C.To see D.Saw 解析： 逻辑主语the earth与see是被动关系(地球被看)，选B Seen。若主语换成we(我们看)，则选A Seeing。非谓语第一步永远是「找逻辑主语、判主被动」。","extension":"进阶： 独立主格与with复合结构(见专条)本质是「非谓语自带主语」；悬垂分词(逻辑主语缺失)在书面表达中按语病扣分。","traps":"错误一： Seeing from the hill...(主语we之外被动义场景误用doing)。错误二： I am interesting in...(应为interested)。错误三： have sth done误当「做了某事」(是「请人做」)。错误四： to do与doing的目的/伴随身份互换。","examFocus":"单选与语篇填空双考非谓语主被动判断；书面表达用非谓语压缩句子显高级。得分关键： 每次先问「谁做的」。","tags":["非谓语动词","高阶语法"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-29-2","title":"过去分词作定语与宾语补语初步","content":"过去分词(done)两大身份入门。①作定语： 位置两式——前置修饰： a broken window(破窗)， a lost boy, boiled water(开水), fallen leaves(落叶)；后置短语： the novels written by Lu Xun(鲁迅写的小说)， a girl named Lily(名叫莉莉的女孩)。与-ing分词对照口诀： 「-ing主动进行，-ed被动完成」： a moving film(感人的)与a moved audience(被感动的观众)；sleeping baby(正在睡)与sleeping car——规范： a sleeping car(卧铺车)类比。②作宾语补语： 「动词+宾语+done」表被动或状态： have sth done(请人做/遭遇)： I had my bike repaired. / She had her bag stolen on the bus.(遭遇)；find/see/leave+sth+done： When I came in, I found the window broken.(被发现是破的) / He left the work unfinished. 例句： ①The window is broken.(状态) ②The boy named Tom is my deskmate.(后置定语) ③I will have my watch fixed tomorrow.(请人修)。判断口诀： 名词后动词若与名词是被动关系且表完成，用done。","keyPoints":["前置定语: a broken window/boiled water/fallen leaves","后置定语: the novels written by Lu Xun","-ing主动进行；-ed被动完成","have sth done=请人做/遭遇","find/leave+sth+done表发现的状态"],"example":"例题： When I got home, I found all the windows ______. A.breaking B.broken C.to break D.broke 解析： windows与break是被动关系(窗被打破)，find+宾语+done表状态，选B。A是主动进行，C是将来目的，均不合。","extension":"进阶： 过去分词短语作状语表被动或原因： Seen from the hill, the town looks beautiful. / Given more time, we could do it better.；这两句是写作「一句两动作」的压缩神器。","traps":"错误一： a moved film(应为moving)。错误二： have my hair cut误当「我自己剪」。错误三： 后置定语写成前置(a written by Lu Xun novel错)。错误四： done与doing的身份在宾补位置互换。","examFocus":"单选考-ing/-ed对照与have sth done；语篇填空考分词形式判断。得分关键： 「逻辑主语主动还是被动」一票定形式。","tags":["非谓语动词","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-29-3","title":"how与what感叹句的选用公式","content":"感叹句选用公式口诀： 「How后裸形副，What后带名词」。How+形容词/副词+主谓： How beautiful the park is! / How fast he runs! What+(a/an)+形容词+名词+主谓： What a beautiful park it is! / What sweet music it is!(不可数无a) / What lovely children they are!(复数无a) 互转公式： How+形容词+主谓 = What+a/an+形容词+单数名词+主谓： How tall the building is! = What a tall building it is! 判断三步： ①看感叹部分是「裸形容词/副词」还是「名词短语」②名词短语再分单数可数(加a/an)、复数与不可数(裸)③感叹句语序仍是「感叹词+主谓」。省略式感叹： How time flies!(时间过得真快——how修饰整个句子) What about...?是提议不是感叹，勿混。例句： ①What a useful book it is!(单数加a) ②What fine weather we are having!(weather不可数) ③How bravely the firefighters fought!(副词)。写作开头用感叹句能立刻点亮全段。","keyPoints":["How+形容词/副词+主谓","What+(a/an)+形容词+名词+主谓","不可数与复数名词前无a/an: What sweet music","互转: How tall it is = What a tall...it is","How time flies!感叹整句"],"example":"例题： ______ great fun it is to swim in the river in summer! A.How B.What C.What a D.How a 解析： fun是不可数名词(趣事)，名词前感叹用What且不加a，选B。若题干是great weather同样选B；若是great time表「一段时光」则可加a(What a great time)。名词的可数性与是否加a是本题双重考点。","extension":"进阶： 感叹句可以倒装简化： How beautiful! / What a surprise!(省略主谓)；口语高频，书面写作完整式更稳妥。","traps":"错误一： What a beautiful it is!(a后裸代词，名词丢了) 错误二： How a nice day!(How后不能冠词名词) 错误三： 不可数前加a: What a bad weather错。错误四： How与What后面语序仍写成疑问倒装。","examFocus":"单选每年必考感叹句二选一；写作开头感叹句提气势。得分关键： 感叹部分「形」还是「名」，名词再看可数。","tags":["感叹句","中考高频"],"difficulty":2,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-29-4","title":"完全倒装初步: here/there开头的句子","content":"完全倒装公式口诀： 「here there提前走，主语放到动词后」。结构： here/there/then/now+谓语动词+主语，谓语与主语完全颠倒： Here comes the bus!(车来了) / There goes the bell!(铃响了) / Then came the teacher. / Now comes your turn. 两类规则： ①主语是名词时倒装： Here comes the bus. ②主语是代词时不倒装： Here he comes.(不说Here comes he) 时态限制： 此结构用一般现在时表「正在发生/即将」，不用进行时： Here comes the bus不说Here is coming the bus. 相近家族： out/in/up/down/away/off开头的完全倒装(拓展)： Out rushed the children. / Away flew the birds. / In came the teacher, book in hand. 例句： ①There goes the train; we are late again.(火车开走了) ②Here are the photos we took in Yunnan.(复数主语are) ③Down came the rain.(雨倾盆而下)。读故事时这类倒装是「镜头切换」的信号，写作中点缀一两句显节奏感。","keyPoints":["公式: here/there+谓语+主语(名词)","主语是代词不倒装: Here he comes","本结构用一般现在时，不用进行时","out/in/up/down/away开头也完全倒装(拓展)","There goes the bell=铃响了"],"example":"例题： Look! ______. A.Here comes the bus B.Here the bus comes C.Here is coming the bus D.The bus here comes 解析： 主语the bus是名词，here开头完全倒装，选A；B漏倒装；C误用进行时；D无倒装。若主语为代词，则说Here it comes。","extension":"进阶： 地点状语置于句首且主语较长时也完全倒装： On the hill stands an old tower.；这类「状语提前」倒装在描写文里非常出彩。","traps":"错误一： 代词主语强行倒装(Here comes he错)。错误二： 套进行时(Here is coming...)错。错误三： 与there be句型混淆(There goes表动作，There is表存在)。错误四： 倒装后主谓不一致(Here come the bus错，应comes)。","examFocus":"单选考「名词倒装代词不倒装」；阅读识别镜头切换句。得分关键： 认准here/there/out家族+名词主语。","tags":["倒装句","高阶语法"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-29-5","title":"with复合结构与独立主格初步","content":"with复合结构公式： with+名词+补语(形容词/副词/介词短语/doing/done/to do)，口诀「with带宾语，再带补语」。五类补语对照： with+名词+形容词(状态)： He slept with the window open.(开着窗睡) with+名词+副词： He was reading with the light on. with+名词+介词短语： A girl came in, with a smile on her face. with+名词+doing(主动进行)： With the boy leading the way, we found the house easily. with+名词+done(被动完成)： He sat there with his eyes fixed on the screen. with+名词+to do(将来)： With so much work to do, I can not go out.。独立主格初步： 去掉with的「名词+分词」结构独立作状语，主语与主句主语不同： The bell ringing, the students went back to the classroom.(铃响着，学生们回教室) / Time permitting, we will go fishing. 例句： ①He left the room with all the lights on.(五类之副词) ②The old man sat quietly, with his dog lying at his feet.(doing伴随) ③With the work finished, we went home happily.(done完成)。此结构是「一句话装两件事」的压缩器。","keyPoints":["公式: with+名词+补语，补语五类: 形/副/介短/doing/done","doing主动进行；done被动完成；to do将来","with结构作状语表伴随、方式、原因","独立主格=名词+分词，自带主语与主句主语不同","with his eyes fixed on(被动义done)"],"example":"例题： With a lot of difficult problems ______, the newly elected president is having a hard time. A.settled B.to settle C.settling D.be settled 解析： problems是「要去解决」的(将来未做)，with+名词+to do，选B。若语境是「问题已解决」，则选A settled。","extension":"进阶： 独立主格在小说开头常见： Night coming on, we set out for home.；读长难句先找「名词+分词」这个自带主语的小句子。","traps":"错误一： doing与done身份互换(eyes fixing错，应fixed)。错误二： with结构误当完整句子单独成句。错误三： 独立主格写成从句却无连词。错误四： 忽略to do表将来的未做义。","examFocus":"单选拓展题考五类补语选择；完形长难句靠with结构提速。得分关键： 「主动doing、被动done、未做to do」三分。","tags":["with结构","高难拓展"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-29-6","title":"it的用法系统: 形式主语/形式宾语/强调句","content":"it三大高级身份。①形式主语： it代替「to do/that从句」位于句首，真主语后置，公式： It is+形容词/名词+(for/of sb)+to do： It is important for us to learn English well. / It is kind of you to help me.(人品质形容词用of) It takes sb some time to do sth. ②形式宾语： it代替复合宾语中的to do/从句，公式： 主语+find/think/make/feel+it+形容词/名词+to do： I find it hard to get up early in winter. / The Internet makes it possible for us to shop at home. ③强调句(拓展)： It is/was+被强调部分+that/who+其余： He met an old friend in the park yesterday. → It was in the park that he met an old friend yesterday.(强调地点) / It was he who/that met an old friend...(强调主语)。判断强调句的妙招： 去掉It is...that句子仍完整。例句： ①It is no use crying over spilt milk.(真主语crying) ②I think it necessary to take notes in class.(形式宾语) ③It was not until midnight that he came back.(not until强调)。三大身份让it成为英语最高频的词。","keyPoints":["形式主语: It is+adj+(for/of sb)+to do","It takes sb time to do sth","形式宾语: find/think/make+it+adj+to do","强调句: It is+被强调部分+that/who+其余","not until的强调: It was not until...that..."],"example":"例题： It was in the small house ______ Mr. Green spent his childhood. A.which B.that C.where D.when 解析： 强调句测试： 去掉It was与that后句子Mr. Green spent his childhood in the small house完整成立，故为强调句选B that。若选where则成定语从句，但spent缺状语时不通。","extension":"进阶： 强调句可强调主语、宾语、状语，但不能强调谓语动词；强调人时that可换who。写作中not until强调句是压轴句式。","traps":"错误一： 强调句误判为定语从句(用判断法： 去掉框架句子仍完整)。错误二： It is kind for you(人品质用of)。错误三： 形式宾语漏it: I find hard to...(错)。错误四： 强调时间状语时误用when(强调句一律that)。","examFocus":"单选考强调句与形式主宾语；语篇填空给it开头的长句判断身份。得分关键： it后看「真主语在哪」。","tags":["it用法","高阶语法"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-29-7","title":"省略与替代现象: so/one/that的替代","content":"英语忌重复，两大机制口诀： 「能省则省，能替则替」。①so替代上文的形容词、名词短语或肯定句： The weather is sunny and will remain so.(so=sunny) —Will it rain tomorrow? —I hope not.(省略it will rain，not承接) ②one替代上文的「同类单数可数名词」，it特指「同一个」： I lost my pen. I have to buy one.(one=任意一支新笔) / I found your pen and I am using it.(it=同一支) ones与those: these apples are bigger than those on the tree.(those=the ones) ③do so/do it替代动作： He said he would come, but he did not do so. ④状语从句省略(主句主语与从句主语一致+be动词时，省「主语+be」)： When (it is) heated, ice turns into water. / While (she was) reading, she fell asleep. / If (it is) possible, please come earlier. 例句： ①My radio is broken. I will buy a new one.(同类替代) ②—Is he a teacher? —I believe so.(so=that he is) ③Though (he was) tired, he kept on working.。识别省略与替代是读长难句的润滑剂。","keyPoints":["so替代形容词/名词短语/肯定陈述: I think so","one泛指同类之一；it特指同一个","those=the ones替代复数同类","do so/do it替代动作","状语从句省略「主语+be」: When heated..."],"example":"例题： The apples in this basket are fresher than ______ in that one. A.those B.ones C.it D.them 解析： 替代复数同类且带限定(在那篮里的那些)，用those(=the ones)，选A。B缺the；C单数；D是宾格不能作主语。","extension":"进阶： not...but also...并列中后项省略与前项相同的成分；新闻标题省冠词与be动词(Eight Injured in Fire)；这些都是「经济原则」的体现。","traps":"错误一： one与it混用(特指同一物用了one)。错误二： I think not so(应I do not think so或I hope not)。错误三： those后漏限定(比较对象不明)。错误四： 省略从句中误省实义动词。","examFocus":"单选考one/it/those替代；阅读长难句靠省略识别提速。得分关键： 「泛指同类用one/those，特指同一用it」。","tags":["省略与替代","阅读能力"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-29-8","title":"构词法深化: 高频前缀后缀清单","content":"派生法进阶清单，按「改义前缀、改性后缀」两栏背。前缀(改意义不改词性)： 否定三兄弟 un-/dis-/in-(im-,ir-,il-特殊变体)： unhappy, unfair, disagree, dislike, impossible, irregular, illegal；再/回 re-: return, rebuild, reuse, recall；误 mis-: mistake, misunderstand；过度 over-: overeat, oversleep；不足 under-: underweight；提前 pre-: preview, prepare(词源)；后缀(改词性)： 名词后缀 -er/-or/-ist(人)： worker, inventor, scientist；-ian(人)： musician, magician；-tion/-sion(动作名词)： invention, decision, discussion；-ment: development, agreement；-ness: kindness, happiness；-ship: friendship, relationship；-hood: childhood；-ance/-ence: importance, difference。形容词后缀： -ful/-less互为反义： careful/careless, helpful/helpless；-y: rainy, windy, sunny；-ous: dangerous, famous；-ive: active, expensive；-able: comfortable, enjoyable；-al: natural, musical。副词后缀 -ly: quickly, badly, gently。例句： ①It is impossible to finish it without help.(im-否定) ②Musician comes from music, meaning a person who plays music.(词根义) ③The teacher spoke highly of our hard work.(highly副词)。见生词先拆缀，词义词性双推出。","keyPoints":["否定前缀: un-/dis-/in-(im/ir/il变体)","re-再；mis-误；over-过度；under-不足","名词后缀: -er/-or/-ist/-ian/-tion/-ment/-ness/-ship","形容词后缀: -ful与-less互为反义","-ly形容词变副词；-able表能够"],"example":"例题： 用所给词的适当形式填空： The boy showed great ______ (clever) in working out the puzzle. 解析： 形容词clever加名词后缀-ness变名词cleverness作showed的宾语。空格在形容词great后，需要名词，「见形容词找名词后缀」是语篇填空的固定动作。","extension":"进阶： 同根词族按「词根+缀」成串记： care-careful-carefully-carelessness一条线记四词；词汇量以族为单位翻倍。","traps":"错误一： possible误加un-(应为impossible)。错误二： -er与-or乱配(inventor不是inventer)。错误三： 名词后缀张冠李戴(needs -ness写成-nees)。错误四： 词性判断错导致填空错位。","examFocus":"语篇填空「给词变形」题的主力命题点。得分关键： 空格词性→选后缀，前缀只改义不改性。","tags":["构词法","词汇拓展"],"difficulty":2,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-29-9","title":"合成词与转化词: 构词法另两翼","content":"合成法与转化法补全构词版图。①合成名词——名词+名词： classroom, basketball, bookstore；动词加er转名词： swimmer, runner, driver；形容词+名词： blackboard, greenhouse(温室——望文生义陷阱)。②合成形容词(中考高频)——数词+名词单数： a five-day trip, a ten-minute walk(内部用单数加连字符)；名词+过去分词： man-made satellites(人造卫星)；名词+现在分词： an English-speaking country(说英语的国家)；形容词+名词-ed: a warm-hearted old man(热心的)。③转化词(词性转换不变形)： 名转动： hand me the book(递)；water the flowers(浇水)；book a ticket(预订)。形转动： clean the window(擦干净)；warm up the milk。动转名： Let us go out for a walk.(walk名词)。例句： ①China has sent up many man-made satellites.(man-made合成形容词) ②We had a two-month holiday last year.(two-month) ③Please hand in your papers before Friday.(hand in动词短语)。合成形容词的「内部单数」是完形与语篇填空的双重考点。","keyPoints":["合成名词: classroom/blackboard/greenhouse","合成形容词内部用单数: a five-day trip","名词+过去分词: man-made satellites","名词+现在分词: an English-speaking country","转化词: hand递/water浇水/book预订/clean擦"],"example":"例题： The visitors will stay in our city for ______. A.five day B.five days C.a five-day D.a five-days 解析： 作定语修饰单数visit须带冠词与连字符： a five-day visit；题干直接说「停留五天」用B five days(作状语)。合成形容词「单数+连字符」与普通复数表达要分清。","extension":"进阶： greenhouse effect(温室效应)望文生义为「绿色房子」是经典阅读陷阱；转化词使一词顶多词，词典按义项分层记。","traps":"错误一： 合成形容词内部用复数(five-days错)。错误二： man-made写成man-make。错误三： greenhouse按字面理解为绿屋。错误四： 转化词词性不辨(hand当名词死译)。","examFocus":"语篇填空考合成形容词单数；阅读考转化词多义。得分关键： 「合成看单数，转化看词性」。","tags":["构词法","词汇拓展"],"difficulty":2,"type":"extension"}]},{"uid":"english-30","name":"完形与阅读解题体系","grade":"中考专题","order":29,"kps":[{"uid":"english-30-1","title":"完形填空逻辑衔接词体系: 转折因果递进并列","content":"完形填空的本质是「句间关系判断」，衔接词是路标。四大逻辑家族清单： ①并列与递进(and家族)： and, or, as well as, both...and；递进： besides, what is more, in addition, moreover——前后同向加强： He can sing. What is more, he dances well. ②转折与让步(but家族)： but, however, yet, while(然而)， though, although——前后反向： He is young. However, he knows a lot. ③因果(so家族)： because, so, therefore, as a result——前因后果： It rained heavily. As a result, the sports meeting was put off. ④解释与总结： that is, in other words；in a word, in short。做题步骤： 先读空格前后两句→判断「同向/反向/因果」→到选项里找对应家族。示范段落： The boy was poor at math. ______, he never gave up and asked the teacher for help after class. ——空格处若选However则前后矛盾(后句是坚持不是放弃)，应选表示递进或直接顺承： 选therefore不通，此处最佳为递进式顺承Actually/Besides类。例句对照： ①He got up late; however, he was not late.(转折) ②The box was heavy, so the little boy could not carry it.(因果) ③First...then...finally(顺序)。衔接词读懂了，完形一半的分就到手了。","keyPoints":["并列递进: and/besides/what is more/in addition","转折让步: but/however/yet/though/although","因果: because/so/therefore/as a result","解释总结: that is/in other words/in a word","判断步骤: 空格前后两句同向还是反向"],"example":"例题： The old man was tired. ______, he kept working until the work was done. A.Because B.However C.Besides D.As a result 解析： 后句「坚持干完」与「累」构成让步转折，however表尽管如此；C表递进但前无待加信息；A、D因果不通。逻辑家族一选，答案即现。","extension":"进阶： while作「然而」表对比： Some like sports, while others like reading.；此时while不是「当...时候」，完形里是高阶干扰项。","traps":"错误一： however当连词用(however是副词需逗号，不能像but直接连两句为一句不加标点)。错误二： 见so就选因果，不看前句是否真是原因。错误三： 递进与转折家族混用。错误四： 忽略句间关系的「隐形转折」(无连词但语义相反)。","examFocus":"完形每年4至6空直接考逻辑衔接词；单选也考连词辨析。得分关键： 先判前后句义方向，再挑家族成员。","tags":["完形填空","逻辑关系"],"difficulty":2,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-30-2","title":"完形填空感情色彩一致原则","content":"完形的隐形规则： 全文感情基调一致，口诀「首段定基调，褒贬不跑调」。三步用法： ①读首段抓基调： 积极叙事(bright, hopeful, warm)或消极叙事(sad, nervous, cold)，基调一旦确定，选词必须同色。②空格词的色彩要与上下文同频： 基调是「紧张备战」，中间突然出现relaxed类词就要警惕——除非情节有转折词。③结尾常呼应首段(首尾呼应)。实战示范： Tim was nervous before the speech. His hands ______ and his voice was low. 空格应选「发抖」义的trembled(消极色)，而不是danced(积极色)。再如： Though the trip was tiring, we all felt ______ when we reached the top. ——后半有though与reach the top(登顶)，填excited(积极)。例句对照： ①The little girl smiled brightly when she saw her mother.(brightly与smiled同频) ②He failed again, but he did not lose heart.(but后必须接积极词) ③To our joy, everyone passed the exam.(joy定全段亮色)。把「色彩一致」当第二遍检查的滤镜，专杀似是而非的选项。","keyPoints":["首段(尤其首句)定全文感情基调","褒贬色彩前后一致，转折词处才允许换色","结尾常与首段呼应","积极词: bright/hopeful/warm/excited；消极词: nervous/sad/cold/worried","第二遍检查用「色彩滤镜」过滤选项"],"example":"例题： The boy looked ______ because he lost his favorite watch. A.happy B.sad C.excited D.interested 解析： lost his favorite watch是消极事件，色彩一致选B sad。A、C积极色与语境矛盾；D与丢表无关联。","extension":"进阶： 人物心理变化线是完形叙事的主轴(担忧→尝试→成功)；沿心理线选词比逐空硬看更稳，这也是「先抓主线」的价值所在。","traps":"错误一： 只看空格前后五个词，忽略全篇基调。错误二： 转折词后仍用原色调词。错误三： 把描写词与情节词的色彩混搭。错误四： 结尾选词与首段呼应失配。","examFocus":"完形中形容词与副词空(每年3至4个)主要靠色彩一致破解。得分关键： 先定色再选词。","tags":["完形填空","解题方法"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-30-3","title":"阅读细节理解题定位法: 题文同序","content":"细节题是阅读的基本盘，解法口诀： 「题文同序，关键词回文，同义改写是答案」。三大定律： ①题文同序——题目顺序与原文行文顺序基本一致，第1题答案通常在文章前部，第3题在后部；卡壳时先做下一题再回推。②关键词定位——题干中的专有名词、数字、时间是定位锚： 题干问When did the writer start painting？回文找时间词。③同义改写——正确答案几乎都是原文的paraphrase： 原文 The library opens at 8:00 am. 选项写成 It opens early in the morning.；照抄原文原话的选项多为陷阱(偷换主语、扩大范围、因果倒置)。选项排错三刀： 范围过大(绝对词all/never/only警惕)、与原文相反、原文未提。例句示范： 原文 Lily practiced the violin for two hours every day after school. 题目 How long did Lily practice the violin each day？ 答案 Two hours.(两小时，数字定位)。做细节题的正确节奏是「定位→比对→排除」，不凭印象答题。","keyPoints":["题文同序: 题目顺序与原文顺序一致","关键词定位: 专有名词/数字/时间是锚点","正确答案多为原文同义改写","照抄原文的选项常是陷阱","绝对词all/never/only出现先存疑"],"example":"例题： 原文 In 1998, Mr. Green came to China and taught English in a middle school. 题目： When did Mr. Green come to China? 解析： 用1998作定位锚，回文比对即可得答案In 1998；若选项出现He came to China to travel则属「原文未提+目的偷换」，排除。定位→比对→排除三步走。","extension":"进阶： 是非判断题(Which of the following is TRUE?)是细节题变体，需逐项回文验证；这类题用「排除法+最后一项默认检查」最稳。","traps":"错误一： 凭常识与印象作答，不回原文。错误二： 被照抄原文的选项迷惑(未做改写)。错误三： 定位错段落答非所问。错误四： 绝对词选项不存疑。","examFocus":"细节题占阅读分值一半以上(6至8题)。得分关键： 每题都走「定位→改写比对」流程，杜绝语感猜题。","tags":["阅读理解","细节题"],"difficulty":2,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-30-4","title":"阅读推理判断题: infer与suggest题型","content":"推理题考「原文没直说但能推出」的信息，口诀「推理有据，不越原文」。题干标志词： infer(推断)， suggest(暗示)， learn from the passage(从文中可知)， imply, conclude, the writer probably...。解题三步： ①找原文依据句(推理题的答案必有「证据句」) ②做「一步推理」——只往前推一小步，不做两级跳 ③排除两类错误项： 照抄原文(那是细节不是推理)与过度推理(原文无据)。示范： 原文 The boy looked at his watch twice and walked up and down the platform. → 推理 He was waiting for someone and feeling anxious.(等人心焦——一步推理) 错误示范： He missed his train.(二级跳，原文无据)。常见推理类型： 人物情绪(从动作神态推)、地点场合(从场景词推)、下文走向(从结尾悬念推)。例句： ①原文 She put the letter into her pocket without reading it. → 推理 The letter might make her sad, so she did not want to read it at once.(suggest题型) ②原文 Prices in the city keep rising. → 推理 People may find life there more difficult.(infer题型) ③原文 The classroom was quiet; everyone was reading. → 推理 It was during a reading class.。推理题答对的秘密是「找到那句证据」。","keyPoints":["标志词: infer/suggest/learn from the passage","推理只做一步，不做二级跳","照抄原文的选项不是推理答案","过度推理(原文无据)必错","推理类型: 情绪/场合/下文走向"],"example":"例题： 原文 When the singer appeared, the fans stood up and cheered with tears in their eyes. 题目： We can infer that ______. A.the fans were sad about the news B.the fans loved the singer very much C.the singer was a dancer D.the fans did not know the singer 解析： 起立欢呼含泪是狂喜的一步推理，选B；A偷换情绪，C原文未提职业细节，D与场面矛盾。","extension":"进阶： 「作者态度题」是推理题的亲戚(选项常见positive/negative/neutral)；从形容词副词的褒贬色彩推态度。","traps":"错误一： 选原文原句(细节项混入)。错误二： 凭自己生活经验脑补(越原文半步即错)。错误三： 把maybe类谨慎项当错项(推理题常选含may/might的稳妥表述)。错误四： 情绪推理与事实推理混淆。","examFocus":"阅读每年2至3道推理题，是拉开差距的题型。得分关键： 每道推理题先写出「证据句」再选答案。","tags":["阅读理解","推理判断"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-30-5","title":"阅读主旨大意题: 首尾段与高频词法","content":"主旨题问「这篇文章讲什么/最好的标题是什么」，口诀「首尾看两段，高频词串线，概括不越界」。三件工具： ①首尾段——中文英语作文都爱总分总，主题句常在首段末或尾段；新闻报道则首句即主题。②高频词——全文反复出现的词(及同义复现)是主题词： 讲环保的文章里environment, protect, pollution反复出现。③选项三筛——筛掉「细节项」(只覆盖某一段)、筛掉「过宽项」(超出文章范围)、筛掉「无据项」。标题(title)型答案的额外特征： 短小、有概括力、最好有点睛词。示范： 全文各段分别讲公园晨跑的老人、跳舞的阿姨、打拳的大爷 → 主旨是 Morning activities in the park(概括)，而Dancing in the park只覆盖一段(细节项)。例句对照： ①The passage is mainly about ______. A.a new school B.a school sports meeting C.a basketball game D.running —— 若全文围绕运动会整体展开，选B(篮球赛只是一项，D过窄)。②The best title may be ______. 答案常为名词短语。主旨题最后做，做完细节题再回头更清晰。","keyPoints":["主题句常在首段末或尾段","高频词与同义复现串出主题词","筛掉细节项/过宽项/无据项","标题型答案: 名词短语，概括而不空洞","主旨题放最后做，借细节题通览全文"],"example":"例题： 全文第一段讲科学家担心塑料污染，第二段讲实验发现某种细菌能分解塑料，第三段讲这一发现的意义。题目： What is the best title for the passage? A.A New Kind of Bacteria B.Plastic Pollution Around Us C.Bacteria That Eat Plastic D.Life of Scientists 解析： A只覆盖二段细节；B只覆盖背景；D无据；C把「细菌+吃塑料」这一全文主线串起，选C。","extension":"进阶： 段落大意题(What is Paragraph 2 mainly about?)用同样的「段首句+高频词」法；图表类文章主旨常在首句给出现象后提问原因。","traps":"错误一： 选细节项(以段代篇)。错误二： 选过宽项(超出文本谈世界)。错误三： 标题选成完整句子(标题应是短语)。错误四： 凭首段第一句定终身(有的首句只是引入)。","examFocus":"阅读每年1至2道主旨题，决定能否上高分档。得分关键： 首尾段+高频词双确认再落笔。","tags":["阅读理解","主旨大意"],"difficulty":2,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-30-6","title":"语篇填空有提示词: 动词形式判断法","content":"语篇填空的「给词空」七成考动词，判断口诀： 「先定时态，再定语态，最后定非谓语」。动词题决策树： ①空格在谓语位置(有主语、构成句子主干)→判断时态(找时间标志词)+主谓一致(看主语单复)+语态(主语是执行者还是承受者)： The park ______ (build) in 1998. → was built(过去+被动)。②空格非谓语位置(句子已有谓语，动词前有to/介词/逗号)→选非谓语形式： He wants ______ (be) a doctor. → to be；Thank you for ______ (help) me. → helping；______ (see) from the hill, the town looks beautiful. → Seen(被动)。③名词提示词→单复数与所有格： two ______ (box) → boxes。④形容词提示词→比较级最高级或变副词： even ______ (good) → better；run ______ (quick) → quickly。⑤代词提示词→格与反身： Help ______ (you) to some fish. → yourselves。例句： ①Look! The children ______ (fly) kites. → are flying ②The novel ______ (write) by Lu Xun is popular. → written(后置定语) ③It is one of the ______ (move) films. → most moving。给词空的本质是「词形变化题」，规则全在语法体系里。","keyPoints":["谓语位置: 时态+主谓一致+语态三连判断","非谓语位置: to do/doing/done按关系选","名词给词: 单复数；形容词给词: 比较级或副词","代词给词: 格与反身代词","找时间标志词是动词题第一步"],"example":"例题： Last year the bridge ______ (repair) by the workers, and now it ______ (look) new. 解析： 前空last year+桥被修： was repaired；后空now+桥看起来新： looks(三单主动)。一题内考「时态切换+被动与主动对照」。","extension":"进阶： 动词题叠加「主从句时态呼应」： He said the meeting ______ (begin) at nine. → would begin；宾从呼应是语篇填空的最高频复合考点。","traps":"错误一： 非谓语空填了谓语形式。错误二： 被动空丢be。错误三： 忽略三单。错误四： 名词空漏复数(box→boxes)。","examFocus":"语篇填空给词空每年7个左右，动词占大头。得分关键： 每个动词空先问「谓语还是非谓语」。","tags":["语篇填空","给词变形"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-30-7","title":"语篇填空无提示词: 冠介连代虚词填空法","content":"无提示词空只考「虚词」，四大清单口诀： 「冠介连代，虚词四家」。①冠词： a/an(泛指单数可数，看读音)、the(特指/独一无二/最高级序数词前)： I have ______ interesting book. → an；play ______ piano. → the。②介词： 看搭配与句义——时间地点固定搭配： on Sunday morning, at six；动词短语搭配： listen to, look after, be good at, be interested in；比较搭配： than, as。③连词： 并列(and/but/or)、从属(when/if/because/so that/although)、引导宾从(that/if/wh-)： I think ______ you are right. → that(可省则不出题)；He asked ______ I had finished. → if。④代词与助词： it(形式主语/指代)、one/those(替代)、so/not(替代句)；感叹词how/what；as...as中间的原级空。判断步骤： 看空格前后词性——名词前空先想冠词/介词；两句之间空想连词；句首空想从属连词或感叹词。例句： ①It is kind ______ you to help me. → of ②The more you read, ______ more you learn. → the ③He is ______ honest boy that everyone likes him. → such an。虚词空考的是「搭配记忆量」，得分靠平时积累短语。","keyPoints":["冠词空: a/an看读音；the表特指","介词空: 固定搭配与时间地点搭配","连词空: 并列/从属/宾从引导词","代词空: it/one/those/so","判断步骤: 空前后词性→锁定虚词家族"],"example":"例题： This is ______ useful dictionary that I have read it twice. 解析： useful后接that从句，是so...that或such...that结构；useful是形容词，前用so： so useful a dictionary that...或such a useful dictionary that...。本题考「冠词+结构词」复合空。","extension":"进阶： 「so+形容词+a/an+单数名词」与「such+a/an+形容词+名词」互为改写；无提示空出现这种双答案结构时按题号只填一词。","traps":"错误一： 把名词空当介词空。错误二： a honest(an honest读音规则)。错误三： 并列连词与从属连词混淆。错误四： 宾从空误填if于陈述句。","examFocus":"语篇填空无提示词空每年3个左右，冠介连代轮换命题。得分关键： 背熟高频搭配短语+冠词读音规则。","tags":["语篇填空","虚词"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-30-8","title":"任务型阅读信息转换: 同义改写与词性转换","content":"任务型阅读的核心动作是「信息转换」，两大转换器口诀： 「同义改写换说法，词性转换换形态」。①同义改写型： 原文与答案互为paraphrase——原文 The bag is so heavy that I can not carry it. 题目要求完成句子： The bag is ______ heavy for me ______ carry. → too...to。常见同义改写对： more than=over；at once=right away；not...any more=no longer；almost=nearly。②词性转换型： 表格栏目定词性——原文 They planted trees on the hill.(动词) 表格栏目为Activity(名词栏)： tree planting；原文 The tower was built in 1896. 表格栏目Time： in 1896(照抄)；栏目Feature： historic(需概括词)。③句式转换型： 原文主动句转题目被动句： We should protect the earth. → The earth should ______ (protect). → be protected。④回答问题型： 按疑问词答+词数限制+时态呼应(见「任务型阅读答题规范」)。例句： ①原文 take care of → 答案 look after ②原文 quickly → 答案 at once/right away ③原文 It took us two hours to get there. → 答案 We spent two hours getting there.。转换题的本质是「换个说法不改意」。","keyPoints":["同义改写对: more than=over；at once=right away","词性转换按表格栏目定","句式转换: 主动↔被动；too...to↔so...that","回答问题型守词数与时态呼应","答案照原文改写，不凭记忆编"],"example":"例题： 原文 Lily could not fall asleep because of the noise outside. 题目： The noise outside kept Lily ______. 解析： 原文「因噪音睡不着」同义转换为 keep sb awake： 填awake(醒着的)。同义改写类要求「意思等值+词形匹配」双重对齐。","extension":"进阶： 数字转换(1,000→one thousand；半小时→half an hour)与大小写转换(句首大写)也属信息转换；交卷前用「格式三查」过一遍。","traps":"错误一： 照抄原文整句(未转换)。错误二： 词性转换后拼写错(planting漏t双写注意)。错误三： 超词数。错误四： 时态与问句不呼应。","examFocus":"任务型阅读(10分上下)主打信息转换。得分关键： 转换前后句意等值，格式规范。","tags":["任务型阅读","信息转换"],"difficulty":2,"type":"extension"}]},{"uid":"english-31","name":"书面表达高分突破","grade":"中考专题","order":30,"kps":[{"uid":"english-31-1","title":"两句合一: 用定语从句升级简单句","content":"定语从句是「合并句子」的官方工具，口诀「两句话共享一个名词，合并成一句」。合并三步： ①找两句共享的名词(先行词) ②把第二句换成who/which/that引导的从句 ③挂到先行词后面。示范： 原句 Li Hua is my best friend. + He often helps me with math. 合并 → Li Hua, who often helps me with math, is my best friend. 或 My best friend is Li Hua, who often helps me with math. 常用升级模板： ①人物介绍： ...is a person who...(他是一个...的人)： My mother is a woman who never gives up. ②事物描述： ...is a place where...(这是一个...的地方)： The park is a place where families spend weekends together. ③时间纪念： I will never forget the day when...(我永远忘不了...那天)。范文片段： I have a friend called Tom, who is always ready to help others. / The book which was written by Lu Xun is my favorite. 例句升级对照： 原句 Beijing is our capital. It has a long history. 合并 → Beijing, which has a long history, is our capital.。一篇作文合并两处，档次立刻上一级。","keyPoints":["合并公式: 共享名词作先行词+who/which从句","人物模板: ...is a person who...","地点模板: ...is a place where...","时间模板: I will never forget the day when...","非限制性从句(逗号+who/which)用于补充说明"],"example":"例题： 将两个句子合并为一句(含定语从句)： The girl is my sister. She is dancing over there. 解析： 共享名词the girl，第二句改造成who is dancing over there： The girl who is dancing over there is my sister.。注意关系代词后语序仍是陈述序。","extension":"进阶： 「逗号+which」可指代前面整句话： He passed the exam, which made his mother happy.(which指代整件事)；这一高级用法是满分作文的常客。","traps":"错误一： 合并后重复主语(The girl who she is dancing...)。错误二： 关系词误配(人用which)。错误三： 合并后两个谓语并存却无连词。错误四： 滥用导致一句话三个从句。","examFocus":"书面表达档次分的核心指标；单选也考合并与拆分。得分关键： 每篇作文合并1至2处即可，宁精勿滥。","tags":["写作高分","定语从句"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-31-2","title":"非谓语与倒装在写作中的高级运用","content":"两大「压缩与点睛」工具。①非谓语压缩(把两句压成一句)： 伴随状语版——原句 He sat on the grass. + He was reading a novel. 压缩 → He sat on the grass, reading a novel.(一边坐一边读)；原因版 Being tired, he stopped to rest.；结果版 He got up late, missing the early bus.(结果错过了早班车)；to do目的版 To catch the first bus, he got up at five. ②倒装点睛(一篇文章一处即可)： not only...but also句首倒装： Not only did we finish the work, but we also helped others.；so+形容词/副词前置倒装： So moving was the film that many people cried.；here/there倒装： There stands an old tower on the hill.。范文片段： Standing on the top of the hill, we enjoyed the beautiful view of the whole city.(非谓语开场) Not only does reading bring me knowledge, but it also opens a window to the world.(倒装议论)。例句对照： 原句 We were tired. We were happy. 升级 → Tired as we were, we felt happy inside.(as倒装让步，拓展)。使用纪律： 每篇1至2处，出错的高级句式不如准确的简单句。","keyPoints":["伴随状语: doing放主句后加逗号","目的状语to do可置句首","Not only句首要部分倒装","So+形/副前置倒装: So moving was the film","每篇作文高级句式控制在1至2处"],"example":"例题： 用非谓语合并： He is a student. He studies hard. He hopes to be a doctor. 解析： 压缩为 As a student, he studies hard, hoping to be a doctor.。一句话装下三个信息，字数还省了——这正是高分作文的「信息密度」。","extension":"进阶： Tired as we were属as倒装让步(=Though we were tired)；读范文学结构，写作用一处即可。","traps":"错误一： doing伴随状语的逻辑主语与主句不一致(悬垂分词)。错误二： Not only句首忘倒装。错误三： So moving was the film写成So the film was moving。错误四： 高级句式堆砌致语法错反被扣分。","examFocus":"书面表达冲最高档(一类文)的关键筹码。得分关键： 非谓语压信息，倒装提气势，各用一处。","tags":["写作高分","非谓语动词"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-31-3","title":"强调句与it句型在写作中的点睛","content":"写作三件「it工具」。①强调句(突出关键信息)： It is/was+被强调部分+that+其余——结尾点题最有力： It is our hard work that makes the dream come true.(正是努力让梦想成真) 强调not until： It was not until then that I understood my mother. ②it形式主语(避免头重脚轻)： It is important/necessary/possible for us to...；It takes time to...；It is said that...(据说)： It is said that the writer will visit our school. ③it固定句式： It is no use doing...(做...没用)；It is a pity that...(遗憾的是)；It seems that...(似乎)： It seems that the weather is getting warmer.。范文片段(结尾点题)： It is love and trust that build a warm family. / It is necessary for us teenagers to learn to be independent. 例句对照： 原句 We should protect the environment. 升级 → It is high time that we took action to protect the environment.(该采取行动了——虚拟语气拓展)。it句型让观点句「站得高」，强调句让主题句「落得重」。","keyPoints":["强调句: It is+被强调部分+that+其余","not until强调: It was not until...that...","形式主语: It is important for sb to do","It is said that.../It seems that...","It is no use doing.../It is a pity that..."],"example":"例题： 用强调句强调划线部分： We won the game because of our teamwork. 解析： 强调because of our teamwork： It was because of our teamwork that we won the game.。检验法： 去掉It was...that后原句能还原即为强调句。","extension":"进阶： It is high time that+过去式(该做...了)是虚拟语气入口，写作结尾用它提号召极有分量；注意that后用过去式。","traps":"错误一： 强调句误用when/where(一律that)。错误二： 强调谓语(强调句不能强调动词)。错误三： 形式主语句漏掉真主语。错误四： It is no use to do(应doing)。","examFocus":"书面表达点题句与结尾句的标配。得分关键： 结尾用一句强调句收束全文。","tags":["写作高分","it用法"],"difficulty":2,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-31-4","title":"话题词汇库: 观点表达与建议句型","content":"议论与建议类作文的「弹药库」，按功能背。①表达观点： In my opinion, ...；I think/believe that...；As far as I know, ...(就我所知)；It seems to me that... ②列举理由： First of all...；What is more/Besides...；Last but not least(最后但同样重要)： First, reading opens my eyes. What is more, it helps me relax. Last but not least, books are our best friends. ③给建议句型清单： You should/had better...；Why not do...？(何不)；How about doing...？；It is a good idea to...；If I were you, I would...(如果我是你——虚拟语气拓展)： If I were you, I would take more exercise. ④表达赞同与反对： I agree with you that...；I can not agree more.(我非常同意)；I am afraid I have a different idea.(委婉反对)。范文片段： In my opinion, we teenagers should take part in more outdoor activities. First of all, it keeps us healthy. What is more, we can make more friends. 例句： ①Why not join us and have fun together？(建议) ②I can not agree more.(强烈赞同)。建议类作文(给笔友、给同学提建议)每年高频，这套句型直接套。","keyPoints":["观点句: In my opinion.../I believe that...","列举: First of all/What is more/Last but not least","建议句: Why not do.../How about doing/You had better","虚拟建议: If I were you, I would...","委婉反对: I am afraid I have a different idea"],"example":"例题： 翻译句子： 依我看，我们最好每天锻炼半小时。 解析： In my opinion, we had better take exercise for half an hour every day.。had better后接动词原形；「依我看」用In my opinion起句，观点句+建议句组合。","extension":"进阶： I can not agree more字面是「不能再同意」即「非常同意」，双重否定表强烈肯定；写作中用它替换I agree很加分。","traps":"错误一： Why not doing(应Why not do)。错误二： had better to do(应接原形)。错误三： If I were you后用will(虚拟用would)。错误四： Last but not least漏写not。","examFocus":"建议类与观点类书面表达每年轮考。得分关键： 观点句+三个列举句+建议句全套上。","tags":["写作高分","话题词汇"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-31-5","title":"话题词汇库: 描写与情感类高级表达","content":"记叙与写人作文的「上色盘」，按场景分层背。①人物描写(外貌与性格)： 外貌——with long hair, wear glasses, of medium height, a warm smile on the face；性格——kind-hearted(热心的)， hard-working, easy-going(随和的)， ready to help others： My teacher is a kind-hearted woman with a warm smile. ②心情描写(替代happy/sad的升级词)： 开心——excited, cheerful, over the moon(欣喜若狂)；紧张——nervous, with my heart beating fast；难过——down, sad, with tears in the eyes： Before the speech, I was so nervous that my hands were shaking. ③场景描写(五感法)： 视觉 The sky turned orange at sunset.；听觉 The birds were singing in the trees.；触觉 The wind touched my face gently. ④动作链(让叙事有画面)： got up, washed, hurried to, rushed into, took a deep breath： I took a deep breath, walked onto the stage and began my speech.。范文片段： My mother is of medium height, with silver hair and a warm smile. Whenever I am down, she always cheers me up with gentle words. 例句： ①To my joy, the performance was a great success.(情感) ②The little girl smiled brightly, showing her white teeth.(画面)。描写词一换，文章立刻「有镜头感」。","keyPoints":["外貌: with long hair/of medium height/a warm smile","性格: kind-hearted/easy-going/hard-working","情感升级: cheerful/over the moon/with tears in the eyes","五感法: 视听触嗅味各备一句","动作链: 三个连续动词推进画面"],"example":"例题： 升级句子： I was happy when I heard the news. 解析： 升级为 To my joy, I jumped with excitement when I heard the good news.。用「具体动作+升级情感词」替代单一的happy，画面感立现。","extension":"进阶： 情感外化(不直说情绪，用动作神态呈现)： 不写I was nervous，改写My hands were sweating and my legs felt like jelly.；这是读后续写的核心笔法。","traps":"错误一： 通篇重复happy/sad/good。错误二： 堆形容词无动作画面。错误三： 描写与议论文体错配。错误四： 情感词褒贬用反。","examFocus":"记叙文(难忘经历/我身边的人)高频话题的上分点。得分关键： 一篇作文至少两处「升级描写」。","tags":["写作高分","描写词汇"],"difficulty":2,"type":"extension"},{"uid":"english-31-6","title":"过渡衔接: 起承转合衔接词体系","content":"作文结构的「四大关节」口诀： 「起引题，承接展，转对比，合点题」。①起(开头)： At first, To begin with, First of all——引出话题或表明观点；高级开篇句： As we all know, ...(众所周知)；With the development of...(随着...的发展)： With the development of the Internet, our life has changed a lot. ②承(展开)： Besides, What is more, In addition, Moreover；举例： For example, such as；时间推进： First...Second...Then...Finally... ③转(对比)： However, but, on the other hand, while；让步： Though...；对比范文句： On the one hand, playing games helps us relax. On the other hand, spending too much time on them is harmful. ④合(结尾)： In a word, In short, All in all, In conclusion；呼吁： Let us...；展望： I believe that...： In a word, reading makes a full man. Let us read more good books! 检查口诀： 「每段一个衔接词，首尾必须有总起总结」。例句： ①To begin with, we should make a study plan. ②Finally, we need to check the answers carefully.。衔接词是评分老师第一眼扫描的对象，缺了直接降档。","keyPoints":["起: To begin with/As we all know/With the development of...","承: Besides/What is more/For example","转: However/On the other hand/Though","合: In a word/All in all/Let us...","每段至少一个衔接词，首尾总起总结必备"],"example":"例题： 在段落间填入合适衔接词： Our school will hold a reading week. ______, there will be a book exchange on Monday. ______, a famous writer will give a talk on Wednesday. ______, the reading week will end with a poem party on Friday. 解析： 依次填First/Then/Finally，三段活动按时间推进。时间类衔接词让叙述有序。","extension":"进阶： 高级开篇With the development of...与结尾In conclusion...组合是议论文万能骨架；但切忌每篇都用同一种开头，轮换才显功底。","traps":"错误一： 通篇无衔接词。错误二： however后忘逗号。错误三： 衔接词与逻辑不符(转折处用了besides)。错误四： 结尾缺总结句戛然而止。","examFocus":"书面表达结构分权重最高；衔接词直接决定档次。得分关键： 背四大关节各两词，段落各安其位。","tags":["写作高分","衔接词"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-31-7","title":"应用文要点扩写: 一点两句法","content":"应用文最怕「要点翻译腔」，扩写口诀： 「每个要点，一实一虚」。一点两句法： 把每个题目要点展开成两句——第一句「实」(直陈要点)，第二句「虚」(补充细节/原因/感受)。示范(邀请信要点： 时间+地点+活动)： 实句 The party will be held in our classroom at 3:00 pm on Friday. 虚句 We will sing, dance and play games together, and I am sure you will enjoy it. 三种虚句方向： ①加原因： ...because it can help us relax. ②加感受： I am looking forward to it. ③加影响： It will be a good chance to make friends. 词数控制： 中考应用文80词上下，开头(1句)+三要点(每点2句)+结尾(1句)=8句左右，正好达标。范文骨架： Dear Tom, 开头I am writing to tell you...；要点段落(一点两句)；结尾 I hope you can come. / Looking forward to your reply. Yours, Li Hua. 例句： ①The talk will begin at 4:00 pm in the school hall.(实) ②The speaker will share his experience of studying abroad, which I think will be helpful.(虚)。扩写让要点饱满，杜绝「电报体」。","keyPoints":["一点两句: 实句陈要点+虚句补细节","虚句三方向: 原因/感受/影响","词数公式: 开头1句+要点每点2句+结尾1句","邀请信三要素: 时间/地点/活动","结尾用I hope.../Looking forward to..."],"example":"例题： 扩写要点「活动： 种树」(植树节通知)： 解析： 实句 We will plant trees on the hill behind the school. 虚句 By doing this, we can not only make our town greener but also learn to work together.。一实一虚，字数与档次双达标。","extension":"进阶： 虚句中嵌入高级句式(定从/非谓语)，把扩写句变成「得分句」： ...which I think will be helpful. / Making our town greener, we will feel proud.","traps":"错误一： 只翻译要点成「电报体」。错误二： 虚句跑题(补充与要点无关内容)。错误三： 词数不足或超标。错误四： 忘写称呼落款被扣格式分。","examFocus":"应用文是书面表达第一题(邀请/建议/通知轮考)。得分关键： 要点全覆盖+每点一实一虚。","tags":["写作高分","应用文"],"difficulty":2,"type":"core"},{"uid":"english-31-8","title":"读后续写初步: 动作链与情绪描写","content":"读后续写(新趋势题型)的入门双工具。①动作链(让情节「动」起来)： 公式「连续三个具体动词+逗号推进」： I took a deep breath, walked onto the stage and began my speech.；动作链要「小步走」： rushed to the door, pushed it open and shouted for help.；避免一笔带过的概括词(go and do something)。②情绪外化(不直说情绪，用身体反应写情绪)： 紧张——My hands were sweating and my heart was beating fast.；开心——A big smile spread across her face.；难过——Tears welled up in the eyes. / My heart sank.；生气——His face turned red and he could not say a word. 续写三原则： ①承接原文(人称时态与上文一致；上文过去时则续写用过去时) ②呼应首段给出的线索(伏笔回收) ③结尾升华(收获/感悟)： That day, I learned that helping others is the best way to help ourselves. 例句： ①Looking around, I found everyone smiling at me.(动作+情绪) ②We hugged each other, with tears of joy in our eyes.(with结构)。先读后写，情节合理+描写细腻双达标。","keyPoints":["动作链: 连续三个具体动词推进画面","情绪外化: 用身体反应代替直说情绪","时态人称与原文保持一致(过去时为主)","回收原文伏笔，呼应前文线索","结尾升华: 收获/感悟一句话"],"example":"例题： 原文结尾段提示： The little boy looked at the coin in his hand and thought for a while... 续写第一句示范： He took a deep breath, walked back to the old man and held out the coin, saying sorry in a low voice.。动作链+直接引语让续写「有镜头」。","extension":"进阶： with复合结构与直接引语是续写两大利器： ...with tears of joy in the eyes. / I will never forget it, he said softly.；对话让叙事瞬间鲜活。","traps":"错误一： 时态与原文脱节(原文过去时续写用现在时)。错误二： 情节与前文伏笔矛盾。错误三： 只写动作无情绪(干巴)或只写情绪无动作(空洞)。错误四： 结尾不升华草草收场。","examFocus":"读后续写是书面表达新题型趋势(部分地区已考)。得分关键： 动作链+情绪外化+结尾升华三件套。","tags":["写作高分","读后续写"],"difficulty":3,"type":"extension"}]}]});
